:"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AP-Education/ap-chats/commits/aa3924d996a0d17bca76bde62797526494d4db60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:43:02Z","email":"97808006+pillowskiy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vladyslav Polishchuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:58:19Z","email":"97808006+pillowskiy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vladyslav Polishchuk"},"message":"fix(web): recover lost push subscriptions and keep them across sign-out\n\nBrowser push moves into one notifications feature on react-query: the\nregistration class, context, provider and re-export barrel are gone.\nSynchronizing recreates a subscription the browser lost or one made with a\nrotated VAPID key, unless the user turned push off. Signing out releases\nthe server registration through a generic auth sign-out task and keeps the\nbrowser subscription for the next sign-in. Registration no longer re-posts\non every window focus, only on visibility, reconnect and a 5-minute timer.\nPresence sends only { focused }.","tree":{"sha":"33fd94c6244d191396a9bc77d99b9b2472820f9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AP-Education/ap-chats/git/trees/33fd94c6244d191396a9bc77d99b9b2472820f9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AP-Education/ap-chats/git/commits/aa3924d996a0d17bca76bde62797526494d4db60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97808006?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pillowskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith