the catalog to a single\nBenford card. Drops upcomingApplets + UpcomingApplet type, the App.tsx\nrendering branch, the applets.test.ts coverage, and the\n.applet-card.is-upcoming / .applet-status CSS rules.","tree":{"sha":"98bda4651e1b8e025fe0d6b902cc3cdf32011693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/trees/98bda4651e1b8e025fe0d6b902cc3cdf32011693"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/commits/0cc91f9530c6f422386ccd9b6538d600fe7e623e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7546100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23","id":7546100,"login":"govindgnair23","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDYxMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/0cc91f9530c6f422386ccd9b6538d600fe7e623e","node_id":"C_kwDOUtLuUdoAKDBjYzkxZjk1MzBjNmY0MjIzODZjY2Q5YjY1MzhkNjAwZmU3ZTYyM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682","sha":"e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682"}],"sha":"0cc91f9530c6f422386ccd9b6538d600fe7e623e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/0cc91f9530c6f422386ccd9b6538d600fe7e623e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7546100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23","id":7546100,"login":"govindgnair23","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDYxMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:34:16Z","email":"govindgnair23@gmail.com","name":"Govind Nair"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:34:16Z","email":"govindgnair23@gmail.com","name":"Govind Nair"},"message":"feat(ux): tier 2 polish — tablet breakpoint, favicon, sr summaries, form widgets\n\nPR 2 of the UX improvements: polish layer once the critical Tier 1 fixes\nlanded. No new design tokens; no visual-language changes.\n\n- Tablet breakpoint at max-width: 1024px: control-row, guidance-columns,\n  and diagnostic-summary collapse to 2 columns; catalog-intro min-height\n  drops from 320px to 240px. The existing 760px breakpoint now keeps\n  diagnostic-summary at 2x2 instead of collapsing to a 1x4 stack.\n- Favicon: minimal SVG glyph (six descending bars in --accent-deep) under\n  public/favicon.svg, wired up via <link rel=''icon''>. Title expanded to\n  ''StatQuest — Interactive Statistics & Probability Applets'' and the\n  meta description now mentions Benford.\n- Tab labels: ''What is Benford''s Law?'' / ''Why it Happens'' / ''Simulations''\n  → ''What it is'' / ''Why it happens'' / ''Simulations'' — parallel statement\n  form with sentence-case capitalization. The page H2 inside the What\n  tab keeps ''What is Benford''s Law?'' as its editorial heading.\n- Chart sr-summaries: FractionalLogHistogram, LogHistogram, and\n  OriginalValueHistogram each gain a visually-hidden <ul> listing bin\n  range and count for screen-reader users. Reuses a new .visually-hidden\n  utility class.\n- Form widget reskin: <select> elements get appearance: none plus an\n  inline-SVG chevron in --ink-label color; webkit number-input spinners\n  get opacity: 0.55 so they read as muted against the surface tokens.","tree":{"sha":"ba6714d9e6d9b873d94d0da36ca27bc0e24d233a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/trees/ba6714d9e6d9b873d94d0da36ca27bc0e24d233a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/commits/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7546100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23","id":7546100,"login":"govindgnair23","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDYxMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682","node_id":"C_kwDOUtLuUdoAKGU1NzgwMGM2ZmY2Y2VhNzdlMjM4OGIxZGU5M2U4ZWJlMzgwYTA2ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9","sha":"056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9"}],"sha":"e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/e57800c6ff6cea77e2388b1de93e8ebe380a0682"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7546100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23","id":7546100,"login":"govindgnair23","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDYxMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:27:59Z","email":"govindgnair23@gmail.com","name":"Govind Nair"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:27:59Z","email":"govindgnair23@gmail.com","name":"Govind Nair"},"message":"feat(ux): tier 1 polish — fix tab wrap, catalog framing, diagnostic clarity\n\nPR 1 of the UX improvements identified during the post-design-system\nvisual review. Six changes, all preserving the existing visual language:\n\n- Tab strip layout: .applet-heading switched from flex space-between to\n  grid stacked rows. Tabs now occupy their own row below the hero and\n  no longer wrap to two lines on viewports 760–1280px.\n- Page-tab hover affordance: inactive tabs lift onto --surface-sunken on\n  hover with a 120ms ease, so sighted users see the affordance without\n  needing keyboard focus.\n- Form input hover/focus border: control-panel inputs and selects shift\n  border-color on hover (--ink-label) and focus (--accent-warm). Outline\n  rule preserved for WCAG focus contrast.\n- Rerun defensive disabled state: SimulationLab wraps the seed update in\n  useTransition; SimulationControls passes the isPending flag to the\n  button''s disabled attribute. New .secondary-action:disabled CSS rule.\n- Diagnostic readout: every metric is now a consistent <span>+<strong>\n  pair. Tooltips on SD(log10 X) and Distance from Benford explain the\n  metrics for non-technical readers. Seed moved inline with the\n  explanation paragraph, separated by a hairline.\n- Catalog coming-soon: upcomingApplets registers CLT, Bayesian Updating,\n  and Linear Regression as muted cards beside the live Benford applet,\n  so the catalog reads as curated rather than half-built.","tree":{"sha":"ffe1256fd27852f6f8f7c2103e04fee71a67745b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/trees/ffe1256fd27852f6f8f7c2103e04fee71a67745b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/git/commits/056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7546100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23","id":7546100,"login":"govindgnair23","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDYxMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/govindgnair23","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/056f437a1e5b0e6602975206f9817ea0360db9b9","node_id":"C_kwDOUtLuUdoAKDA1NmY0MzdhMWU1YjBlNjYwMjk3NTIwNmY5ODE3ZWEwMzYwZGI5Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commit/bf00d2836820d2f0eb2a4d96e1d622598cfe52c3","sha":"bf00d2836820d2f0eb2a4d96e1d622598cfe52c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/govindgnair23/benford-distribution/commits/bf00d2836820d2f0eb2a4d96e1d6