","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(portal): páginas SCR-017, SCR-029 y SCR-030 de unidades (DTC-017/029/030)\n\nOrganización interna (solo lectura), registrar y editar nombre, cambiar\nunidad padre con resumen e historial, desactivar y reactivar con bloqueos\npor dependencias. Concurrencia con If-Match/row_version. mfe-collaborators\n350 pruebas (antes 227), 29 mutaciones detectadas.\n\nBloqueo: SCR-017-02 no implementado (la organización interna se carga por\nmigración, BR-PTY-28). Falta «Fecha desde» en el alta (la API no la acepta).\nSin verificar en navegador ni contra el BFF real.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d128d6e47e1176709611c5261b05fb178ad1bf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/6d128d6e47e1176709611c5261b05fb178ad1bf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/31382145e6fedf9a7eb77a3b11f35b2be088b38b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/31382145e6fedf9a7eb77a3b11f35b2be088b38b","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDMxMzgyMTQ1ZTZmZWRmOWE3ZWI3N2EzYjExZjM1YjJiZTA4OGIzOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06","sha":"f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06"}],"sha":"31382145e6fedf9a7eb77a3b11f35b2be088b38b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/31382145e6fedf9a7eb77a3b11f35b2be088b38b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:15:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:15:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(shell): ítem «Unidades organizacionales» en el menú lateral (DCP-004)\n\nSección PERSONAS, tras «Colaboradores», solo para jefe_ingenieria y admin,\ncon icono aria-hidden y aria-current en la ruta más específica (antes\n«Colaboradores» también se marcaba activo en /colaboradores/unidades).\nTexto, orden e icono tomados de la hoja consolidada de Stitch de SCR-028-01.\n8 pruebas nuevas (shell 11).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5ee85f921af609e7261c8125e5dc44639b7ef64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/d5ee85f921af609e7261c8125e5dc44639b7ef64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGY0YTlmYTA1NmJmZjkyOGNjYzkxMTE1NTYzNDA2YjMyMjExYWFjMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/d3f428213bb7aba90bae7e8e492e60988bc3ee30","sha":"d3f428213bb7aba90bae7e8e492e60988bc3ee30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d3f428213bb7aba90bae7e8e492e60988bc3ee30"}],"sha":"f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/f4a9fa056bff928ccc91115563406b32211aac06"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d3f428213bb7aba90bae7e8e492e60988bc3ee30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:07:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:07:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(portal): página SCR-028-01, lista y jerarquía de unidades (DT