9c28cc6e8478e8497e51","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGQ2NTVhMTgxZmE3YWYwZTM3NWI1OWMyOGNjNmU4NDc4ZTg0OTdlNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c","sha":"0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c"}],"sha":"d655a181fa7af0e375b59c28cc6e8478e8497e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d655a181fa7af0e375b59c28cc6e8478e8497e51"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:06:11Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:06:11Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(design): exploración Stitch y accesibilidad de la gestión de unidades organizacionales\n\nPrueba real de ux-ui-orchestrator sobre UXR-017/028/029/030 (FLW y SCR ya\ncommiteados antes).\n\n- GEN-017/028/029/030: exploración en Stitch (STP-PPM-001, Comsatel Styled,\n  acción REUSE). 9 de 12 pantallas verificadas con get_screen y registradas en\n  DTM-PPM-001. SCR-029-03, SCR-029-04 y SCR-030-04 sin localizar, no registradas.\n- 7 ARP de accesibilidad (revisión estática del HTML de Stitch, WCAG 2.2 AA): las\n  9 pantallas en fail; foco, teclado y zoom inconclusive. Ninguno verified.\n- UXS-001 con veredictos por consumidor (Stitch y QA CONDITIONAL; Figma y\n  Desarrollo NOT READY) y anexo con las 77 preguntas abiertas fusionadas en 44,\n  21 de ellas de negocio para af-requirements-orchestrator.\n- UXR-005/006: se retiran las referencias a US-009 y US-007, que no existen en\n  requirement/user-stories.\n- Repara los enlaces de index.md y changelog.md hacia estos archivos.\n- graphify-out actualizado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7f4b1b67ab2f456c513425397925fd8a07b7fbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/a7f4b1b67ab2f456c513425397925fd8a07b7fbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDBjYTQ2ZGVkNjYxZmI0MzFiNTI0YzMxYjM2OTg0OTNiNmVhNDVmMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea","sha":"e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea"}],"sha":"0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/0ca46ded661fb431b524c31b3698493b6ea45f0c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:00:56Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T20:00:56Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(skills): ux-ui-orchestrator, orquestador de la pista UX/UI\n\nEquivalente de af-requirements-orchestrator para la etapa de diseño. Orquesta\nux-requirements-analyzer, user-flow-designer, ui-spec-writer,\nweb-atomic-component-designer, stitch-ui-generator, claude-design-orchestrator,\nfigma-design-validator, accessibility-reviewer y ux-development-handoff.\n\n- Flujo en 8 pasos con 7 escenarios (A-G), compuertas por fase y ruteo de\n  hallazgos al skill dueño; las decisiones humanas (alternativas, divergencia\n  Stitch-Figma, aprobación de diseño gobernado y del gate) nunca se asumen.\n- scripts/audit_ux.py: auditoría determinista de trazabilidad FLW-SCR, campos\n  obligatorios de SCR, referencias externas, DTM y ARP.\n- Referencias de escenarios, calidad y preparación por consumidor (Stitch,\n  Figma, Desarrollo, QA), protocolo de worktree ux/<slug> y plantilla de UXS.\n- graphify-out actualizado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ce2fb3923f9cfc3fea4c64856a994124919465f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/6ce2fb3923f9cfc3fea4c64856a994124919465f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGU4NmQ1YmM2MDJjYjVmYzhmMjIzZGJmYjRkMmJhNDFlY2ViY2NhZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/1a751703bb2329cad8403449d8460864f3c6667f","sha":"1a751703bb2329cad8403449d8460864f3c6667f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/1a751703bb2329cad8403449d8460864f3c6667f"}],"sha":"e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e86d5bc602cb5fc8f223dbfb4d2ba41ecebccaea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/1a751703bb2329cad8403449d8460864f3c6667f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:56:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:56:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(kb): IMD-002 R-31/R-32 (contacto y régimen tributario de la organización) y propuesta v3 de API-SPEC-002\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3521fcc214d6d2fd9ff4fc930566b