a1619a5d9ec79e0a2686dfd0ad0edf3a27e955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/83a1619a5d9ec79e0a2686dfd0ad0edf3a27e955"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/403244870340f8a0c812154b119b958320e71d7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:56:27Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:56:27Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(skills): af-requirements-orchestrator para orquestar los skills af-* de requerimientos\n\nOrquesta context builder, glosario, reglas, modelo conceptual y user stories hasta una Especificacion de Requerimientos con trazabilidad y compuertas humanas. Incluye referencias (criterios de calidad, preparacion por rol, escenarios, protocolo de worktree), plantilla y un script de auditoria.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd93b1a08aebe65ef8ed1848840e6ae97b291403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/fd93b1a08aebe65ef8ed1848840e6ae97b291403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/403244870340f8a0c812154b119b958320e71d7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/403244870340f8a0c812154b119b958320e71d7d","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDQwMzI0NDg3MDM0MGY4YTBjODEyMTU0YjExOWI5NTgzMjBlNzFkN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367","sha":"3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367"}],"sha":"403244870340f8a0c812154b119b958320e71d7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/403244870340f8a0c812154b119b958320e71d7d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/5d565a3ddbf19ebfe43089033ab09aa33806281b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:55:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:55:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(kb): catalogo de cursos con filtros (RCP-004, US-026, US-027, RQS-001)\n\nCaso de prueba de af-requirements-orchestrator (escenario B) sobre la\nvisualizacion de cursos con filtros para el Colaborador.\n\n- RCP-004: contexto, NOT READY para historias (15 vacios)\n- BRC-001: BR-FOR-11/12 (propuestas sin validar), BR-FOR-13 a 17 (vacios), P-55 a P-60\n- GLS-001: TRM-0106 Curso, GQ-38 (catalogo de cursos frente a TRM-0007)\n- IMD-001: enlaza TRM-0106; el catalogo de cursos es una vista, IM-Q13\n- US-026 y US-027: CONDITIONAL\n- RQS-001: preparacion por rol (Arquitecto, QA y UX/UI CONDITIONAL; Developer NOT READY)\n- graphify-out/ regenerado con graphify update .\n\nTodo en draft; D1 y D2 pendientes de validacion del Responsable de dominio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a2ea7d6f60c9eb6ff5cd81dc05c573008c3532d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/2a2ea7d6f60c9eb6ff5cd81dc05c573008c3532d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/5d565a3ddbf19ebfe43089033ab09aa33806281b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/5d565a3ddbf19ebfe43089033ab09aa33806281b","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDVkNTY1YTNkZGJmMTllYmZlNDMwODkwMzNhYjA5YWEzMzgwNjI4MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/737957527e87e8b0418e2784d5e12498698979c8","sha":"737957527e87e8b0418e2784d5e12498698979c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/737957527e87e8b0418e2784d5e12498698979c8"}],"sha":"5d565a3ddbf19ebfe43089033ab09aa33806281b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/5d565a3ddbf19ebfe43089033ab09aa33806281b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:47:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:47:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(kb): diseno de US-016 (SCR, CMP, GEN, DTM) y regeneracion de SCR-015 en Comsatel Styled\n\n- SCR-016 (6 pantallas), IB-016 y CMP-016 (11 componentes), con las decisiones de ianache (pagina, telefono con pais y bandera, vigencia inmediata, historial solo Jefe y colaborador).\n- BR-PTY-12 y US-016: los datos simples conservan su historia con auditoria.\n- GEN-016 y GEN-015: pantallas Stitch generadas y registradas en DTM-PPM-001, revision critica y hallazgos abiertos (SCR-016-02 sin los estados de validacion del correo; tema por defecto del proyecto aun en Sovereign Enterprise).\n- Indice y changelog actualizados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f8d392dbce5c7b9741d698dac8fdf5c3dc58c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/3f8d392dbce5c7b9741d698dac8fdf5c3dc58c27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/3f53f075771e6db59d7c303cb9b715e135ef1367","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDNmNTNmMDc1NzcxZTZkYjU5ZDdjMzAzY2I5YjcxNWUxMzVlZjEzNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e107051bb217164862f75ab45b70b4d6a67ca31d",