lution to gitlab-work-publisher\n\n- Create kb_resolver.py utility for dynamic knowledge base URL construction\n- Use kb_project_id from product-project-map.yaml as source of truth for KB URLs\n- Automatically normalize file paths: requirements/ → knowledge-base/requirement/\n- Update product-project-map.yaml with kb_project_id for all products\n- Modify issue_renderer.py to regenerate URLs using kb_project_id when available\n- Update publish_issue.py to pass kb_project_id to renderer\n- Add KB_RESOLUTION.md documentation\n\nBenefits:\n- URLs are no longer hardcoded in OKF files\n- Single source of truth: product-project-map.yaml\n- Automatic path normalization supports new folder structure\n- Backward compatible with existing OKF files\n\nExample kb_project_id:\n  devqa-juniors: ''comsatel/development/training/dev-juniors/knowledge-base''\n  → generates: https://gitlab.comsatel.com.pe/knowledge/comsatel/development/training/dev-juniors/knowledge-base","tree":{"sha":"5f0c56d79d30ad8f4ab43885b5b8a1a3f6a09abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/5f0c56d79d30ad8f4ab43885b5b8a1a3f6a09abe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/82897fc427bd2303461edce16bb6da8207171b30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/82897fc427bd2303461edce16bb6da8207171b30","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDgyODk3ZmM0MjdiZDIzMDM0NjFlZGNlMTZiYjZkYTgyMDcxNzFiMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217","sha":"e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217"}],"sha":"82897fc427bd2303461edce16bb6da8207171b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/82897fc427bd2303461edce16bb6da8207171b30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:16:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:16:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: recreate and republish consolidated party management stories to devqa-juniors\n\n- Restore US-015-025 consolidated stories (RCP-003 Party Management)\n- Update OKF frontmatter to google-okf-v0.2 format with full metadata\n- Add required fields: sources, human-reviewed, product (devqa-juniors)\n- Publish to GitLab devqa-juniors project (605/3)\n- Update knowledge graph with refreshed graph structure (2085 nodes, 2778 edges)\n\nLineage: concept US-015-025 ↔ GitLab issue 605/3\nGate Status: REQUIREMENTS_READY\nScope: Party master data management (US-015 to US-025)","tree":{"sha":"2f69613a0fc4453219bfd9989bcbeda79970fa9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/2f69613a0fc4453219bfd9989bcbeda79970fa9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGU2NDM5NWE5Y2Y2YWJhZjdjMjk3NmY3MGFmZDJiYjNlZWE2MzAyMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981","sha":"ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981"}],"sha":"e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e64395a9cf6abaf7c2976f70afd2bb3eea630217"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:53:55Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:53:55Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: analyze RCP-003 and publish US-015-025 consolidated stories to devqa-juniors\n\n- Create OKF v0.2 artifact (US-015-025-party-management.okf.md) with proper metadata\n- Consolidate 11 user stories (US-015 to US-025) for party master data management\n- Analyze requirements: actors, business rules (BR-PTY-01 to BR-PTY-20), dependencies\n- Publish consolidated story to GitLab devqa-juniors project (issue_iid: 2)\n- Identify critical dependencies: org structure (C3), vendors (C4), Keycloak auth (ADR-002)\n- Document open questions: default competency levels, anonymization period, permission matrix\n- Update knowledge graph to reflect RCP-003 lineage and OKF publication\n\nScope: Party master data (people, organizations, roles, identifications, contacts, vigencies, anonymization)\nGate Status: REQUIREMENTS_READY\nPublication Target: devqa-juniors (GitLab project_id: 605)\nLineage: OKF concept (US-015-025) ↔ GitLab issue (605/2)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"715e9d86cfee1b6a3796d3aac46e3324c4e60b73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/715e9d86cfee1b6a3796d3aac46e3324c4e60b73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGVjNzAyOTJiNmRhYjE4NGMyZTExYzgzYTgyYjcwNzg2MTY5MWY5ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9","sha":"8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9"}],"sha":"ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ec70292b6dab184c2e11c83a82b707861691f981"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:59:31Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:59:31Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: update Archify troubleshooting with HTML viewer solution\n\n- Document npx archify serve CLI failure (\"could not determine executable\")\n- Promote viewer.html as primary solution (Option 1) - works now\n- Reorder alternatives: HTML viewer > Web UI > Docker > Markdown\n- Add 4 diagrams to available files (including cache-miss-sequence)\n- Clarify that JSONs are ready for finalize once Archify is fixed\n- Update recommendations to use viewer.html immediately\n\nStatus: finalize bug and npx issue both blocking CLI, but HTML viewer +\nASCII specifications fully functional. JSONs are complete and validated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7604c87d7aab3c84d0bae1d231f6e4ba33c7d48a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/7604c87d7aab3c84d0bae1d231f6e4ba33c7d48a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDg3MDJmMzAwYWIzMWQ3NGFkN2I5OTUwYTNhNTNiMGExOGEyZDI5Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/e073371a121d9320f197fcfd865ac435544b8871","sha":"e073371a121d9320f197fcfd865ac435544b8871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e073371a121d9320f197fcfd865ac435544b8871"}],"sha":"8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8702f300ab31d74ad7b9950a3a53b0a18a2d29b9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/e073371a121d9320f197fcfd865ac435544b8871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:47:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:47:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: add cache-miss sequence diagram and update visualizer\n\n- Add 04-cache-miss-sequence.json with web request flow (Browser → API → Redis → PostgreSQL)\n- Update viewer.html with new Cache Miss tab showing ASCII diagram\n- Update INDEX.md with cache-miss sequence specification and generation command\n- Update README.md to reflect 4 Archify candidates instead of 3\n- Include in all horizon coverage matrices (H1-H3)\n- Update knowledge graph via graphify\n\nThe sequence diagram demonstrates:\n- Cache hit path optimization (7-10ms with Redis)\n- Cache miss fallback pattern (100-500ms to database)\n- TTL-based cache replenishment (3600s)\n- Applicable to high-volume queries: catalog, collaborators, roles, H3 AI proposals\n\nWorkaround: Archify finalize CLI blocked by persistent receipt-publication bug.\nUsing ASCII + HTML viewer instead (documented in ARCHIFY-TROUBLESHOOTING.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fde65213b140fcad78f9ad878b08e10ff14b3a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/fde65213b140fcad78f9ad878b08e10ff14b3a11"},"url":"https://api.github.c