mits/cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c"}],"sha":"a904c61580dafcca4b2e9881f8c107e5891a54f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/a904c61580dafcca4b2e9881f8c107e5891a54f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:43:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:43:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"test: add Postman collection + updated docker-compose for manual testing\n\n- Party-Management-Service.postman_collection.json: 14 test scenarios\n  * Happy path: Create, Get, List, Update\n  * Error cases: Duplicate (409), Invalid (422), SQL injection (422), Missing fields (422)\n  * Security: Authorization (403), IDOR (403), Response filtering\n  * Health checks: Liveness, Readiness\n\n- TESTING.md: Complete testing guide\n  * Quick start with docker-compose\n  * Postman import and execution steps\n  * 14 test scenarios with expected results\n  * cURL examples as alternative\n  * Performance targets and cleanup\n\n- docker-compose.yml: Enhanced with\n  * Health checks for both services\n  * Proper dependency ordering (postgres ready before api)\n  * Container names for easy reference\n  * Correct API environment config\n\nReady for manual validation. All CRUD endpoints testable with provided Postman collection.\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5da3e21abe365f532145934ef2a0d4b7e40b456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/b5da3e21abe365f532145934ef2a0d4b7e40b456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGNhZTY4ZWJmZTRkZTAxYmZiYjkyNmU1MGY4ZGJjODZiZWU1MjYxNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/64b88a3ee2253c20af8597730ddf85c30f501db0","sha":"64b88a3ee2253c20af8597730ddf85c30f501db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/64b88a3ee2253c20af8597730ddf85c30f501db0"}],"sha":"cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/cae68ebfe4de01bfbb926e50f8dbc86bee52614c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/64b88a3ee2253c20af8597730ddf85c30f501db0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:40:10Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:40:10Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(phase1a): Task 14 - Dependency fixes and configuration defaults\n\n- Add default values to Config for testing (SQLite in-memory)\n- Add aiosqlite dependency for SQLite support\n- Fix engine.py to not use pool_size/pool_timeout with SQLite\n- Update requirements.txt with valid package versions (PyJWT 2.15.0)\n\nPhase 1a implementation complete:\n- 14 tasks executed (Scaffolding → Deployment)\n- All 4 PARTY endpoints ready (POST, GET, GET/{id}, PATCH)\n- Core architecture: Auth (Keycloak), Authorization (RBAC), Models, Schemas, Services\n- Testing infrastructure: pytest fixtures, integration tests, security tests\n- Deployment: Dockerfile, docker-compose, README\n\nCode quality: mypy strict type hints, Pydantic v2 validation\nSecurity: SQL injection prevention, RBAC enforcement, response filtering\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4372d53a2a08b7fb374c91836639de7c59933b4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/4372d53a2a08b7fb374c91836639de