yment files (Dockerfile, docker-compose, README)\n\nAll 4 PARTY endpoints ready. Database schema auto-created on startup.\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fdb4f60799b74c509634b88358fcf8fdd9fb4dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/2fdb4f60799b74c509634b88358fcf8fdd9fb4dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/d00fc05b502d83efa46f76e55b8930741d8867d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/d00fc05b502d83efa46f76e55b8930741d8867d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGQwMGZjMDViNTAyZDgzZWZhNDZmNzZlNTViODkzMDc0MWQ4ODY3ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f","sha":"debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f"}],"sha":"d00fc05b502d83efa46f76e55b8930741d8867d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d00fc05b502d83efa46f76e55b8930741d8867d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:13:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:13:21Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore(phase1a): Task 1 - Project scaffolding and dependencies\n\n- Create pyproject.toml with all Python/FastAPI dependencies (0.104.1)\n- Create requirements.txt with dev extras\n- Create directory structure: app/{core,models,schemas,services,routers,database}, tests/{unit,integration,security}\n- Create .gitignore and .env.example for local development\n\nAll __init__.py files created. Ready for Task 2 (Config).\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"526a9bdc63d9527a9bb55ed04ee5c23940823639","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/526a9bdc63d9527a9bb55ed04ee5c23940823639"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGRlYmJhZDMyMGNlMzRkNTdhZTc1ODA0ZjRhZjk5NjVlMTQ4ZDc5NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88","sha":"67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88"}],"sha":"debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/debbad320ce34d57ae75804f4af9965e148d795f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:11:54Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:11:54Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"plan: detailed Phase 1a implementation plan (14 tasks, 40 hours)\n\nPhase 1a: PARTY endpoints (Week 1)\n\nTasks breakdown:\n1. Scaffolding + dependencies (pyproject.toml, requirements.txt)\n2. Configuration (Pydantic BaseSettings)\n3. Keycloak JWT authentication middleware\n4. RBAC authorization (check_jefe_ingeniera, check_party_access)\n5. Custom exceptions + dependency injection\n6. structlog JSON logging + SQLAlchemy async engine\n7. Party SQLAlchemy model (tb_party)\n8. Pydantic DTOs (PartyCreateRequest, response filtering)\n9. PartyService (CRUD + validation + audit logging)\n10. FastAPI endpoints (POST, GET, GET/{id}, PATCH)\n11. Integration tests + fixtures\n12. Security tests (SQL injection, authorization, rate limiting)\n13. Deployment files (Dockerfile, docker-compose, README)\n14. Full test run + coverage report\n\nEach task includes concrete code examples, expected outputs, and atomic commits.\n\nEstimated effort: 40 hours (Mon-Fri, Week 1)\nSuccess criteria: All 4 endpoints + 80% test coverage + 0 security findings\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fe1812a7c092da27f069e675f5f3a1a9367dadb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/4fe1812a7c092da27f069e675f5f3a1a9367dadb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDY3ZDVhZDM0MGIxNTQwNDA5YzY3OWI0OTY0ZWM3ZWEyYjM0YjJmODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390","sha":"58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390"}],"sha":"67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/67d5ad340b1540409c679b4964ec7ea2b34b2f88"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:04:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:04:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Spec: Party Management Service implementation design (Phase 1a-1b + 2-5 roadmap)\n\nValidated design artifact covering:\n- Monolith architecture in codebase/apps/domains/party-management-service/\n- Python/FastAPI stack (ADR-008 binding rule)\n- Data models (SQLAlchemy async), schemas (Pydantic v2), services, routers\n- Security: Keycloak PKCE, RBAC, response filtering (P-52), rate limiting (slowapi)\n- Testing: Unit + Integration + Security tests (SRC-001 findings remediated)\n- Deployment: Docker + docker-compose + GitHub Actions CI/CD\n- 6-week roadmap: Phase 1a (PARTY) → 1b (ORGANIZATION) → 2-5 (roles, keycloak-link, anonimización, observability)\n\nAll 4 brainstorming design sections approved by Jefe de Ingeniería.\nReady for implementation plan (writing-plans skill).\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"884f462629cd56c7fff06707fb0764fe0f0d382c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/884f462629cd56c7fff06707fb0764fe0f0d382c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDU4ZWU0ZmFhNTgwZGI3YTFkMGQ2MTI2MDViY2IxZGYwYWE2N2MzOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b","sha":"9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b"}],"sha":"58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/58ee4faa580db7a1d0d612605bcb1df0aa67c390"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:52:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:52:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Revisar seguridad de API-SPEC-001: SRC-001\n\nEvaluación exhaustiva OWASP Top 10 + autenticación + autorización + data exposure\n\nHALLAZGOS: 7 total\n\n🟠 MEDIUM (3): Remediables en Phase 1\n  ✓ SRC-001-001: Rate limiting no vinculante (spec → implementar con slowapi)\n  ✓ SRC-001-002: SQL injection protection (agregar enum validation + test)\n  ✓ SRC-001-003: Authorization bypass via IDOR (agregar early auth check + timing test)\n\n🟢 LOW (2): Remediables en Phase 1 o Phase 2\n  ✓ SRC-001-004: PII visibility no enforced en response (agregar schemas separados)\n  ✓ SRC-001-005: PII puede filtrarse en logs de anonimización (agregar logging rules)\n\n✅ INFO (2): Acknowledged, no bloquea\n  ✓ SRC-001-006: CSRF protection ✅ PASS (SameSite=Strict handles)\n  ✓ SRC-001-007: Timing attack (low risk, acknowledged)\n\nOWASP Top 10 Coverage:\n\n✅ A01 Broken Access Control: RBAC + auth middleware (+ finding-003 remediation)\n✅ A02 Cryptographic Failures: HTTP-only cookies + TLS\n✅ A03 Injection: SQLAlchemy ORM (+ finding-002 remediation)\n✅ A04 Insecure Design: Keycloak OIDC\n✅ A05 Security Misconfiguration: FastAPI defaults secure\n✅ A06 Vulnerable Components: Python/FastAPI latest (ADR-008)\n✅ A07 Authentication Failures: Keycloak PKCE (ADR-002, ADR-005)\n✅ A08 Data Integrity Failures: Transacciones atómicas\n✅ A09 Logging & Monitoring: structlog + prometheus (Phase 5)\n✅ A10 SSRF: N/A (no external API calls)\n\nAUTENTICACIÓN (Keycloak PKCE — ADR-002, ADR-005):\n\n✅ SECURE\n  • Tokens en HTTP-only cookies (XSS protection)\n  • SameSite=Strict cookies (CSRF protection)\n  • Secure flag en production\n  • 30-minute expiration\n  • X-User-Name header auditable\n\nAUTORIZACIÓN (RBAC):\n\n✅ SECURE (+ finding-003 remediation)\n  • Jefe de Ingeniería: read/write all parties\n  • Colaborador: read self + partial write (teléfono/perfiles)\n  • Evaluador: read-only (para contexto de proyecto)\n  • Anon: no access\n\n  Matriz documentada; early auth check required (finding-003)\n\nDATA EXPOSURE & PII:\n\n✅ SECURE (+ finding-004 remediation)\n  • Anonimización irreversible after 90 días (C10, C11)\n  • Visibilidad P-52 enforced (limited response schemas)\n  • Audit trail inmutable\n  • Error messages no leaked\n\n  Response schema filtering required (finding-004)\n\nABUSE CONTROLS:\n\n⚠️ Rate limiting spec required (finding-001)\n  • GET: 1000 req/hora\n  • POST /parties: 100 req/hora\n  • POST /anonymize: 10 req/hora\n\n✅ Input validation: Pydantic enums + EmailStr + UUID\n\nVIGENCIAS & TEMPORAL LOGIC:\n\n✅ SECURE\n  • Transacciones atómicas (close + open = una TX)\n  • No backdating (from_date = today siempre)\n  • Audit trail completo\n\nTESTING STRATEGY:\n\n7 security tests (agregar a DCP-001 Phase 1):\n  ✓ test_sql_injection_protection (finding-002)\n  ✓ test_authorization_bypass_idor (finding-003)\n  ✓ test_limited_response_no_pii (finding-004)\n  ✓ test_anonymization_no_pii_in_logs (finding-005)\n  ✓ test_rate_limiting_post_parties (finding-001)\n  ✓ test_rate_limiting_anonymize (finding-001)\n  ✓ test_http_only_cookie (finding-006)\n\nTHREAT MODEL:\n\n9 amenazas documentadas + mitigaciones:\n  ✅ XSS: HTTP-only cookies\n  ✅ CSRF: SameSite=Strict\n  ✅ SQL Injection: ORM + validation\n  ✅ Auth bypass: Keycloak signature validation\n  ✅ Unauthorized access: RBAC\n  ✅ PII leakage (response): Schema filtering\n  ✅ PII leakage (logs): Logging rules\n  ⚠️ Rate limit bypass: Rate limiting middleware\n  ✅ Timing attack: Acknowledged, low risk\n\nROADMAP:\n\nPhase 1: Implementar todas las remediaciones (5 hallazgos)\nPhase 5: Verificar observability logging (SRC-001-005)\n\nStatus: ✅ REQUIRES_REVIEW (remediaciones en Phase 1)\nRecomendación: ✅ APPROVE FOR DEVELOPMENT\n\n0 CRITICAL, 0 HIGH → sin bloqueadores\n3 MEDIUM + 2 LOW → todos remediables en Phase 1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbcc761570b01cee47e07c02d61fcefdc4ede4c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/dbcc761570b01cee47e07c02d61fcefdc4ede4c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDliMjRiMWM0NDkxNjAxZjM0NDNkYWQ0YmNjOTdjZGExNzEwOTMzNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8","sha":"8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8"}],"sha":"9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9b24b1c4491601f3443dad4bcc97cda17109334b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:48:59Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:48:59Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Handoff de desarrollo: DCP-001 + ADR-008 (Python/FastAPI como estándar)\n\nDCP-001: Development Context Pack completo para API-SPEC-001\n\nEntrega organizada en 5 fases (6 semanas):\n\nPhase 1 (Sem 1-2): Core PARTY + ORGANIZATION\n  ✅ POST/GET/PATCH /parties\n  ✅ POST/GET/PATCH /organizations\n  ✅ Autenticación Keycloak + Auth middleware\n\nPhase 2 (Sem 3): ROLE-ASSIGNMENT + PROGRAM-ROLE\n  ✅ POST /parties/{id}/role-assignments (Vigencias, sin sobrescritura)\n  ✅ POST /parties/{id}/program-roles (Evaluador, Jefe)\n\nPhase 3 (Sem 4): KEYCLOAK-LINK + Integration Tests\n  ✅ PATCH /parties/{id}/keycloak-link\n  ✅ E2E tests: flujo completo\n\nPhase 4 (Sem 5): ANONYMIZATION + Scheduler\n  ✅ POST /parties/{id}/anonymize (Irreversible after 90 días)\n  ✅ Cron job: Notificaciones\n\nPhase 5 (Sem 6): OBSERVABILITY\n  ✅ Métricas Prometheus\n  ✅ Logs JSON estructurados\n  ✅ Dashboards Grafana\n\nTECH STACK (Python/FastAPI — ADR-008):\n\nObligatorio:\n  • Runtime: Python 3.11+\n  • Framework: FastAPI 0.100+\n  • ORM: SQLAlchemy 2.0+ (async)\n  • Validación: Pydantic v2\n  • Auth: python-keycloak + PyJWT\n  • Logging: structlog + python-json-logger\n  • Métricas: prometheus-client\n  • Testing: pytest + httpx + pytest-asyncio\n\nRecomendado:\n  • Code Quality: ruff + black\n  • Type Checking: mypy (strict mode)\n  • DB Migrations: Alembic\n  • Async: asyncio + aiohttp\n\nTESTING:\n\n✅ Contract tests: happy path + error cases\n  • Email duplicado → 409\n  • Identificación duplicada → 409\n  • Sin permisos → 403\n  • Validación schema → 400\n\n✅ Vigencias (Sin sobrescritura):\n  • POST rol L1 → L2\n  • Verificar L1.thru_date = L2.from_date\n  • Verificar L2.thru_date = NULL (vigente)\n\n✅ Anonimización (Irreversible):\n  • After 90 días inactivo\n  • PII borrado (no recuperable)\n  • Audit data retenido\n\n✅ Performance:\n  • POST /parties (5 roles): <1000ms\n  • GET /parties (1000 rows): <500ms\n  • GET /parties/{id}/history (100 eventos): <200ms\n\n✅ Security:\n  • OWASP Top 10 coverage\n  • Authorization (Jefe vs Colaborador)\n  • Rate limiting: 1000 req/hora\n\nESTRUCTURA PYTHON/FASTAPI:\n\napp/\n  main.py                  # FastAPI app\n  config.py                # Pydantic BaseSettings\n  core/\n    auth.py                # Keycloak middleware + X-User-Name\n    authorization.py       # RBAC (Jefe vs Colaborador)\n    exceptions.py          # Custom exceptions\n  models/\n    party.py               # SQLAlchemy async models\n    organization.py\n    role_assignment.py\n  schemas/\n    party.py               # Pydantic DTOs (request/response)\n    organization.py\n  services/\n    party_service.py       # Business logic\n    organization_service.py\n  routers/\n    parties.py             # Endpoints /api/v1/parties\n    organizations.py\n  database/\n    engine.py              # DB setup + async session\n  tests/\n    conftest.py            # pytest fixtures\n    unit/\n    integration/\n    e2e/\n\nCRITERIOS DE ÉXITO:\n\n✅ 100% cobertura US-015–025\n✅ Vigencias sin sobrescritura validadas\n✅ Auditoría completa (created_by, updated_by, timestamps)\n✅ Anonimización irreversible (after 90 días)\n✅ Autenticación Keycloak funcionando\n✅ Autorización RBAC correcta\n✅ Performance tests passing\n✅ Security tests passing\n✅ Observabilidad (métricas, logs, dashboards)\n\n---\n\nADR-008: Python + FastAPI como estándar vinculante para APIs REST\n\nDECISIÓN:\n\nCambio de Node.js/Express (ADR-001) a Python/FastAPI para:\n  ✅ Todas las nuevas APIs REST\n  ✅ BFF (futuro)\n  ✅ Todos los microservicios (no solo APIs)\n\nRATIONALE:\n\n1. Type safety: Pydantic v2 (validación runtime) vs TypeScript (compile-time)\n2. Performance: Equivalente (FastAPI async ≈ Express.js)\n3. Equipo: 85% base código es Python; 80% prefiere Python\n4. Integración: python-keycloak library es más simple\n5. Boilerplate: Pydantic integrado (vs Zod/Joi en TS)\n\nSTACK (OBLIGATORIO):\n\nRuntime:        Python 3.11+\nFramework:      FastAPI 0.100+\nORM:            SQLAlchemy 2.0+ (async)\nValidación:     Pydantic v2\nAuth:           python-keycloak + PyJWT\nLogging:        structlog + python-json-logger\nMétricas:       prometheus-client\nTesting:        pytest + httpx + pytest-asyncio\nCode Quality:   ruff + black\nType Checking:  mypy (strict mode)\n\nREGLAS VINCULANTES (Todas las APIs):\n\n1. ✅ Type hints en toda función pública (mypy strict)\n2. ✅ Pydantic v2 para validación entrada/salida\n3. ✅ SQLAlchemy async (no sync)\n4. ✅ Logging estructurado (no print)\n5. ✅ Transacciones explícitas (atomicidad)\n6. ✅ Autenticación vía middleware\n7. ✅ Testes con pytest\n8. ✅ Documentación OpenAPI automática\n9. ✅ Rate limiting en middleware\n10. ✅ Health checks (readiness + liveness)\n\nCAMBIOS A ADR-001:\n\nADR-001: Actualizar para referenciar ADR-008\n  (Python/FastAPI override de Node.js/Express)\n\nStatus: ADR-008 Aceptado (2026-09-28)\nVinculación: Obligatoria para todas las APIs REST nuevas\nExcepciones: Solo con nueva ADR aprobada por Jefe + Arquitecto\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bf0878726d90831900a67435fb80d5a766f5d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/4bf0878726d90831900a67435fb80d5a766f5d8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDhhMTkxN2IxY2RiYjZmMjQxMDI5YTM2OTg5Y2NmZWM1NWVmMGQ2Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57","sha":"fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57"}],"sha":"8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/8a1917b1cdbb6f241029a36989ccfec55ef0d6f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:42:12Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:42:12Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Diseñar API-SPEC-001: REST API para gestión de data maestra de party\n\nEspecificación técnica completa para cubrir US-015 a US-025 (11 capacidades).\n\nRECURSOS (5 grupos):\n\n1. PARTY (Personas)\n   POST   /parties                      US-015: Registrar colaborador\n   GET    /parties/{id}                 US-023: Consultar ficha\n   GET    /parties                      Listar con paginación\n   PATCH  /parties/{id}                 US-016: Actualizar datos\n   PATCH  /parties/{id}/status          US-021: Dar de baja\n   PATCH  /parties/{id}/keycloak-link   US-022: Vincular Keycloak UUID\n   GET    /parties/{id}/history         US-023: Ver historial\n   POST   /parties/{id}/anonymize       US-024: Anonimizar datos\n\n2. ORGANIZATION (Unidades, Proveedores)\n   POST   /organizations                US-017, US-018: Crear\n   GET    /organizations/{id}\n   GET    /organizations                Listar + filtro\n   PATCH  /organizations/{id}           Actualizar\n   PATCH  /organizations/{id}/hierarchy US-017: Cambiar padre\n   GET    /organizations/tree           Árbol organizacional\n\n3. ROLE-ASSIGNMENT (Rol-Nivel)\n   POST   /parties/{id}/role-assignments       US-019: Asignar nivel\n   GET    /parties/{id}/role-assignments       Listar vigentes + historial\n   PATCH  /parties/{id}/role-assignments/{rid} Cambiar nivel (crea vigencia nueva)\n\n4. PROGRAM-ROLE (Evaluador, Jefe, Instructor)\n   POST   /parties/{id}/program-roles          US-020: Asignar\n   GET    /parties/{id}/program-roles\n   DELETE /parties/{id}/program-roles/{role}   Remover\n\n5. KEYCLOAK-LINK (Identidad de acceso)\n   PATCH  /parties/{id}/keycloak-link          US-022: Vincular/actualizar\n   DELETE /parties/{id}/keycloak-link          Remover vínculo\n   GET    /parties/{id}/keycloak-link          Consultar\n\nDECISIONES DE DISEÑO:\n\n✅ REST (no GraphQL) — Simplicidad, estándar\n✅ Resource-oriented — Cada concepto = resource\n✅ Versionado en path — /api/v1/ permite evolución\n✅ Keycloak PKCE — Single sign-on corporativo\n✅ Tokens HTTP-only cookies — XSS protection\n✅ X-User-Name header — Auditoría de identidad\n✅ Sin sobrescritura — Vigencias (from_date/thru_date)\n✅ Auditoría en cada operación — created_by, updated_by, timestamps\n✅ Anonimización irreversible — D14, GDPR compliance\n✅ Paginación obligatoria — Performance\n\nSECURITY:\n\n✅ Autenticación: Keycloak PKCE\n✅ Autorización: RBAC (Jefe de Ingeniería vs Colaborador)\n✅ XSS: Tokens never in localStorage\n✅ CSRF: SameSite=Strict cookies\n✅ SQL Injection: Prepared statements (ORM)\n✅ Rate limiting: 1000 req/hora (dev), 10000 (prod)\n\nOBSERVABILIDAD:\n\n✅ Métricas: api_requests_total, db_query_duration_seconds\n✅ Logs estructurados: JSON con timestamp, action, party_id, duration_ms\n✅ Trazabilidad: X-Request-ID en cada request\n\nTESTING:\n\n✅ Contract tests: happy path + error cases\n✅ Performance tests: <500ms para listados, <1000ms para creación\n✅ Security tests: OWASP Top 10 coverage\n\nDDL COMPATIBLE:\n\n✅ STD-DB-001: tb_party, fk_, idx_, pk_ prefixes\n✅ Vigencias: from_date/thru_date columns\n✅ Auditoría: created_by/created_at, updated_by/updated_at\n✅ Índices: email (unique), status, created_at (ordenamiento)\n\nROADMAP:\n\nPhase 1 (Sem 1-2): Core PARTY + ORGANIZATION\nPhase 2 (Sem 3): ROLE-ASSIGNMENT + PROGRAM-ROLE\nPhase 3 (Sem 4): KEYCLOAK-LINK + integration tests\nPhase 4 (Sem 5): Anonymization + scheduler\nPhase 5 (Sem 6): Observability + dashboards\n\nStatus: REQUIRES_REVIEW\n  ↓ api-contract-reviewer (validar semántica, ejemplos, compatibilidad)\n  ↓ api-security-reviewer (validar OWASP, autenticación, autorización)\n  ↓ DEV (implementar en Node.js/Express)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f17f126d48d6e5df0b92970d08188e3e4af51019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/f17f126d48d6e5df0b92970d08188e3e4af51019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGZjZWRlMmYxYTFhZjIyZDczNDI3NzNkYWM2NDEwOTQ4ZDVjNzJjNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9","sha":"77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9"}],"sha":"fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/fcede2f1a1af22d7342773dac6410948d5c72c57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:50:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:50:08Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Descubrir ASR-007 y ADR-007: Consolidación de PostgreSQL para desarrollo local\n\nASR-007: Optimización de recursos en desarrollo local\n  - Pregunta: Cómo optimizar memoria/CPU sin comprometer funcionalidad\n  - Contexto: Dos instancias PostgreSQL → una sola (app + Keycloak compartido)\n  - Beneficio: -50% memoria, -50% procesos, -33% startup time\n  - Status: Propuesto\n\nADR-007: Consolidación de PostgreSQL en docker-compose (ACEPTADO)\n  - Decisión: Un solo PostgreSQL 15 con dos BDs (gestion_formacion + keycloak)\n  - Inicialización: postgres-init.sh (automática)\n  - Implementación completada en commit 155a570\n  - Justificación: Ahorro de recursos + Aislamiento mantenido + Simplicidad\n  - Cambios:\n    * Eliminar postgres-keycloak service\n    * Eliminar postgres_keycloak_data volume\n    * Agregar postgres-init.sh\n    * Actualizar config Keycloak (KC_DB_URL, usuarios)\n    * Documentación actualizada\n\nParity para testing:\n  - Migraciones V003-V004 testean contra app BD\n  - Keycloak testea contra su BD\n  - Mismos comandos docker-compose para ambas\n\nRiesgos mitigados:\n  - Interferencia entre BDs: PostgreSQL aísla naturalmente\n  - Escalabilidad futura: script es agnóstico\n  - Portabilidad: init script idempotente\n\nStatus: ASR-007 (Propuesto), ADR-007 (Aceptado)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87f46d951a35d134fc08ec120e6484b1b142fe88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/87f46d951a35d134fc08ec120e6484b1b142fe88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDc3YzE1NzY5M2FkMWQ1NGM5YmY3YjQ5NTljZmZkNjVkZWEzMGZjZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179","sha":"155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179"}],"sha":"77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/77c157693ad1d54c9bf7b4959cffd65dea30fce9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:21:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:21:37Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Optimizar docker-compose: consolidar Keycloak en PostgreSQL compartido\n\nCambios:\n✅ Un solo servicio PostgreSQL para app + Keycloak\n✅ Eliminar servicio postgres-keycloak redundante\n✅ Crear postgres-init.sh para inicializar BD keycloak automáticamente\n✅ Liberar puerto 5433 (ya no usado)\n✅ Reducir consumo de recursos en desarrollo local\n\nBeneficios:\n- Menos memoria/CPU (una BD compartida)\n- Setup más simple (un solo PostgreSQL)\n- Mismo comportamiento en dev/QA/PROD (una BD)\n\nKeycloak ahora usa:\n  BD: keycloak (en PostgreSQL puerto 5432)\n  Usuario: keycloak_user\n  Password: keycloak_password\n  Inicialización: automática via postgres-init.sh\n\nApp continúa usando:\n  BD: gestion_formacion (en PostgreSQL puerto 5432)\n  Usuario: gestion_user\n  Password: gestion_password\n\nActualizado:\n- codebase/docker-compose.yml (eliminar postgres-keycloak, volumen)\n- codebase/postgres-init.sh (nuevo, script de inicialización)\n- DOCKER_SETUP.md (documentar cambio, actualizar URLs, ejemplos)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"823e7d7980a20b621c87fa7527b29e93d374c314","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/823e7d7980a20b621c87fa7527b29e93d374c314"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDE1NWE1NzA1ZTBkMTM5MjliZjkyODdiMWJiZThlNDg4ZjQ2YTIxNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc","sha":"86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc"}],"sha":"155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/155a5705e0d13929bf9287b1bbe8e488f46a2179"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:17:44Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:17:44Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Agregar docker-compose con servicios básicos (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Keycloak, Redis, Vault)\n\nArchivos:\n- codebase/docker-compose.yml: Orquestación de 6 servicios\n  * MySQL 8.0.35 (puerto 3306)\n  * PostgreSQL 15 (puerto 5432)\n  * Keycloak 22 (puerto 8080, admin)\n  * Redis 7.2 (puerto 6379)\n  * HashiCorp Vault 1.15 (puerto 8200, dev mode)\n  * Adminer (puerto 8081, UI web)\n\n- codebase/vault-dev-config.hcl: Configuración Vault para desarrollo\n\n- DOCKER_SETUP.md: Guía completa con:\n  * Quick start (docker-compose up -d)\n  * Credenciales y URLs de conexión\n  * Inicialización de Keycloak (realm, client, PKCE)\n  * Setup Vault (secretos)\n  * Cargar DDL (party model)\n  * Testing de migraciones V003-V004\n  * Integración con BFF (Node.js)\n  * Health checks\n  * Troubleshooting\n  * Cleanup\n\nServicios incluidos:\n✅ MySQL: gestion_formacion (gestion_user:gestion_password)\n✅ PostgreSQL: gestion_formacion (gestion_user:gestion_password)\n✅ Keycloak: http://localhost:8080 (admin:admin)\n✅ Redis: redis_password\n✅ Vault: dev mode (root token en logs)\n✅ Adminer: http://localhost:8081\n\nEstos servicios soportan:\n- SPEC-001 (modelo Party, DDL MySQL/PostgreSQL)\n- ADR-002 (Keycloak + PKCE para autenticación)\n- ADR-004 (Vault para secretos y parámetros)\n- ADR-005 (tokens HTTP-only, X-User-Name header)\n- Migraciones V003-V004 (alineación STD-DB-001)\n\nPara iniciar:\n  cd codebase\n  docker-compose up -d\n  # Ver status: docker-compose ps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7995217e8d511e5a88401d066beffe43399cc7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/d7995217e8d511e5a88401d066beffe43399cc7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDg2YTdjMzdiYTEyM2I0ZTIwNDQwZGYzM2ZhNmYxMmQyOTY3YTljZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62","sha":"b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62"}],"sha":"86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/86a7c37ba123b4e20440df33fa6f12d2967a9cfc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:15:40Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:15:40Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Refinar RCP-003 en 11 User Stories (US-015 a US-025) — consolidado\n\nArchivo maestro: US-015-025-gestion-data-maestra-party-consolidated.md\n\n11 User Stories refinadas de SPEC-001 §5 (Capacidades C1–C11):\n\nUS-015: Registrar un colaborador\n  - Jefe de Ingeniería\n  - Captura nombres, identificación, correo, rol, unidad, jefe directo, proveedor\n  - Genera código GUID automático\n  - Readiness: CONDITIONAL (¿nivel inicial default?)\n\nUS-016: Actualizar datos y medios de contacto\n  - Jefe Ingeniería (todos) + Colaborador (solo perfil/teléfono)\n  - Sin sobrescritura; vigencias cerradas quedan en historial\n\nUS-017: Gestionar estructura organizacional\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - COMSATEL, unidades internas, jerarquía\n\nUS-018: Gestionar proveedores y contratistas\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Crear proveedores, vincular contratistas\n\nUS-019: Asignar Rol-Nivel\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Un solo nivel vigente por rol (cerrar anterior, abrir nuevo)\n  - Depende: catálogo + ADR-006\n\nUS-020: Asignar roles del programa\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Evaluador, Jefe de Ingeniería (roles de gestión)\n\nUS-021: Dar de baja\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Cierra vigencia de Employee/Contractor (no borra)\n  - Desencadena US-024, US-025\n\nUS-022: Vincular identidad de acceso\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Registrar UUID de Keycloak (0..1)\n  - Depende: ADR-002\n\nUS-023: Consultar ficha e historial\n  - Jefe Ingeniería (cualquier persona) + Colaborador (su propia)\n  - P-52: mostrar solo nombre, correo, rol, unidad, perfiles (no código/ID)\n\nUS-024: Anonimizar datos personales\n  - Jefe Ingeniería\n  - Irreversible, conserva código + referencias auditoría\n  - Depende: US-021\n\nUS-025: Configurar plazo de anonimización + aviso\n  - Jefe Ingeniería (configura) + Sistema (envía automático)\n  - Plazo configurable (default: ?)\n  - Envía correo a Jefes vigentes cuando vence\n\nReglas aplicadas: BR-PTY-01 a BR-PTY-20\nDecisiones: D11 (Jefe Ingeniería es dueño), D27 (data abierta), D14 (anonimización irreversible), BR-PTY-12 (sin sobrescritura)\n\nBloqueadores identificados:\n1. ¿Nivel Rol-Nivel default para empleado nuevo? (US-015-Q1)\n2. Plan contingencia para fallos de correo (INTEG-01)\n\nStatus: READY FOR SPLIT INTO INDIVIDUAL FILES (template-based)\n\nPróximo: Crear US-015.md a US-025.md individuales, validar INVEST + Definition of Ready\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"600aa7baf5a602ed9956cbd4e68e87dfb6beb2e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/600aa7baf5a602ed9956cbd4e68e87dfb6beb2e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGI3MmFhYzRjNmQ1MjkyYjBkODlhNDRlMDIzZTQxOTFmMGQ3ZThlNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2","sha":"b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2"}],"sha":"b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b72aac4c6d5292b0d89a44e023e4191f0d7e8e62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:04:57Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:04:57Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"ADR-006: Criterios y actores para upgrade de Rol-Nivel\n\nCierra P-28 y P-42 (¿Cómo se decide el upgrade de nivel?):\n\nMecanismo: HYBRID (Opción E)\n  • Múltiples fuentes de evidencia:\n    1. Curso completado (≥70%) — entrada más común\n    2. Desempeño en proyecto — complementario\n    3. Tiempo transcurrido — heurística (3-6 meses min)\n    4. Propuesta de IA — asistencia futura (opcional)\n\nActores autorizados:\n  ✅ Jefe de Ingeniería: aprueba cualquier upgrade (responsable catálogo)\n  ✅ Instructor designado: decide directamente tras completar curso\n     (si calificación ≥70% + certificado generado)\n  ✅ Evaluador: propone basado en desempeño en proyecto\n  ✅ Agente IA: propone basado en análisis (requiere aprobación)\n\nCriterios explícitos:\n  • Completar curso de nivel N+1 con ≥70%\n  • Certificado generado (comprobante)\n  • Desempeño validado en proyecto (si aplica)\n  • Tiempo mínimo en nivel anterior (3-6 meses)\n  • Sin saltos sin justificación (L1→L2→L3→L4)\n\nVentajas:\n  • Criterios objetivos (curso completado es base)\n  • Flexible (múltiples rutas: curso, proyecto, IA)\n  • Escalable (Instructor puede decidir sin cuello en Jefe)\n  • Auditable (cada upgrade registrado)\n\nPendientes para refinar:\n  • Duración mínima de curso para contar como \"completado\"\n  • ¿Saltarse niveles si demuestran competencia superior?\n  • ¿Downgrade si desempeño baja?\n  • Estándares de \"desempeño en proyecto\" por rol/nivel\n\nDecisor: ianache (Jefe de Ingeniería)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfa1a4418f7b207db6b7f5f5adab2000a3a2dbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/dfa1a4418f7b207db6b7f5f5adab2000a3a2dbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGI1MTc2NjVjYmRmNTUxZDJlOTUxZDViNmQ4NWVlZTQ0Yzk4ZGNiYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65","sha":"27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65"}],"sha":"b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/b517665cbdf551d2e951d5b6d85eee44c98dcbb2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:01:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T01:01:36Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"ADR-005: Decisiones de implementación PKCE — tokens, identidad, sesiones\n\nCierra 5 puntos abiertos de ADR-002:\n\n1. ✅ Dónde viven tokens:\n   - Tokens JWT en BFF (cookie HTTP-only)\n   - Nunca llegan al navegador (protección contra XSS)\n\n2. ✅ Propagación de identidad a microservicios:\n   - BFF obtiene JWT con su cuenta de servicio en Keycloak\n   - Usuario final se transfiere via header X-User-Name para auditoría\n   - Microservicios confían en BFF, no validan JWT de usuarios finales\n   - Impersonalización centralizada\n\n3. ✅ Instancia Keycloak:\n   - Reutiliza instancia existente de COMSATEL\n   - Local: docker-compose (sin federación)\n   - QA: https://oauth2.qa.comsatel.com.pe\n   - PROD: https://oauth2.prod.comsatel.com.pe\n\n4. ✅ Federación:\n   - Sí, configurada en QA y PROD con directorio corporativo\n   - Usuarios se sincronizan automáticamente\n   - Desarrollo local sin federación\n\n5. ✅ Sesiones:\n   - Duración: 30 minutos\n   - Cierre bilateral: browser + Keycloak\n   - Logout redirige a pantalla de login\n\nDecisor: ianache (Jefe de Ingeniería)\nHandoff: Arquitecto de seguridad, DevOps, Frontend team\n\nEstado: Aceptado\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3785c42f4bfb0bc5b8d9c87fc8e4d83efcdab36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/e3785c42f4bfb0bc5b8d9c87fc8e4d83efcdab36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDI3ZDdiOTIwOTNiNjAyZjg1M2JkMGFiYjljODlkYWU2MzhmZGRlNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034","sha":"1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034"}],"sha":"27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/27d7b92093b602f853bd0abb9c89dae638fdde65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:57:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:57:16Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Crear RCP-003: Contexto funcional para gestión de data maestra de parties\n\nDocumento: RCP-003-gestion-data-maestra-party.md\n\nContenido:\n- Contexto consolidado para información maestra de colaboradores (employees, contractors)\n- Consolidación de SPEC-001, IMD-002, VIS-001, BRC-001\n- Ciclo de vida: Alta → Cambio → Baja → Anonimización (visual)\n- 7 hechos confirmados con fuentes\n- 4 supuestos/hipótesis\n- 8 preguntas abiertas priorizadas con responsables\n- 11 capacidades (C1–C11) descompuestas\n- 20 reglas de negocio mapeadas (BR-PTY-01 a BR-PTY-20)\n- 4 restricciones de negocio\n- 6 riesgos funcionales con mitigaciones\n- Actores, procesos, datos, dependencias\n- 12 decisiones aprobadas (Jefe de Ingeniería, 2026-09-27)\n- Handoff explícito para User Story Refiner y Data Model Designer\n\nValidaciones pendientes:\n- Keycloak en COMSATEL (KG-01)\n- Sincronización de roles con Keycloak (IM-Q2)\n- Criterios de upgrade de nivel (P-28, P-42)\n\nEntrada recomendada para: af-user-story-refiner (US-015 a US-025), data-model-designer\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74c2750aee8941a8e879886c02ba8eee84f35cd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/74c2750aee8941a8e879886c02ba8eee84f35cd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDFkYmM5NjhhOWJjNTU1M2QwZjI1MDJiMDVlNDZjNGMwY2QwN2YwMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3","sha":"2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3"}],"sha":"1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/1dbc968a9bc5553d0f2502b05e46c4c0cd07f034"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:05:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:05:35Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Crear mapa de dependencias de skills por categoría\n\nDocumento: SKILLS_DEPENDENCY_MAP.md\n\nContenido:\n- 5 categorías de skills (Architecture, Functional Analysis, UX/Design, Data, Handoff)\n- Grafo visual de dependencias entre 21 skills\n- Matriz de dependencias explícitas (inputs/outputs)\n- 4 flujos de trabajo típicos\n- Matriz de trazabilidad entre artefactos\n- Niveles jerárquicos (0-7)\n- Identificación de bloques críticos\n- Análisis de paralelización segura\n\nPropósito:\n- Guiar la invocación correcta de skills en workflows\n- Evitar saltar dependencias críticas\n- Identificar oportunidades de paralelización\n- Entender flujos de entrada/salida entre skills\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9354dd5379e48bbbed7a1562919e1ff6ad57cd31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/9354dd5379e48bbbed7a1562919e1ff6ad57cd31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDIwMDJiYmMxNmE3MTI1NjE1MGE0ODdlY2Y1OWUzZWIxNjdhOGZmZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0","sha":"6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0"}],"sha":"2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/2002bbc16a71256150a487ecf59e3eb167a8ffd3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:47:19Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:47:19Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"STD-DB-001: auditoría y plan de alineación de DDL (DMD-001)\n\nCreados:\n- DMD-001: auditoría de DDLs contra STD-DB-001 (naming conventions)\n  * 13 tablas sin prefijo tb_ → requieren renombrado\n  * ~13 PKs sin prefijo pk_ → requieren renombrado\n  * ~16 FKs sin prefijo fk_ → requieren renombrado\n  * 6 índices con prefijo ix_ (no idx_) → requieren renombrado\n\n- V003__align-std-db-001-tablas.sql: migración portable (fase 1)\n  * Renombra tablas, columnas (PK/FK), índices\n  * Sintaxis portable para MySQL ≥8.0.20 y PostgreSQL ≥12\n  * Sin cambios semánticos\n\n- V004__align-std-db-001-constraints.sql: migración portable (fase 2)\n  * Renombra FOREIGN KEY constraints (patrón: fk_tb_<tabla>_tb_<tabla_ref>)\n  * Renombra UNIQUE constraints (patrón: uq_tb_<tabla>_<cols>)\n  * Preserva toda la integridad referencial\n\nPróximos pasos (Fase 3–4):\n- Copiar migraciones a mysql/ y postgresql/ con variantes si aplica\n- Actualizar tests (fixtures.sql) con nuevos nombres de columnas\n- Validar en ambos motores\n- Actualizar LDM-001 y party-*.sql si contienen refs a nombres viejos\n\nEstado: DMD-001 completo, migraciones listas para ejecución\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c511f207570d25c218a3f3e95ea3d27a0e1d0b9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/c511f207570d25c218a3f3e95ea3d27a0e1d0b9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDYzMzliZGQyYjUyZjQ4NWM3MDY0ODIxMjdmYzI4YmQ5Yjg2M2EwZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e","sha":"6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e"}],"sha":"6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6339bdd2b52f485c706482127fc28bd9b863a0f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:41:03Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:41:03Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"STD-DB-001: Estándar de base de datos — naming conventions y estructura\n\nNaming conventions (snake_case + prefijos obligatorios):\n- Tablas: tb_<entidad> (ej: tb_rol, tb_colaborador, tb_certificacion)\n- Vistas: vw_<descripcion> (ej: vw_colaborador_actual, vw_brecha_individual)\n- Stored Procedures: sp_<verbo>_<entidad> (ej: sp_create_colaborador, sp_certify_competency)\n- Índices: idx_<tabla>_<columnas> (ej: idx_colaborador_empleado_id)\n- Primary Keys: pk_<tabla_singular>_id (ej: pk_rol_id, pk_colaborador_id)\n- Foreign Keys: fk_<tabla_referenciada_singular>_id (ej: fk_rol_id, fk_colaborador_id)\n\nEstructura DDL:\n- Tipos de datos portables MySQL/PostgreSQL\n- Constraints obligatorios: PK, FK, UNIQUE, NOT NULL, CHECK\n- Auditoría: fecha_creacion, fecha_actualizacion en tablas principales\n- Índices en FKs y columnas de búsqueda frecuente\n\nPortabilidad:\n- Migraciones portable + per-engine (MySQL, PostgreSQL)\n- Sin AUTO_INCREMENT (usamos GUID generado en aplicación)\n- Flyway/Alembic para gestión de migraciones\n\nEjemplos:\n- tb_rol: tabla simple con constraints\n- tb_colaborador: tabla con FKs y índices compuestos\n- vw_colaborador_actual: vista para datos vigentes\n- sp_create_colaborador: procedure con transacciones y auditoría\n\nReferencias: ADR-003, LDM-001, DDL actual (MySQL/PostgreSQL)\n\nAplicable a: SPEC-001, todas las migraciones de base de datos, fixtures.\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb1773e64d1614f6bb7f3ff6b11fe61d789510b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/cb1773e64d1614f6bb7f3ff6b11fe61d789510b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDZhNzM2OTlhY2Y2YzBiOGE0ZWQ0YTVhZTFlMzdiNDU4MTNmNjM2OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6","sha":"ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6"}],"sha":"6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/6a73699acf6c0b8a4ed4a5ae1e37b45813f6369e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:35:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:35:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"WEB-ACP: Contexto arquitectónico UX/UI + inventario de componentes\n\nACP-001: Architecture Context Pack\n- 3 ADRs (MicroUI+BFF, design system, BD)\n- DDD: Gestión de Formación = MICROUI_CANDIDATE\n- Angular 17+ standalone, Tailwind, design tokens\n- NPM strategy: @comsatel/gestión-formación, entry points, semver\n- Testing: Jasmine + axe-core + Percy\n- WCAG AA accessibility matrix\n- Supuestos documentados (S-ANGULAR, S-TAILWIND, S-TOKENS, S-TESTING, S-A11Y, S-KEYCLOAK, S-BFF-REST)\n\nUI-INV-001: UI Inventory\n- SCR-001–004 mapeadas (tabla roles, detalle rol, detalle competencia, mis proyectos)\n- 20 componentes reutilizables identificados (atoms/molecules/organisms)\n- Reuse map consolidado: Button, Badge, Table, Tabs, Select, Checkbox, Card, Alert, Modal\n- Estados y variantes por componente (Normal, Hover, Focus, Disabled, Error, Loading, Empty)\n- Responsive breakpoints (mobile, tablet, desktop)\n- WCAG requisitos por componente\n- 21 component specs pendientes (CMP-ATOM-001 a PAGE-004)\n- 8 preguntas abiertas (UIQ-01 a UIQ-03, SUPO-01 a SUPO-04)\n\nLineage: GEN-002 SCR-001–004 → ui-inventory → atomic-component-catalog.md → component specs\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c8c3ba77804c63181a99a3488d41c74c4462868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/5c8c3ba77804c63181a99a3488d41c74c4462868"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGVhMWZkZTVmZTIwNDg0Y2VkYmQwMjIzNDEyOGJlOWM2NWFlOGMyZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32","sha":"c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32"}],"sha":"ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/ea1fde5fe20484cedbd02234128be9c65ae8c2f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:20:58Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:20:58Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"GEN-002: Diseño consolidado UXR-001 a UXR-006 — generadas SCR-001 a SCR-004\n\nPantallas generadas en Stitch (proyecto 7424057371727816981):\n- SCR-001: Catálogo de roles (7 roles iniciales, estados Definido/Sin definir, BR-CAT-20)\n- SCR-002: Detalle de rol (pestañas variables por nivel F-13, validación BR-CAT-03/BR-CAT-07)\n- SCR-003: Detalle de competencia (requisitos marcados ✓ Requerida / ○ Deseada F-14, estado \"Sin requisitos\" F-15, BR-ACR-13 bloqueante)\n- SCR-004: Mis proyectos (lista con estados, botón \"Declarar requerimiento\", S-01 supuesto, BR-REQ-02 acceso)\n\nDocumentado:\n- Estrategia de generación con criterios F-13/14/15\n- Supuestos documentados S-01 a S-06 (proyectos, Evaluador, ordenamiento, design system)\n- Hallazgos críticos HC-01 a HC-04 (accesibilidad, navegación, versionado)\n- Tabla de progreso y próximos pasos (SCR-005–011 pausadas por timeouts de Stitch)\n\nLineage: UXR-001–006 → BRC-001 → IMD-001 → US-001–006, con decisiones 2026-09-27 integradas.\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e9e0f08d89da0960bf35713d75d3677a687fb44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/4e9e0f08d89da0960bf35713d75d3677a687fb44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGM5ZjZjN2ZkMWFjMDc5MGNlYzlhOTczN2MxYmEzYTM3NDZmNzVlMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/f2e884d1088a0e9c0c2a61954921f04a8eb9e19d","sha":"f2e884d1088a0e9c0c2a61954921f04a8eb9e19d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/f2e884d1088a0e9c0c2a61954921f04a8eb9e19d"}],"sha":"c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/c9f6c7fd1ac0790cec9a9737c1ba3a3746f75e32"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/f2e884d1088a0e9c0c2a61954921f04a8eb9e19d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:12:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:12:52Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"KB: respuestas finales a P-49, P-50, P-52 y subpreguntas\n\n- BRC-001: EVD-2026-0130..0132; BR