a":"3ce74abb0dcb59c734e6a35072c3c5b68cab4ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/3ce74abb0dcb59c734e6a35072c3c5b68cab4ada"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/c898b07d4b606a6f1396465b4c08836733ba2f56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:47:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T13:47:13Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"SPEC-001: especificacion de la gestion de colaboradores (Party UDM)\n\nDiseno acordado por secciones con human:ianache: plataforma como\nsistema de registro, modelo Party del UDM con vigencias, vinculo por\nidentificador con Keycloak, varios roles con un nivel vigente por rol,\nColaborador derivado, perfiles profesionales, y persistencia MySQL y\nPostgreSQL con DDL portable. Pendiente de revision antes del plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c4e80a65bc573c1a58f29493c8091c097668596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/1c4e80a65bc573c1a58f29493c8091c097668596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/c898b07d4b606a6f1396465b4c08836733ba2f56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/c898b07d4b606a6f1396465b4c08836733ba2f56","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGM4OThiMDdkNGI2MDZhNmYxMzk2NDY1YjRjMDg4MzY3MzNiYTJmNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2","sha":"d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2"}],"sha":"c898b07d4b606a6f1396465b4c08836733ba2f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/c898b07d4b606a6f1396465b4c08836733ba2f56"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:23:06Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:23:06Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"ADR de arquitectura, requisitos UX de H1 y disenos exploratorios en Stitch\n\n- ADR-001 (shell y microUIs en Angular, BFF Node.js intermediario con\n  microservicios) y ADR-002 (autenticacion en el BFF con Keycloak y\n  PKCE), Aceptados por human:ianache; justificacion pendiente.\n- Vinculos de los ADR en asr-BR-ACR-02, catalogo ASR, ACP-001 y ADB-001.\n- Requisitos UX UXR-000 a UXR-006 (ux-requirements-analyzer).\n- GEN-001 y GEN-002: disenos exploratorios en Google Stitch para UXR-001\n  y UXR-000, con prompts, capturas de referencia y revision critica.\n  No estan aprobados.\n- Correccion del estado de P-22 en US-001 y US-003.\n- graphify-out actualizado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8e172a935e2919cbd8055a7052792b21ebf2bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/b8e172a935e2919cbd8055a7052792b21ebf2bb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGQxOTNhYjVjZTFiOWVkYTU0MWVlMWM4OTNlMmNlNTE1ZTQ0ZmQ2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9","sha":"9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9"}],"sha":"d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/d193ab5ce1b9eda541ee1c893e2ce515e44fd6e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:45:11Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:45:11Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Arquitectura, modelo conceptual y decisiones de negocio del catalogo\n\n- Arquitectura: descubrimiento ADB-001, matriz de impacto AIM-001,\n  Architecture Context Pack ACP-001 (NOT READY_FOR_ARQ_102) y\n  catalogo de 9 candidatos ASR.\n- Modelo de informacion conceptual IMD-001 y skill\n  af-conceptual-model-designer con validador.\n- Decisiones de ianache (Jefe de Ingenieria) en BRC-001: catalogo\n  unico, roles independientes del producto, Rol-Nivel 1-4 con nivel\n  L1-L4 esperado, rubrica por competencia, requisitos de evidencia,\n  requerimiento con rol y nivel de rol, Jefe de proyecto y\n  terminologia \"certificar\".\n- Glosario: 69 terminos (59 aprobados), terminos nuevos y\n  definiciones revisadas; historias US-001 a US-006 actualizadas.\n- Skills de arquitectura agregados y graphify-out actualizado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ca6d621e3152a987d712e1e4dac37257d276bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/2ca6d621e3152a987d712e1e4dac37257d276bad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDkxOTBkZGM2YzNiMDg3Zjk3MDQ1MDJmN2UyYThhYTY3OWI1NDkyYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794","sha":"292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794"}],"sha":"9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/9190ddc6c3b087f9704502f7e2a8aa679b5492a9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T02:09:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T02:09:38Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Context Pack H1, User Stories refinadas y formato estandar de historias\n\n- knowledge-base/requirement/: catalogo USC-001 (14 historias), Context\n  Pack RCP-001 de H1 y US-001 a US-006 refinadas, un archivo OKF por\n  historia.\n- af-user-story-refiner 2.0: una historia por archivo con plantilla\n  estandar (Gherkin, casos negativos, RNF, UX, INVEST, DoR, DoD) y\n  reglas de IDs, fuentes y preparacion.\n- Nuevos skills: af-requirement-context-builder, data-model-designer y\n  web-atomic-component-designer.\n- graphify-out/ actualizado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"925a3807673a6901a34e45e63f061dcbec50ff53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/925a3807673a6901a34e45e63f061dcbec50ff53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKDI5MjM5NmVjZmQ5ZjVhZGQ3OTFiNGIyMmQ0MjdjMDc3NzNmYWM3OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2","sha":"db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2"}],"sha":"292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/292396ecfd9f5add791b4b22d427c07773fac794"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:11:47Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T01:11:47Z","email":"ianache@comsatel.com.pe","name":"ianache"},"message":"Pack UX/UI V2: skills agentic, base de conocimiento y glosario de negocio\n\n- Skills del track UX-101 a UX-106 y skills af-* (reglas de negocio,\n  historias de usuario y glosario de negocio con script de indice y\n  validacion).\n- knowledge-base/: vision VIS-001, catalogo de reglas BRC-001 y\n  glosario GLS-001 con un archivo OKF v0.2 por termino (59 de 65\n  aprobados por ianache, Jefe de Ingenieria).\n- AGENTS.md y CLAUDE.md: regla de ejecutar graphify antes de cada commit.\n- graphify-out/ actualizado y material del curso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34d21183cf7bec25bec71438dfade888c4f2c918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/trees/34d21183cf7bec25bec71438dfade888c4f2c918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/git/commits/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/training-manager/commit/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2","node_id":"C_kwDOUtlAstoAKGRiNzI4MzkzMjFhNDM4NTUxYTI2ODY2MThmYzhhY2ZmODNhODY0ZTI","parents":[],"sha":"db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits/db72839321a438551a2686618fc8acff83a864e2"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/training-manager/commits?per_page=100&page=3&sha=398e6a019329e67ebbf9781cd13e071dc025015f&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A56%3A21.075Z"}');
