must be lowercase — build-push-action was failing with\n\"invalid tag ... repository name must be lowercase\". Compute a lowercased\nREPO_LC env var via bash''s ${VAR,,} expansion and use that in the tag instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0483dccb03377e913b89ac9391bffb9d18b2358a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/git/trees/0483dccb03377e913b89ac9391bffb9d18b2358a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/git/commits/9b1efb037e77d093a62d4c35ab67726bbf82e30c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45779480?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mack8","id":45779480,"login":"Mack8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Nzc5NDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/commit/9b1efb037e77d093a62d4c35ab67726bbf82e30c","node_id":"C_kwDOUt7cttoAKDliMWVmYjAzN2U3N2QwOTNhNjJkNGMzNWFiNjc3MjZiYmY4MmUzMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/commit/2b65bb443c7b92960c44a139fc776c35a79d3717","sha":"2b65bb443c7b92960c44a139fc776c35a79d3717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/commits/2b65bb443c7b92960c44a139fc776c35a79d3717"}],"sha":"9b1efb037e77d093a62d4c35ab67726bbf82e30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/commits/9b1efb037e77d093a62d4c35ab67726bbf82e30c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45779480?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mack8","id":45779480,"login":"Mack8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Nzc5NDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/commits/2b65bb443c7b92960c44a139fc776c35a79d3717/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:56:00Z","email":"marco-daniel08@hotmail.com","name":"Mack"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:56:00Z","email":"marco-daniel08@hotmail.com","name":"Mack"},"message":"feat: initial TaskFlow MVP — full-stack .NET 8 + React demo\n\nProject/task management platform built to demonstrate the stack in a Sr\nSoftware Engineer job posting end to end, running, with tests:\n\n- Backend: .NET 8 Clean Architecture (Domain/Application/Infrastructure/Api),\n  CQRS via MediatR, Repository + Unit of Work, REST for commands and\n  HotChocolate GraphQL for reads, JWT auth, EF Core against SQL Server.\n- TaskFlow.Notifications: independent microservice consuming domain events\n  from RabbitMQ and storing them in MongoDB, exposed over its own REST API —\n  the event-driven/microservices slice of the architecture.\n- Frontend: React 19 + TypeScript (Vite), React Query, React Router, a\n  project/task board consuming both the REST and GraphQL endpoints.\n- infra/bicep: Azure PaaS topology (App Service, Azure SQL, Cosmos DB Mongo\n  API, Service Bus, Static Web Apps, Key Vault) mapped 1:1 onto the local\n  docker-compose stack — design-only, not deployed.\n- CI: GitHub Actions for backend tests, frontend tests, and multi-service\n  Docker builds.\n- 15 backend tests (unit + WebApplicationFactory integration) and 4 frontend\n  component tests, all passing.\n\nFull local stack validated end to end via docker compose: register, create\nproject, add member, create/assign task, change status, and the event ->\nRabbitMQ -> MongoDB -> notification round trip all confirmed working.\nREADME documents the architecture, the job-requirement mapping, and three\nreal bugs found and fixed while building this (EF Core key-generation\nambiguity, interface-typed JSON serialization dropping fields, and an enum\nwire-format mismatch between services).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecee8c0296f52470f9e3a276dbd82bf2464885f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/git/trees/ecee8c0296f52470f9e3a276dbd82bf2464885f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mack8/taskflow-mvp/git/commits/2b65bb443c7b92960c44a139fc776c35a79d3717","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45779480?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mack8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mack8","id":45779480,"login":"Mack8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Nzc