_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/73d08b1ed5cd798104677578bf74c4f1f2fe129f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:23:58Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T01:23:58Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"message":"Record truthful audit outcomes for consultation and MDT task completion\n\nAudit of every hardcoded outcome string passed to /tasks/:uuid/complete\n(17 frontend route-table strings, 6 server-side auto-completions): 23\ntruthful, 2 misreporting what happened.\n\n- ''consult-new'' said \"consultation recorded\" although done() only fires\n  after signConsultation succeeds — the record is signed and immutable.\n  Now \"consultation signed\".\n- ''mdt'' said \"MDT outcome signed\" for two different task codes. The\n  coordinator''s MDT_REVIEW ends at \"record discussion -> route to chair\"\n  (no signature exists; the chair signs MDT_CHAIR_SIGN separately, D-MDT-6),\n  so its audit trail claimed a signature that never happened. Now it\n  branches on task.code: the coordinator records \"MDT discussion recorded\n  — routed to chair for sign-out\"; the chair records \"MDT outcome signed\n  by chair\".\n\nProven live at :3210 through the real UI: the coordinator drive recorded\nthe old string before reload and the new string after; the chair drive\nsigned the case and recorded \"MDT outcome signed by chair\" — ground truth\nfrom the task store. npm test exit 0.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e515532823a6fdf90ee251725eae25768968409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/4e515532823a6fdf90ee251725eae25768968409"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/73d08b1ed5cd798104677578bf74c4f1f2fe129f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commit/73d08b1ed5cd798104677578bf74c4f1f2fe129f","node_id":"C_kwDOUufZjdoAKDczZDA4YjFlZDVjZDc5ODEwNDY3NzU3OGJmNzRjNGYxZjJmZTEyOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commit/61fb6657b658145ba69a84c9305e7c867549a298","sha":"61fb6657b658145ba69a84c9305e7c867549a298","url":"https://api.github.com/