e verbatim to public/task-ui.js.\n\nCross-module seams, verified: renderPatientHeader resolves from chart-ui.js\nat dispatch time; every routed form (formConsultation ... formSurgery)\nresolves globally from app.js by the shared-globals convention. app.js keeps\nonly the two renderView dispatch lines — a pure 114-line removal, zero\nadditions. index.html loads task-ui.js directly after app.js (the worklist\nis the boot view). app.js: 1,136 → 1,022 lines.\n\nVerified: all four functions defined exactly once across public/; npm test\nexit 0 (both real-Chrome harnesses drive the moved worklist/task flows); a\nlive drive at :3210 exercised the bucket switcher, a real Open → click into\na routed form with the shared patient header, and the backlink round trip\nwith zero console errors.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3a8d47681413cf47744a504601d47796e1c276c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/c3a8d47681413cf47744a504601d47796e1c276c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/61fb6657b658145ba69a84c9305e7c867549a298","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co