i.js (both\noriginally verbatim from app.js). Consolidate into ui-helpers.js as the\nsingle definition, loaded first in index.html so it precedes every\nconsuming module. Also removes dead weight: chart-ui.js''s copy had zero\ncall sites (carried along with the chart block), while staging-ui.js''s\nthree real call sites are unchanged. chart-ui''s yn helper stays local -\nits only cross-file \"hits\" were substring matches in app.js, so it has\nno real cross-module callers.\n\nnpm test exit 0 (56/72/21 unit+API, UI regression 15/15, both Chrome\nharnesses VERIFIED); live smoke: Staging tab renders through the shared\nhelper with zero console errors.","tree":{"sha":"4376558da34797c1c4f30c26ae84f068afe24abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/4376558da34797c1c4f30c26ae84f068afe24abc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/76a20a500e5ca2498b9ded49ae6d73315f26b274","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscripti