the render check\nstill fails; the downstream SURGERY_SPECIMEN task and a zero-pageerror\nassertion close the loop.\n\nWired into npm test ahead of the two long harnesses so CI catches a\nregression fast. Mutation-verified: reverting app.js to the pre-fix\ncode makes the suite fail on exactly the two orphaned fields; the\nfixed tree passes 14/14.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"5837827e7326ce141a1758f9557d77e7c5269558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/5837827e7326ce141a1758f9557d77e7c5269558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/67ab34afb6c870a6f4cee8bed6722f57818e43bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commit/67ab34afb6c870a6f4cee8bed6722f57818e43bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUufZjdoAKDY3YWIzNGFmYjZjODcwYTZmNGNlZThiZWQ2NzIyZjU3ODE4ZTQzYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commit/ef4976acf614aa48827094b6668969955c0cb280","sha":"ef4976acf614aa48827094b6668969955c0cb280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/ef4976acf614aa48827094b6668969955c0cb280"}],"sha":"67ab34afb6c870a6f4cee8bed6722f57818e43bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/67ab34afb6c870a6f4cee8bed6722f57818e43bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/ef4976acf614aa48827094b6668969955c0cb280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:29:46Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T04:29:46Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"message":"Split patient chart view out of app.js into chart-ui.js\n\nContinue the frontend decomposition on the staging-ui.js convention:\nextract the patient chart from app.js into public/chart-ui.js (449\nlines) — viewPatientChart (header, 18-tab bar, dispatch),\nrenderPatientHeader + pcell (the §35-labeled stage header, also shared\nwith viewTaskAction), all sixteen tab renderers, the D4\nopenDiseaseProfileForm biomarker modal, and the el2s/yn helpers.\nBodies are byte-verbatim; the already-dead tabPatientCalendar (long\nsuperseded by tabPatientCalendarV2 in calendar-ui.js) moved with the\nblock per convention. Cross-module delegates resolve at event time:\nthe Staging tab calls tabStaging (staging-ui.js) and the Calendar tab\ncalls tabPatientCalendarV2 (calendar-ui.js), unchanged.\n\nindex.html loads chart-ui.js after treatment-ui.js and before\ncalendar-ui.js, so app.js globals exist when the module runs.\napp.js drops from 1,575 to 1,136 lines.\n\nVerified: node --check on both files; every moved function defined\nexactly once; npm test exit 0 including both real-Chrome harnesses\n(the 16-step harness renders the chart and Timeline through the new\nmodule); live smoke at :3210 — all 18 tabs clicked through on the\nrichest patient with data spot-checks (treatment order, completed\nadministration, documents) and the reverse seam (task view rendering\nthe shared renderPatientHeader), zero console errors.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea1236a2b22ce970a4ae3b844eff6e1c73196ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/ea1236a2b22ce970a4ae3b844eff6e1c73196ae4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/ef4976acf614aa48827094b6668969955c0cb280","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/p