hisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"message":"Fix surgery form: operative findings and specimen site were unreachable\n\nformSurgery created the Operative findings textarea and Specimen site\ninput but never appended them to the card, so both fields were absent\nfrom the rendered form and every operative record submitted with empty\nfindings and no specimen — downstream, no pathology order was ever\nraised. The submit handler already read the two nodes, so nothing\nflagged the gap.\n\nAppend them alongside the existing fields so the values actually reach\nthe operative record. Found and confirmed by driving the form in the\nlive UI; pre-existing at HEAD (not introduced by the treatment-ui\nextraction).\n\nVerified: regression suite test/ui-regression-forms.test.js renders\nall five fields, round-trips findings/specimen into the store, and was\nmutation-tested against the pre-fix code (fails on exactly the two\norphaned fields); full npm test exit 0.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a5b07c5844903164a17c3d2d8199485c0618d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/6a5b07c5844903164a17c3d2d8199485c0618d61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/2c0016d76627de4173329d42337216a4c18df1de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhisheknahire89","id":179821703,"login":"abhisheknahire89","node_id":"U_kgDOCrfchw","org