wner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/906d75a584c822f05b0718fc124e8f6eec6601e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:29:51Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T23:29:51Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"message":"Split treatment forms out of app.js into treatment-ui.js\n\nContinue the frontend decomposition on the staging-ui.js convention:\nextract the treatment-order, pharmacy, and day-care task forms from\napp.js into public/treatment-ui.js — formTreatmentOrder (care-plan and\nreadiness stop-gates, regimen sign), formPharmacy (receive → verify →\nprepare → release → dispense chain), formDayCare (administration\nrecord, two-identifier verification, drug lines, infusion reactions),\nand wfComplete, the shared task-completion helper the pharmacy loop\ncloses with (app.js forms such as radiation and surgery call it too;\nthat still resolves through the shared global scope).\n\nBodies are verbatim (the removed app.js block diffs clean against the\nmodule body); the ''treatment-order''/''pharmacy''/''daycare'' bindings in\nviewTaskAction are untouched. index.html loads treatment-ui.js after\nstaging-ui.js, so all app.js globals exist before the module runs.\napp.js drops from 1,794 to 1,575 lines.\n\nVerified: node --check on both files; each function defined exactly\nonce; npm test exit 0 including both real-Chrome harnesses; all three\nforms and the wfComplete cross-module callers (surgery, radiation)\nexercised live at :3210 with zero console errors.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa5f4113168da5530b9bca6e867965d2ba5ed565","url":"https://api.github.co