 the server (src/staging.js);\nthe frontend still carried all staging UI inside the 2,283-line app.js.\nExtract the staging user interface into public/staging-ui.js (499 lines):\nthe Staging chart tab (tabStaging), the staging task form (formStaging:\nauthority header, dynamic inputs, §24 evidence suggestions, §31 flag\ndiscrepancy modal, evidence picker, derivation view, §32 summary, sign),\nand the el2s helper. Bodies are byte-verbatim (diff-verified against the\npre-split file); call sites in app.js resolve at event time.\n\nFollows the established calendar-ui.js convention: plain script loaded\nafter app.js in index.html, sharing its globals (el, api, state, toast,\nrender, wrap, fmtDate). app.js drops to 1,795 lines; staging UI now has\none owner mirroring the backend module.\n\nVerified: npm test exit 0 — both real-Chrome harnesses drive the full\npresenter flow through the actual staged UI (breast 36/36, myeloma 34/34;\nunit suites unchanged, none load public/*.js). Live check on :3210: app\nboots with the three-script layout, staging form opens with auto-resolved\nauthority, §24 evidence suggestion strip fires on focus, zero console\nerrors.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd8c43d638d073088ef3af3a84e930973f77e2d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/trees/dd8c43d638d073088ef3af3a84e930973f77e2d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/git/commits/1888850097cef0f3258ac21612ced44fc85d5ab8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179821703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g