isheknahire89/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhisheknahire89","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhisheknahire89/Cancer-HIS-CCA/commits/e3d27616fba45c998015f0860b977e70c05acf77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:10:14Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:10:14Z","email":"abhisheknahire89@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Nahire"},"message":"Refactor: extract the staging domain into src/staging.js\n\n~413 lines move verbatim from clinical.js into one owner module — schema\nresolution, sign gates, staging assessments, evidence auto-suggestion\n(§24/§25), discrepancy flags (§31), Slice-E pathological restaging, and\nthe latest-signed lookup used by care planning. Call sites repointed in\nclinical.js, clinical-flow.js, treatment.js, server.js, and the test\nsuites; no behavior change. clinical.js drops from 1,218 to 800 lines\nand no longer reaches into staging-providers/ajcc/staging-engine/tnm.\n\nVerification: per-suite check counts identical to the pre-split merge\n(358f583, re-run in a temp worktree) — 56+75+30+72+21+28+15+13+17+31+20\n= 378 unit checks, 0 failures on both trees; breast browser harness\n36/36 and myeloma 34/34 on the refactored tree; live server restarted\non the refactored tree with the staging schema and evidence-suggestion\nroutes answering over real HTTP and the staging form verified in the\nbrowser (the module wiring was caught over HTTP, not by syntax checks).\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6010094cb47cf6ea6914c1baf65614829efacf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abh