":"henri.bergius@iki.fi","name":"Henri Bergius"},"message":"docs: changelog entry for the wave-period swell dampening","tree":{"sha":"45cef336379f2109889e8ad65200b275c5d8c157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/git/trees/45cef336379f2109889e8ad65200b275c5d8c157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/git/commits/81d4162db1044944aeadbfc6b51d2d2b7541287a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3346?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bergie","id":3346,"login":"bergie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commit/81d4162db1044944aeadbfc6b51d2d2b7541287a","node_id":"C_kwDOUu44yNoAKDgxZDQxNjJkYjEwNDQ5NDRhZWFkYmZjNmI1MWQyZDJiNzU0MTI4N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commit/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e","sha":"857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e"}],"sha":"81d4162db1044944aeadbfc6b51d2d2b7541287a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/81d4162db1044944aeadbfc6b51d2d2b7541287a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3346?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bergie","id":3346,"login":"bergie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:09:21Z","email":"henri.bergius@iki.fi","name":"Henri Bergius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:00:11Z","email":"henri.bergius@iki.fi","name":"Henri Bergius"},"message":"fix: dampen the sea-state swell term by wave period\n\nThe swell term was a plain quadratic in wave height\n(30 * swh^2 * steepen), so any open-ocean cell above about 2.23 m\nscored over 150 and landed in the extreme band on its own — a routine\n2.25 m trade swell at 12 s in light wind was flagged extreme.\n\nScale the swell term by 5 / max(mwp, 5): periods of 5 s or less (steep\ncoastal wind seas, and the missing-wave-data default of 5 s) keep the\nexact original values, while a 12 s swell is cut to 5/12, moving\nstandard trade swells back into the slight/good bands. The opposing-\ncurrent steepening factor still applies on top. Band cuts (35/50/75/\n100/150) are unchanged for cross-plugin parity.","tree":{"sha":"ef5d5d13b080006fa8d2b00d003776b2d4b4f2c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/git/trees/ef5d5d13b080006fa8d2b00d003776b2d4b4f2c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/git/commits/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3346?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bergie","id":3346,"login":"bergie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commit/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e","node_id":"C_kwDOUu44yNoAKDg1N2VhMGRkYjU5NzQwOWI3ZTYxNDRiYjJjMTYzZTI2NDY2MDJhNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commit/e046e053432dac42d5ed255577eb66b312d9ee37","sha":"e046e053432dac42d5ed255577eb66b312d9ee37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/e046e053432dac42d5ed255577eb66b312d9ee37"}],"sha":"857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/857ea0ddb597409b7e6144bb2c163e2646602a4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3346?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bergie","id":3346,"login":"bergie","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bergie","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/motamman/signalk-weather-router-plus/commits/ab9f0efc4e08516eccac88720990fdb011aa75c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:53:52Z","email":"henri.bergius@iki.fi","name":"Henri Bergius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:53:52Z","email":"henri.bergius@iki.fi","name":"Henri Bergius"},"message":"feat: show the wind and wave range on the Freeboard panel leg cards\n\nThe panel builds its own leg cards from the route GeoJSON (legFields),\nso the same leg read differently on the chart plotter than in the web\napp''s itinerary. Pick up leg_wind_min_ms / leg_wind_max_ms and\nleg_swh_min_m / leg_swh_max_m from the departing point and format them\nwith the same drop-the-first-unit range helper as the web app (ES5, as\nthe panel is); arrival cards and legs without ranges render as before.\nThe panel''s point descriptions share legFields, so they pick the range\nup too.","tree":{"sha":"82a21d814c3758c7