rl":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/0201eb1f51550ac859f031c670a39f1010fd56d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:25:48Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:25:48Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"add the batch upload, match and confirm API\n\nThe bulk UI needs to upload many IEPs, poll their reading,\nand confirm a student per scan. A scan with no student is\nvisible to its uploader only, admins included, so another\nuser''s unmatched IEP can''t be read, listed or skipped.\n\nrefs IEP-BULK\nflag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- run spec/controllers/supports\n- PUT imports/:id/student with an unmanageable student is 403\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38e3bcaef5359c2f5ff2d87604e703d0bc738401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/38e3bcaef5359c2f5ff2d87604e703d0bc738401"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/0201eb1f51550ac859f031c670a39f1010fd56d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crap