8@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"review each scan in turn on a two-column page\n\nChecking 25 scans one after another needs a queue, a\nsticky Apply & next and focus that follows the work.\n\nflag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- confirm 3 matches, Review 3 scans\n- Apply & next moves focus to the next scan heading\n- Skip, Back to matches; narrow the window for the stepper\n- open one IEP on its own: no queue, Apply and Undo work\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25730a3d70751e787fc5d1908061e4c102e60d5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/25730a3d70751e787fc5d1908061e4c102e60d5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/f816e521d2429cca57708ef55de03662497a494d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/f816e521d2429cca57708ef55de03662497a494d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGY4MTZlNTIx