ag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- run the migration twice (it is idempotent)\n- run spec/models/supports\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77a07815d38f1ebe8fffdb21b1af1dbafdf2757a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/77a07815d38f1ebe8fffdb21b1af1dbafdf2757a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/028a65a27e96719b13b9529f77427c05f81dab4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/028a65a27e96719b13b9529f77427c05f81dab4b","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDAyOGE2NWEyN2U5NjcxOWIxM2I5NTI5Zjc3NDI3YzA1ZjgxZGFiNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/1f8d3fd1447a9e8e78cd185b80a846858df573f2","sha":"1f8d3fd1447a9e8e78cd185b80a846858df573f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/1f8d3fd1447a9e8e78cd185b80a846858df573f2"}