/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/f5555b1823dbe79b0b39db4b6e382837a98af1d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:11:21Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:11:21Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"propose a student for an IEP from its name and ID\n\nMatching saves typing in a bulk upload, but a wrong guess\nwould put a plan on the wrong child, so anything doubtful\nis ambiguous and only one clear match is confident.\n\nrefs IEP-BULK\nflag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- run spec/services/supports/student_matcher_spec.rb\n- same name twice, or ID and name disagreeing, is ambiguous\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec4373143c9027cdd6b054c9f4dd3d4136be9a5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/ec4373143c9027cdd6b054c9f4dd3d4136be9a5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/f5555b1823dbe79b0b39db4b6e382837a98af1d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified