3f465dd04a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:16:49Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:16:49Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"choose the model per AI feature\n\nOne model for everything meant a school couldn''t pick\na cheaper or stronger model for IEP scanning alone.\nEach school and the site can now set a default model\nand a model per feature, blank meaning use the next\nlevel. A site switch decides whether schools may\nchoose models while using the shared key.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/controllers/supports spec/services/supports\n  spec/models/supports\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"496b167385d4b545c222a00ab7ae3ed6fe1a8548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/496b167385d4b545c222a00ab7ae3ed6fe1a8548"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/754e55784ac74da5070896122e26413f465dd04a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/754e55784ac74da5070896122e26413f465dd04a","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDc1NGU1NTc4NGFjNzRkYTUwNzA4OTYxMjJlMjY0MTNmNDY1ZGQwNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b","sha":"d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b"}],"sha":"754e55784ac74da5070896122e26413f465dd04a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/754e55784ac74da5070896122e26413f465dd04a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:37:05Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:37:05Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"make the IEP scan request one the API accepts\n\nThe scan''s answer schema was invalid and Haiku rejects\nthe effort setting, so every scan failed and was\nreported as an unreadable file. Each accommodation is\nnow chosen from the school''s own catalog names, effort\nis only sent to models that take it, and files up to\n20 MB are accepted.\n\nflag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/supports\n- yarn test ui/features/supports\n- scan a PDF with the key saved in AI settings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0baaf1715f9932247362ae0a00737199a45424bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/0baaf1715f9932247362ae0a00737199a45424bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGQ1NzA4MGMzOTRhNGUzYTlkZjA2ZGY1MDA1YjU3NjNhYWYwZTY3MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d","sha":"6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d"}],"sha":"d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d57080c394a4e3a9df06df5005b5763aaf0e672b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:29:13Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:29:13Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"say what is wrong when the key has no workspace\n\nA key not tied to a workspace made the API answer 400,\nwhich a scan reported as an unreadable file and Test\nconnection as a model problem. A key with no workspace\nand an account out of credit now say so in plain words.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/supports/iep_extractor_spec.rb\n  spec/services/supports/anthropic_connection_test_spec.rb\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec3cbebd529e8ab857f3923ecd428e42a1ad556e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/ec3cbebd529e8ab857f3923ecd428e42a1ad556e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDZhYmNkZmI1YjM1ZWNhMmY5ZGQzOWUwOWNjZjAzNDY4YzU0NTcyMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0","sha":"8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0"}],"sha":"6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/6abcdfb5b35eca2f9dd39e09ccf03468c545720d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:23:37Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:23:37Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"find new students, and search by SIS ID\n\nThe student search only looked at enrolled students and\nonly matched names, so a student added but not yet in a\ncourse never showed. It now also finds people with a\nlogin at the school and no staff role, matches SIS\nuser IDs and login IDs, and shows the SIS ID so people\nwith the same name can be told apart.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/controllers/supports/students_controller_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/features/supports\n- search Supports for a new student by name and SIS ID\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72a4bd607facb7e95464f6986b1fa2cb753d6f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/72a4bd607facb7e95464f6986b1fa2cb753d6f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDhkNmU0MGY2YWI2ZTc0NWZjZTllOTdkNjk2NGJhYWQzYmFjYzE2ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3","sha":"a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3"}],"sha":"8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/8d6e40f6ab6e745fce9e97d6964baad3bacc16e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:52:50Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:52:50Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"fix the problems the AI settings review found\n\nA key pasted with a line break or space inside it was\nsaved, then reported as a service outage on every scan.\nSuch keys, and keys too short to be real, are now\nrefused with a plain message. Two first saves at once\nno longer fail for the slower one, a blank policy value\nno longer errors, and a site admin who can''t save a\nschool''s key no longer sees that section.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/models/supports\n  spec/controllers/supports\n- yarn test ui/features/ai_settings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b231cf607e9010c8b0a6775c509385c9c75baa0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/b231cf607e9010c8b0a6775c509385c9c75baa0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/a5bfcf1a46a5da9c496585b5eddf25d92c8e68b3","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGE1YmZjZjFhNDZhNWRhOWM0OTY1ODViNWVkZGYyNWQ5MmM4ZTY4YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/d65952599943d547cb26d0a149a18e293abfdc85","sha":"d65952599943d547cb26d0a149a18e293abfdc85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Fran