,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/f3c32d6bba7d650a16c03c21fa1824b5de551a92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:21:10Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:21:10Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"store the Anthropic key per school or site-wide\n\nIEP scanning read its key from a server file, so only\nsomeone with server access could set it. A table holds\na school''s own key or one shared key (encrypted, only\nthe last four characters kept in the clear), and one\nplace decides which is used.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/models/supports/anthropic_setting_spec.rb\n  spec/services/supports/anthropic_config_spec.rb\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1617327365bf9a99b182e4681e6e8f3aaef2d6e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/1617327365bf9a99b182e4681e6e8f3aaef2d6e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/f3c32d6bba7d650a16c03c21fa1824b5de551a92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/f3c32d6bba7d650a16c03c21fa1824b5de551a92","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGYzYzMyZDZiYmE3ZDY1MGExNmMwM2MyMWZhMTgyNGI1ZGU1NTFhOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751","sha":"00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751"}],"sha":"f3c32d6bba7d650a16c03c21fa1824b5de551a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/f3c32d6bba7d650a16c03c21fa1824b5de551a92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:32:15Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:32:15Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"fix the problems the IEP scan review found\n\nAny signed-in user could list imports, including scan\npreviews, by adding a student_id to the request. Scan\npreviews also stored the document''s words in a column\nthat isn''t encrypted; they are now built from the\nencrypted extraction when read. Also: an unreadable\nfile no longer says the service is down, a lost scan\ncan be retried, Apply can''t run twice, a scan is only\nfor someone at this school, Discard no longer claims\nsuccess when it failed, and the settings editor keeps\nchanges until Save.\n\nflag=iep_scan\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/supports spec/controllers/supports\n  spec/models/supports\n- yarn test ui/features/supports\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f53a4d766ba504f05f0fdbebb25b4c0ff7249dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/4f53a4d766ba504f05f0fdbebb25b4c0ff7249dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDAwZmEzMjQ4NjVmYWY5NzlkNWY4MDI2Y2JmOTgyNDBiMDY1NDU3NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/20f613893e30dee69d7df3e1e8306148f3844004","sha":"20f613893e30dee69d7df3e1e8306148f3844004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/20f613893e30dee69d7df3e1e8306148f3844004"}],"sha":"00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/00fa324865faf979d5f8026cbf98240b06545751"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.co