, a held-up-only toggle,\npaging, and the turnaround line) and a Grading\nlink in the header and side nav for people who\nteach or assist. The nav files also carry earlier\nuncommitted Admin link work, committed with them.\n\nflag=workflow_grading_queue\n\ntest plan:\n- turn on Teacher Workflow for the root account\n  and Grading Queue for the account\n- as a teacher, open Grading from the nav\n- a student''s submission appears with a reason\n  and a Grade link that opens SpeedGrader\n- toggle \"Held up only\" and page through\n- bin/rspec spec/models/teacher_workflow_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/features/workflow_grading_queue\n  ui/features/navigation_header\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2491fa3e5a93a0daea415b1cbb193a0a2ed306bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/2491fa3e5a93a0daea415b1cbb193a0a2ed306bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/1632d3d7e4329d890c4fd5be864784cfbbef7864","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type"