om/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/0d25d81cb62d5545fbb92591d97afe64b68c1c87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T06:02:34Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T06:02:34Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"make accommodations act (supports Phase 2)\n\nAccommodations now change what students get instead\nof only telling teachers: extra quiz time and\nattempts, a pacing change, display settings. Each\nchange is recorded for the case manager. Students\nwithout accommodations are unaffected.\n\nAn accommodated quiz attempt started before the lock\ndate gets its full time past the lock.\n\nrefs none\nflag=supports_accommodations_apply\n\ntest plan:\n- give a student 1.5x extended time; start a timed\n  quiz that locks soon; the timer runs past the lock\n- Moderate page shows \"From an accommodation\"\n- Supports page, student: \"Applied this week\" lists it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f42ceaa0899efd14bbbdad19d