avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/fa6a3cec822031e247b882daef9632f4296b6e92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:06:24Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:06:24Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"wire up the parent flyer and link-request flow\n\nThe Parents admin page, the flyer sign-up landing page, and\nthe parent-side find-your-student flow existed only as\nisolated controllers, services and React components: none\nof it was reachable.\n\n- routes.rb had no entries at all for\n  SelfPaced::ParentsController or\n  SelfPaced::LinkRequestsController, page or API.\n- ui/featureBundles.ts had no self_paced_parents entry, so\n  the admin page''s JS could never load.\n- AdminHubController never linked to it.\n- FindStudent.tsx (search-for-your-student UI) was fully\n  built and tested but never rendered by ObserverApp, and\n  imported LinkRequest/FoundStudent/StudentSearch types\n  that types.ts never exported.\n- The flyer''s own code (/parents/signup/:code) had a\n  service (SchoolParentSignup) and a spec, but no\n  controller, no route and no page.\n- ObserverView.show_for? required an existing link, so a\n  parent with zero students could never reach the page that\n  would let them ask for one; SchoolParentSignup already\n  set a self_paced_parent preference for exactly this case,\n  but nothing read it.\n- StudentFinder and LinkRequestsController#require_parent\n  called ObserverView.viewable_course?/parent_account? as\n  class methods that didn''t exist (viewable_course? was a\n  private instance method; parent_account? was never\n  written), so search and the parent gate would 500.\n\nAdd the missing routes, controller and featureBundles\nentry, read the self_paced_parent preference in\nshow_for?, add the two missing ObserverView class methods,\nmount FindStudent in the empty state, add the missing\nFindStudent types, and branch the sign-up page''s copy for\na flyer code that isn''t tied to a student.\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_observer_view\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rails routes | grep self_paced_parents\n- bin/rspec spec/controllers/self_paced/parents_controller_spec.rb\n  spec/controllers/self_paced/link_requests_controller_spec.rb\n  spec/controllers/admin_hub_controller_spec.rb\n  spec/services/self_paced/school_parent_signup_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/features/self_paced_observer\n  ui/features/self_paced_parents ui/features/self_paced_parent_signup\n- yarn check:ts\n- with self_paced + self_paced_observer_view on: admin hub\n  shows a Parents link; open it, see the flyer and QR code;\n  open the flyer''s link in a private window, make an\n  account, search for a student and ask; back in the admin\n  Parents page, approve the request; the parent''s dashboard\n  now shows that student\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8db8d8b925cc4e4700db6920fbdb3209a0fb45ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/8db8d8b925cc4e4700db6920fbdb3209a0fb45ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/fa6a3cec822031e247b882daef9632f4296b6e92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/fa6a3cec822031e247b882daef9632f4296b6e92","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGZhNmEzY2VjODIyMDMxZTI0N2I4ODJkYWVmOTYzMmY0Mjk2YjZlOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/a41ec473422a79c5fc7c5134c0d3e206afc693c3","sha":"a41ec473422a79c5fc7c5134c0d3e206afc693c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/a41ec473422a79c5fc7c5134c0d3e206afc693c3"}],"sha":"fa6a3cec822031e247b882daef9632f4296b6e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/fa6a3cec822031e247b882daef9632f4296b6e92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/a41ec473422a79c5fc7c5134c0d3e206afc693c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:36:27Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:36:27Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"track config/brandable_css.yml\n\nAsset compilation failed on a fresh clone with ENOENT on\nconfig/brandable_css.yml. It has no secrets or per-machine\nvalues (just static build paths), unlike the other files\nunder config/*.yml, so track it like brakeman.yml and\ncode_ownership.yml instead of requiring each environment\nto hand-create it.\n\nrefs none\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- fresh clone has config/brandable_css.yml present\n- docker_dev_setup.sh gets past ''Compile assets'' without\n  the config/brandable_css.yml ENOENT error\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33c08c877957abcc99e7c5816d651b621e17aa68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/33c08c877957abcc99e7c5816d651b621e17aa68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly