following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/50679c9109230df5c24e5fcc68b650cbc7215858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:13:28Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:13:28Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"restore executable bit on scripts (again)\n\nA Windows-side commit (fbfbfb) re-swept these 185 scripts\nback to mode 644, undoing c0a89bc7. Windows git can''t see\nthe POSIX exec bit, so any commit made from a plain Windows\nshell against this checkout will silently flip it back.\n\nRestore 100755 on the real scripts. Commit and push this\none from WSL so the mode change actually sticks.\n\nrefs none\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- git ls-files -s script/install_assets.sh shows 100755\n- fresh clone + docker_dev_setup.sh gets past\n  ''Bundle install'' without ''permission denied'' on\n  install_assets.sh\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39a1d0cee76df17cbfdd9456106d5fcd6d440c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/39a1d0cee76df17cbfdd9456106d5fcd6d440c19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/c