e-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd","sha":"ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd"}],"sha":"8d5c896cb71281231e22c1dca6d44f3c360bd33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/8d5c896cb71281231e22c1dca6d44f3c360bd33e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:03:16Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:03:16Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"add support plans and accommodations (Phase 1)\n\nTeachers must know each student''s accommodations,\nand the school needs one place to keep 504, IEP\nand EL plans. This adds plans, a catalog of\naccommodations, an accommodations card and roster\ndot for teachers with a read acknowledgement, a\ncaseload and plan editor for case managers, and a\nCSV import with preview and undo. Free text is\nencrypted, and every read is logged.\n\nflag=supports_plans\n\ntest plan:\n- turn on Student Supports and Plans for the root\n  account; open Supports from the account menu\n- give a student a plan with an accommodation\n- as the student''s teacher, open them on the\n  Students page: the tray shows the accommodation\n  and the roster shows a dot\n- import a CSV, apply it, then undo it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71604eeda20be127cf6c46c3644306f01af28361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/71604eeda20be127cf6c46c3644306f01af28361"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGFlMWJhNDgyYWUxNWJiZmQxMmMzY2Q5NmM3MWJjOGY3MTdmNzc0YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036","sha":"d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036"}],"sha":"ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ae1ba482ae15bbfd12c3cd96c71bc8f717f774bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:35:23Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:35:23Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"add student supports foundations (Phase 0)\n\nThe teacher workflow and 504/IEP plan starts with\nthe privacy model, because every later phase\nholds protected student records. This adds the\nneed-to-know rules before any data exists: who\nmay see which tier of a student''s records, an\nappend-only log of every read, assigned support\ncaseloads, and the Case Manager and Support Staff\nroles. Also the plan''s revision 2 with the user''s\nanswers and the Phase 0 spike results.\n\nflag=student_supports\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/supports\n  spec/models/supports spec/models/supports_spec.rb\n- turn on Student Supports for the root account;\n  the seven Student Supports permissions appear\n  on the account roles permissions page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ebf130144e34ab938dca9d25677e67f699aa8fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/9ebf130144e34ab938dca9d25677e67f699aa8fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGQwYjRlOTQyYjhjMDZmNjdkMDUyN2MwMGQ1OGRkZmQzY2M4NWYwMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/7725fa30d1a3d8ddef25dd69a1d6391b5d3420f8","sha":"7725fa30d1a3d8ddef25dd69a1d6391b5d3420f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/7725fa30d1a3d8ddef25dd69a1d6391b5d3420f8"}],"sha":"d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/d0b4e942b8c06f67d0527c00d58ddfd3cc85f036"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/7725fa30d1a3d8ddef25dd69a1d6391b5d3420f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T07:05:30Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T07:05:30Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"remove New Quizzes\n\nNew Quizzes is an LTI tool that only runs on\nInstructure''s hosted service, so it can never work\nhere. Classic Quizzes is our assessment engine.\nThis removes Quizzes.Next and the code that only\nserved it: the quiz engine choice, quiz_lti\nassignments, the quizzes2 export, NQ import/export\nin common cartridge, NQ speed grading, anonymous\nparticipants and surveys, the YouTube NQ scan, the\nNQ LTI variables, APIs, permissions and flags.\n\nOutcomes Service results and alignments only came\nfrom New Quizzes, so those reads go too.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- the Quizzes page, the Assignments \"+ Quiz\" button\n  and adding a quiz to a module make classic\n  quizzes with no engine choice\n- copy or import a course; it finishes \"imported\"\n- external tool launches still open and return\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ea6fc354b5cae219d84bfca9709c8cad10ea28d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/0ea6fc354b5cae219d84bfca9709c8cad10ea28d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/7725fa30d1a3d8ddef25dd69a1d6391b5d3420f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a