Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T18:49:23Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"remove Canvas Career (Horizon)\n\nIt runs on Instructure''s hosted Career services, and\nno self-paced school reaches it. Removes Career mode,\nthe Career and Horizon controllers and services, the\nhorizon account and course behavior, the Pine, Redwood\nand Content Service clients, Kafka events, the bulk\nuser API, and module estimated-duration editing.\n\nA migration drops canvas_career_user_experiences and\nexternal_content_references. The horizon_course and\ncareer_learning_library_only columns and the\nEstimatedDuration model stay.\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n- run db:migrate; both tables are gone\n- open a course, its Modules page and an assignment\n  edit page: no errors, no Career links or settings\n- account settings has no Canvas Career section\n- adding, indenting and removing a module item works\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86860fd523f649552dbb59dc52390f239d81e6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/86860fd523f649552dbb59dc52390f239d81e6c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/942bd7c3d9d214282c47181d6e345f5be104df59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/o