:"2026-09-26T01:54:25Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced phases 4-9 and the material redesign\n\nCheckpoint before Phase 10 removes code, so the\nremovals can be reverted on their own.\n\n- Phases 4-9: pacing, interventions, alerts,\n  reports and attendance, observer view, parent\n  invites, test-out by skill\n- Material 1 look for the student, staff and\n  admin pages, the course menu and dropdowns\n- Skills, Units and course home pages for staff\n- Question layouts, units, hotspots, confidence\n- Icons drawn as Material Symbols; rebrand\n\nflag=self_paced\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb9626cdf3ed8da30ea63f85d4ea7ecfae595001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/bb9626cdf3ed8da30ea63f85d4ea7ecfae595001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/17a26dca8b1a111387327ff043c11422277fc7de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view