yer, setup, video\n\nStudents in self-paced courses need one focused\npath through the course, and teachers need a way\nto say what each item is for:\n\n- course map at /courses/:id/player; course home\n  and modules send students there\n- player bar on item pages (previous, next, map,\n  progress) replaces the course menu and footer\n- Course Player tab: setup screen for roles,\n  minutes, thresholds, attempts, retake review\n- video completion for must_watch items (YouTube,\n  Vimeo, HTML5/Canvas media), capped by wall time\n- item settings and course player settings\n  survive course copy and export\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_course_player\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/self_paced\n  spec/controllers/self_paced\n  spec/models/content_migration/course_copy_self_paced_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/features/self_paced_player\n  ui/features/self_paced_setup ui/shared/self-paced\n- as a student in a course with the flag on, open\n  the course and step through it with Next\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c9cde727e66a9b00a1f3e2453b1f2fca3c6b111","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/8c9cde727e66a9b00a1f3e2453b1f2fca3c6b111"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/748f5d3d80cc2d40551f4e994d829c06d25ca5f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/748f5d3d80cc2d40551f4e994d829c06d25ca5f9","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDc0OGY1ZDNkODBjYzJkNDA1NTFmNGU5OTRkODI5YzA2ZDI1Y2E1Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf","sha":"4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf"}],"sha":"748f5d3d80cc2d40551f4e994d829c06d25ca5f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/748f5d3d80cc2d40551f4e994d829c06d25ca5f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:09:45Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:09:45Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced phase 3a: gating engine and retake rule\n\nMastery gating in self-paced courses needs more\nthan Canvas modules offer, so the engine now has:\n\n- module_item_settings: role, minutes, threshold,\n  video watch fraction, attempts, retake review;\n  the setup API writes them as native module\n  requirements (sequential, chained units)\n- per-student unlock/exempt/complete overrides\n- a must_watch requirement type\n- provisional mode: a check waiting for a grade\n  counts as met; a failing grade re-locks and\n  notifies the student''s mentors (or teachers)\n- review before retake: a student who missed\n  mastery reopens the lesson before trying again\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_course_player\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/self_paced\n  spec/controllers/self_paced\n  spec/messages/self_paced_item_relocked.erb_spec.rb\n- existing module, module API and quiz eligibility\n  specs still pass\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b105e3fc2abbf25b62bab18b94be58e5f7942b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/1b105e3fc2abbf25b62bab18b94be58e5f7942b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDRkMjlkOWVlZDQ1OGM4NTBjYjgyN2JiYjBlOWIwZjhjNmYxNjcwY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a","sha":"ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a"}],"sha":"4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/4d29d9eed458c850cb827bbb0e9b0f8c6f1670cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:28:29Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:28:29Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced: dashboard as its own page in global nav\n\nStaff reach the student dashboard from anywhere,\nnot from inside one course, so:\n\n- \"Students\" item in the global navigation (and\n  the InstUI side nav and mobile menu) for staff\n  who can use the dashboard; cached for 5 minutes\n- the course sidebar tab is gone; ?course_id=\n  opens the page filtered to one course\n- the page opens for mentors whose school has no\n  tracked students yet, instead of refusing them\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_teacher_dashboard\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/controllers/self_paced\n  spec/models/self_paced_spec.rb\n  spec/views/shared/_new_nav_header.html.erb_spec.rb\n- as a teacher with the dashboard on, click\n  Students in the global navigation; courses no\n  longer show a Student Dashboard tab\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab4bd8610c720ed20466c0e19e115467808c755d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/ab4bd8610c720ed20466c0e19e115467808c755d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKGZmODZiMzU4OTM4YjRjZTY1OTUzNThhN2NiNGYwY2MzZDc4NmQxNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/15db3fcbb3a82f4203b4b72e519ddaf716205e15","sha":"15db3fcbb3a82f4203b4b72e519ddaf716205e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/15db3fcbb3a82f4203b4b72e519ddaf716205e15"}],"sha":"ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/ff86b358938b4ce6595358a7cb4f0cc3d786d16a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/15db3fcbb3a82f4203b4b72e519ddaf716205e15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:08:40Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T04:08:40Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced phase 2: teacher and mentor dashboard\n\nStaff need one place to see how every self-paced\nstudent is doing and who needs help right now:\n\n- roster with progress, grade, last active, time\n  today and this week, and tries on the current\n  item; sortable, filtered by course, with a\n  pinned \"My caseload\" section\n- live seating chart: working, idle and away\n  students with the page they''re on and for how\n  long, in each course''s color\n- student tray: 4-week activity chart, time and\n  completion per item, attempt history, timeline\n- account-level Mentor role (read-only grades)\n  and caseload pins, purged and merged with users\n- \"Student Dashboard\" course tab for staff\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_teacher_dashboard\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/self_paced\n  spec/controllers/self_paced\n  spec/models/course_self_paced_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/features/self_paced_dashboard\n- turn on self_paced, self_paced_activity_tracking\n  and self_paced_teacher_dashboard; as a teacher\n  open Student Dashboard in a course; star a\n  student, switch to Live, open a student\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{