"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/94f1be3268b5e4fa8e952842634c08e5156b21c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:11:36Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:11:36Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced phase 1: activity ledger and read model\n\nTeachers need time on task, presence and progress\nper student without keeping raw page views, so:\n\n- browser pinger (ui/shared/self-paced) posts\n  active seconds once a minute while the tab is\n  visible; 0 seconds marks online-but-idle\n- ledger upserts into activity_days, item_times\n  and student_course_states presence; no URLs,\n  IPs or user agents are stored\n- progress columns refreshed by a debounced job\n  from submission, score and module progress\n  hooks, plus a nightly rebuild\n- rows purged when a user is deleted and moved\n  when users merge\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced_activity_tracking\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/services/self_paced\n  spec/controllers/self_paced\n  spec/controllers/courses_controller_self_paced_spec.rb\n- yarn test ui/shared/self-paced\n- turn on self_paced and self_paced_activity_tracking,\n  browse a course as a student, then check\n  SelfPaced::ActivityDay / StudentCourseState in\n  the rails console\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb1f57ce41526f773fd800a587ea9b5fe84a1ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/bb1f57ce41526f773fd800a587ea9b5fe84a1ce8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/94f1be3268b5e4fa8e952842634c08e5156b21c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/94f1be3268b5e4fa8e952842634c08e5156b21c1","node_id":"C_kwDOUvB7dNoAKDk0ZjFiZTMyNjhiNWU0ZmE4ZTk1Mjg0MjYzNGMwOGU1MTU2YjIxYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commit/9a8220ff13e58944ef6a1458f87ccd52f886ca15","sha":"9a8220ff13e58944ef6a1458f87ccd52f886ca15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/9a8220ff13e58944ef6a1458f87ccd52f886ca15"}],"sha":"94f1be3268b5e4fa8e952842634c08e5156b21c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/94f1be3268b5e4fa8e952842634c08e5156b21c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/commits/9a8220ff13e58944ef6a1458f87ccd52f886ca15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:32:07Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:32:07Z","email":"cbabushka58@gmail.com","name":"niko"},"message":"self-paced phase 0: flags, permissions, spike\n\nLays the groundwork for the self-paced platform\nin docs/fork-plan.md without changing behavior:\n\n- self_paced umbrella flag plus one hidden flag\n  per phase; SelfPaced.feature_enabled? keeps a\n  phase off while the umbrella is off\n- 8 self-paced permissions, hidden until the\n  umbrella flag is on\n- hide New Quizzes and Analytics Hub, which need\n  Instructure-hosted services we can''t run\n- video-tracking spike (docs/spikes) and plan\n  corrections from it\n\nrefs none\nflag=self_paced\n\ntest plan:\n- bin/rspec spec/models/self_paced_spec.rb\n  spec/models/self_paced/permissions_spec.rb\n  spec/apis/v1/tabs_api_spec.rb\n- as site admin, Account > Feature Options shows\n  Self-Paced Platform; turning it on shows the\n  Self-Paced permissions under Permissions\n- New Quizzes and Analytics Hub no longer appear\n  for regular admins\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4feb6362b4db91132d724a247119699a621c1016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/trees/4feb6362b4db91132d724a247119699a621c1016"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Quite-Frankly-Yep-Yeah/QF-DEMO/git/commits/9a8220ff13e58944ef6a1458f87ccd52f886ca15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/233181982?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/S-Crapper","id":233181982,"login":"S-Crapper","node_id":"U_kgDODeYTHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/S-Crapper","user_view_type":"public"},"