/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/9d6d5ed24c12720b77d7d9618dbc8a299c4df16d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:39:27Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:39:27Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Document the two-carrier setup (Acme + Vantage Direct) in README/CLAUDE.md\n\nUpdates both docs to reflect Vantage Direct existing alongside Acme:\nthe shared route-config-kit, the vin validator, the additive (no .del())\nsecond seed file convention, and the actual point of having two carriers\n— proving \"adding a carrier is config-only\" rather than just asserting\nit, and setting up the Playwright-vs-API bind split that lives in\nquoteflow-apps'' automation-worker (this service stays deliberately blind\nto which one a given carrier uses).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b0ba9361469075e0c1cc263a9fdb8182a2d7a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/1b0ba9361469075e0c1cc263a9fdb8182a2d7a39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/9d6d5ed24c