/api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/a3ad319c59e68ec1c3ce74e6e64e0769aaad3ba2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:28:43Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:28:43Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Add Vantage Direct: a second carrier, API-driven instead of Playwright\n\nAcme stays exactly as it was — Playwright-driven bind against a mock\ncarrier portal. Vantage Direct is the second carrier: same rating/reports\nadapter contracts, a completely different bind integration (a REST API\nin quoteflow-apps'' automation-worker, not a browser). Nothing in the\nquote lifecycle (quote.service.ts, quote-validation.ts, the routes)\nchanged to support it — registering VantageAutoRatingAdapter/\nVantageAutoReportsAdapter under a new carrier code in src/di/container.ts\nreally is the entire integration surface, exactly as that file''s own\ncomment claimed before there was a second carrier to prove it against.\n\nAlso: hoisted the carrier-agnostic parts of Acme''s routeConfigs (the\nPage/Section/Field types and the Base -> Portal -> State resolver — pure\nfunctions and type defs, zero Acme-specific logic) into\nsrc/carriers/shared/route-config-kit.ts, since duplicating real logic\nacross carriers (as opposed to each carrier''s own config data) would be\na straightforward defect waiting to happen. Acme''s own types.ts/resolve.ts\nare now one-line re-exports; existing imports and resolve.spec.ts are\nunchanged, verified by the full suite passing with zero modifications\nto Acme''s tests.\n\nVantage''s config also exercises two things Acme''s single-page sample\nnever did: two pages (driver-info + a new vehicle-info page collecting a\nVIN), and a new validators/vin.validator.ts (format-checked, reused via\nthe same name->function registry every carrier''s config already shares).\n\nVerified live: manifest.json indexes both carriers'' bundles, a Vantage\nquote rates using VantageAutoRatingAdapter''s own numbers (550 base vs.\nAcme''s 600), pulls its own MVR logic (keyed off VIN, not SSN), and the\ncompiled bundle''s agent-portal resolution genuinely hides the vin field\n(dynamically imported and called directly, not just asserted in a test).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eaf01ac90b194f12c33eb86a17a027389a56a7b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/eaf01ac90b194f12c33eb86a17a027389a56a7b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/a3ad319c59e68ec1c3ce74e6e64e0769aaad3ba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/a3ad319c59e68ec1c3ce74e6e64e0769aaad3ba2","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGNwtoAKGEzYWQzMTljNTllNjhlYzFjM2NlNzRlNmU2NGUwNzY5YWFhZDNiYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777","sha":"3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777"}],"sha":"a3ad319c59e68ec1c3ce74e6e64e0769aaad3ba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/a3ad319c59e68ec1c3ce74e6e64e0769aaad3ba2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T01:22:57Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T01:22:57Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Fix cross-repo CORS gaps; declare DLX/DLQ topology for carrier.bind.requested\n\nTwo independent fixes, found and verified while wiring quoteflow-apps''\nbff-gateway and (now) automation-worker against this service:\n\n- bff-gateway proxies quote reads/writes here server-to-server, but Node''s\n  fetch sends no Origin header on its own — this router''s CORS policy\n  deliberately rejects requests with none. Fixed by having bff-gateway\n  identify itself with an Origin header and whitelisting it here.\n- /bundles had no CORS middleware at all, which would silently block the\n  browser''s direct cross-origin fetch()/dynamic import() of the manifest\n  and compiled bundles (customer-portal/agent-portal fetch these directly,\n  not through bff-gateway). Fixed with cors({origin:true}) scoped to that\n  route only — safe since these are public, non-credentialed static\n  assets, unlike /quotes.\n\nAlso declares the dead-letter exchange/queue for carrier.bind.requested\nhere, not just on the consumer side: quoteflow-apps'' automation-worker\n(being built next) needs x-dead-letter-exchange/-routing-key on the main\nqueue to retry-then-DLQ failed bind jobs, and RabbitMQ requires every\nassertQueue call for a given name to agree on arguments. Declaring the\nsame topology on both sides means either service can boot first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52cc0407fbe7d5b28a6004011905e40246de493f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/52cc0407fbe7d5b28a6004011905e40246de493f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGNwtoAKDNmNTMwOTU0ZjQ2YzE5ZmU0MTllZmNjZjYxOWIwZDA1MjNmYjQ3Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6","sha":"05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6"}],"sha":"3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/3f530954f46c19fe419efccf619b0d0523fb4777"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:39:02Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:39:02Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"GET /quotes/:quoteId/schemas now returns saved answers\n\nquoteflow-apps'' useQuoteSession needs this for its resume-link path\n(sessionStorage empty but a quoteId is present — hydrate from Repo 1\nbefore falling back). The quote row already carried `answers`; the\nroute handler just wasn''t putting it on the response. Verified live:\ncreated a quote, PATCHed firstName, confirmed GET .../schemas now\nechoes answers.driver-info.firstName back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c4411bbae9ab6f78e02331d6b82c69a0965440b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/0c4411bbae9ab6f78e02331d6b82c69a0965440b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGNwtoAKDA1YjgyMDVkOTU4YTRhODhkZGM5NWMyYzllYjRmYjcxMjk1ZTBlYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7","sha":"c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7"}],"sha":"05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/05b8205d958a4a88ddc95c2c9eb4fb71295e0ea6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:52:48Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:52:48Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Step 10: README completion\n\n- Fixed a broken markdown table (accidental blank line split the\n  lifecycle endpoints table into two).\n- Added a \"What this demonstrates\" overview up top and a \"Relationship\n  to quoteflow-apps\" section at the bottom, so the README stands alone\n  for someone landing on this repo without the companion prompt.\n- Linked CLAUDE.md and the ADR from a Design notes section.\n\nquoteflow-rating-service is now feature-complete per its build plan\n(all 10 steps): Express skeleton, Postgres/Redis/RabbitMQ-backed quote\nlifecycle through bind, InversifyJS carrier dispatch, the config and\nvalidator esbuild bundlers, SSE bind progress, the middleware-order\nguard test, and OpenTelemetry — all verified live against real local\ninfra, not just unit-tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f71960567fe89017ddc79445e527b3ade5e5f9c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/f71960567fe89017ddc79445e527b3ade5e5f9c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGNwtoAKGM0ZjhlNjAwNjk5ZTYxOTYzNzNiMzcwYzIwMTM2NzQ3MTIwNWYzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760","sha":"806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760"}],"sha":"c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/c4f8e600699e6196373b370c201367471205f3e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:51:15Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:51:15Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Step 9: OpenTelemetry instrumentation\n\n- src/telemetry/otel.ts: NodeSDK with getNodeAutoInstrumentations\n  (Express/HTTP/pg auto-patched) and a console span exporter by\n  default; imported as the literal first line of server.ts since\n  instrumentation patches modules at require() time and has to run\n  before express/pg/amqplib are required, or it silently produces no\n  spans.\n- Moved the OpenTelemetry packages from devDependencies to\n  dependencies (they run in production, not just at build/test time)\n  and dropped the unused OTLP-HTTP exporter in favor of the console\n  one, per the plan''s default decision.\n- Verified live: POST /quotes produced an HTTP server span\n  (`POST /quotes`, status 201, correct route) with pg.connect and\n  pg.query child spans under the same traceId — the actual span tree\n  the auto-instrumentation is supposed to produce, not just \"it\n  didn''t crash on startup.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67af9bc24a40028778140694f15208ee63906d24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/67af9bc24a40028778140694f15208ee63906d24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/commits/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760","node_id":"C_kwDOUvGNwtoAKDgwNjE5NWExZTJiOGFhY2VjZWYyNDQ5NWMxM2NkYTcyNTVlNTE3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commit/deeba42c2fe195672600842c227d130978e45101","sha":"deeba42c2fe195672600842c227d130978e45101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/deeba42c2fe195672600842c227d130978e45101"}],"sha":"806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/806195a1e2b8aacecef24495c13cda7255e51760"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259992179?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujithareddym","id":259992179,"login":"sujithareddym","node_id":"U_kgDOD38qcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujithareddym","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/commits/deeba42c2fe195672600842c227d130978e45101/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:37Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:47:37Z","email":"sujithareddymamidala@gmail.com","name":"Abhilash Sandi"},"message":"Step 7: RabbitMQ bind producer + SSE progress\n\n- src/queue/rabbitmq.ts: lazy-connected amqplib producer onto\n  carrier.bind.requested (durable queue) — this service only\n  produces; the consumer lives in quoteflow-apps'' automation-worker.\n- bind.service.ts: POST .../bind gates on funnel_stage === ''rc2'',\n  creates a carrier_jobs row, publishes the job, advances the quote to\n  ''bind''; marks the job failed (502) if the publish itself fails\n  rather than leaving a pending job with no message ever sent.\n- GET .../bind-status polls the latest job; GET .../bind-events is an\n  SSE stream backed by an in-process EventEmitter (bind-events.ts).\n- PATCH /internal/carrier-jobs/:jobId is the automation-worker''s\n  progress callback — mounted on the no-CORS internalRouter from step\n  1''s middleware-order trap, marks the quote ''bound'' on ''succeeded'',\n  and pushes the update to any open bind-events SSE connection.\n- Verified live end-to-end: created a quote, drove it through\n  rc1/rc2/bind, confirmed the message actually landed in RabbitMQ\n  (rabbitmqctl list_queues), opened a real SSE connection, sent two\n  internal callbacks with no Origin header, and watched both progress\n  events arrive over SSE in real time; confirmed quotes.status flips\n  to ''bound''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab2b7e619f0673cd04ef0cbf0ed6a7bb8af6b22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abhilashsandi/quoteflow-rating-service/git/trees/ab2b7e619f0673cd04ef0cbf0ed6a7bb8af6b22f"},"