eply.github.com","name":"Martin Marzejon"},"message":"Add READMEs, contributor docs, CI, and repository hygiene\n\n- README.md for the repo and each package, AGENTS.md for coding agents,\n  CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, and CHANGELOG.md.\n- CI tests Node.js 22, 24, and 26, the release lines engines supports,\n  and validates the OpenSpec change. Actions are pinned by commit SHA,\n  the token is read-only, and checkout keeps no credentials.\n- Dependabot for npm and actions waits seven days after a release.\n- CODEOWNERS, a pull request template, and issue forms.\n- .npmrc turns off dependency install scripts, which none need.\n- .editorconfig, .gitattributes, .nvmrc, and repository metadata in\n  each package manifest. The VS Code package script pins vsce 4.0.0.\n- The producer guide test accepts npm 11.19''s dry-run JSON, which keys\n  output by package name; Node.js 26 ships that npm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76c52fcf49172dd2f7e9d386c0d40581526b504f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/git/trees/76c52fcf49172dd2f7e9d386c0d40581526b504f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/git/commits/723b71969982376a42d428cb069fd9d3de4eeaa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173234?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/roughcompass","id":173234,"login":"roughcompass","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIzNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/commit/723b71969982376a42d428cb069fd9d3de4eeaa4","node_id":"C_kwDOUvTG9NoAKDcyM2I3MTk2OTk4MjM3NmE0MmQ0MjhjYjA2OWZkOWQzZGU0ZWVhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/commit/d167732a9b089260833be7fe4cce3e0d90dc380f","sha":"d167732a9b089260833be7fe4cce3e0d90dc380f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/commits/d167732a9b089260833be7fe4cce3e0d90dc380f"}],"sha":"723b71969982376a42d428cb069fd9d3de4eeaa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/de-web-sdk/commits/723b71969982376a42d428cb069fd9d3de4eeaa4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173234?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/roughcompass","id":173234,"login":"roughcompass","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzIzNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roug