hase is amber/skipped unless graphStatus=written;\n  faults read from result.faults; stalled runs (>5 min, no beat) flagged.\n\nVerified: all 7 members match data/expected-alerts.json, alerts unchanged\nfrom engine output, rationale on every alert; SYN-999 fails cleanly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2c6611f36ad2ec5c0027344f8930057e7b99847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/C7-Intelligence/hackday-clinical-alerts/git/trees/b2c6611f36ad2ec5c0027344f8930057e7b99847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/C7-Intelligence/hackday-clinical-alerts/git/commits/800babbfa1fd5735897f399435bd82e1c5527454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34180339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jredwine2857","id":34180339,"login":"jredwine2857","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTgwMzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jredwine2857","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/C7-Intelligence/hackday-clinical-alerts/commit/800babbfa1fd5735897f399435bd82e1c5527454","node_id":"C_kwDOUvWHXtoAKDgwMGJhYmJmYTFmZDU3MzU4OTdmMzk5NDM1YmQ4MmUxYzU1Mjc0NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/C7-Inte