er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThanhHuynh05","id":243828724,"login":"ThanhHuynh05","node_id":"U_kgDODoiH9A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThanhHuynh05/UI_Skeleton_ThanhHoa/commits/81805e1362858665aa50bbbcd82c51beab9dc437/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:52:21Z","email":"thanh140820522@gmail.com","name":"ThanhHuynh05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:52:21Z","email":"thanh140820522@gmail.com","name":"ThanhHuynh05"},"message":"feat(ux): simplify business language and enforce transparent query scope\n\n- replace technical-first labels with business-friendly language\n- simplify the header and prioritize Ask and Saved Insights\n- move technical tools, help, and preferences into secondary menus\n- clearly label the prototype as Demo with Synthetic data\n- clarify that persona access and masking are simulated behaviours\n- add calendar-based presets and validated custom date ranges\n- detect domain and period conflicts before query execution\n- display turn-level Applied Scope on every answer\n- synchronize answers, tables, charts, and SQL with confirmed scope\n- return truthful empty states for unsupported custom ranges\n- include demo disclosures in pages, print views, and exports\n- document R2-04, R2-25, R2-06, and R2-08 behaviour","tree":{"sha":"3c8a1a6f4dc2b4e9a5deedabad99db5126a1168c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThanhHuynh05/UI_Skeleton_T