.com/u/243828724?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ThanhHuynh05","id":243828724,"login":"ThanhHuynh05","node_id":"U_kgDODoiH9A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThanhHuynh05/UI_Skeleton_ThanhHoa/commits/50afe5cf3a959e118bd40cf93552f2c064e1a6d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:22:45Z","email":"thanh140820522@gmail.com","name":"ThanhHuynh05"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:22:45Z","email":"thanh140820522@gmail.com","name":"ThanhHuynh05"},"message":"feat(ui): transform prototype into enterprise decision-support tool\n\nThis massive UX/UI overhaul resolves critical feedback to reduce technical\nnoise, enhance data trust, and align the interface with business terminology.\nCore Changes:\n- refactor(hierarchy): reorder result card strictly to Business Answer -> Interpretation -> Evidence -> Actions -> Technical Details.\n- feat(interpretation): add a prominent \"I interpreted your question as\" layer to validate intent before showing data.\n- feat(technical-details): consolidate SQL, pipeline traces, and raw schemas into a collapsible accordion hidden by default.\n- feat(sidebar): implement custom modal pop-ups for Rename/Delete conversations and add desktop collapse toggle.\n- feat(clarification): redesign clarification intent into a prominent, blocking card UI similar to GPT/Claude.\nUX & Terminology Improvements:\n- chore(defaults): change default Time Range and Domain Scope to \"Auto\" to prevent silent filtering.\n- feat(workspaces): isolate Evaluation & Observability into an Admin Workspace, hidden from non-admin personas.\n- feat(insights): rename \"Saved Answers\" to \"Saved Queries & Insights\" with \"Last refreshed\" metadata and functional UI buttons.\n- feat(provenance): parse physical table names (e.g., dim_projects) into readable Business Sources.\n- feat(security): improve Access Denied messaging and inject a \"🔒 Restricted\" header for RBAC-masked columns.\n- chore(copywriting): clean up overpromising hero text, apply \"Demo Persona\" label, and remove biased terminology (e.g., Fastest, Optimal, Layer 7) from Admin/Eval pages.\nUI Polish:\n- style(icons): purge all native emojis and standardize the iconography system using crisp SVGs.\n- style(components): upgrade suggestion chips and the \"View SQL Query\" toggle into prominent, interactive buttons with hover/focus states.\n- fix(layout): apply pre-wrap to SQL code blocks to prevent horizontal container overflow.","tree":{"sha":"ef5e5ee87994c27d6facf901b07d79d67f55f271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThanhHuynh05/UI_Skeleton_ThanhHoa/git/trees/ef5e5ee87994c27d6facf901b07d79d67f55f271"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThanhHuynh05/UI_Skeleton_ThanhHoa/git/commits/50afe5cf3a959e118bd40cf93552f2c064e1a6d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243828724?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ThanhHuynh05/following{/other_user}","gists_url