github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/9c1ec509bab2bfda24006fcc144fb6acfa416c2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:36:06Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:36:06Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"fix(viewer): compile and start the deep-zoom worker\n\nThe worker URL was built outside a constructor Rspack recognises, so the\n.ts file was copied uncompiled and deep zoom never ran. RemoteWorker is\nnow registered as worker syntax, as in compare.\n\nThe blob also passes the chunk''s real URL: Rspack''s auto public path reads\nself.location, which in a blob worker is the shell''s origin, so pdf.js was\nrequested from the wrong server. pdf.js runs in this thread rather than\nstarting its own worker, and gets a URL object, an OffscreenCanvas factory\nand the worker''s FontFaceSet in place of the page globals it assumes.\nMessages without a request id are ignored, since pdf.js''s worker build\nannounces itself on any worker it is loaded into.","tree":{"sha":"635a6c17d38f25aab097f6fc7dafbf517f39fb07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/635a6c17d38f25aab097f6fc7dafbf517f39fb07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/9c1ec509bab2bfda24006fcc144fb6acfa416c2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi