anujgawde"},"message":"feat(compare): build the side-by-side chrome from the mockup\n\nThe first pass took the mockup''s text and missed its layout. Compare now\nowns everything below the shell''s top bar: the FROM/TO revision bar, a\nheader strip per pane with its zoom, a divider that shows the lock state,\nthe lock pill (L toggles, holding Shift unlocks), a bottom zoom bar, and\nthe sheet drawn as paper. Pickers, dates and grid references wait for data\nthe set does not carry yet.","tree":{"sha":"0b5844d1851127812c1e1c93efa3b1f697f0de13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/0b5844d1851127812c1e1c93efa3b1f697f0de13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/296ded5fa3721d226c621848782fc6316fdfd629","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/296ded5fa3721d226c621848782fc6316fdfd629","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDI5NmRlZDVmYTM3MjFkMjI2YzYyMTg0ODc4MmZjNjMxNmZkZ