https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/d869a6e6fe00d8f45f42a9d720c29efe073a401d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:16:41Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:16:41Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"test: measure what thumbnails cost the navigator grid\n\nTimes a screenful from the grid painted, scrolls four screens at a\nreading pace and counts the thumbnails that arrive during it, then times\na return to cards already seen. PERF_THUMBS=0 runs the same walk without\nthem. A fast scroll withdraws most requests before anything decodes, so\nonly a slow one can say whether decoding costs frames.\n\nThe grid spec now runs with ?thumbs=0 so its readings stay grid-only.\nScroll tracing moves to a shared helper so both specs measure frames\nthe same way.","tree":{"sha":"893c634304203af9e65597b73f124626fd6e844b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/893c634304203af9e65597b73f124626fd6e844b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/d869a6e6fe00d8f45f42a9d720c29efe073a401d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/d869a6e6fe00d8f45f42a9d720c29efe073a401d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKGQ4NjlhNmU2ZmUwMGQ4ZjQ1ZjQyYTlkNzIwYzI5ZWZlMDczYTQwMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b","sha":"69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b"}],"sha":"d869a6e6fe00d8f45f42a9d720c29efe073a401d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/d869a6e6fe00d8f45f42a9d720c29efe073a401d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:16:25Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T23:16:25Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(navigator): show each sheet''s level-0 tile on its card\n\nA card requests its thumbnail when it comes on screen and withdraws the\nrequest if it leaves first. Four are fetched at a time, leaving\nconnections to the data origin for the viewer''s tiles. The newest batch\nof requests goes first, so a fling does not queue the cards someone\nstopped on; within a batch they go in the order asked, so a screen fills\ntop to bottom.\n\nThe tile is a 512 px square with the sheet in its top 366 px. The image\nis kept out of flow and cropped to the sheet: in flow, its square shape\nstretched the card past the height the virtual grid had measured, and\neach card''s text slid under the next row.\n\nNo cache of its own: tiles are served immutable, so the HTTP cache\nalready holds them. ?thumbs=0 turns thumbnails off.","tree":{"sha":"bd4b44920919a8bdcb5cf124610027390275686c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/bd4b44920919a8bdcb5cf124610027390275686c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDY5ZjU3N2JkOWZiOWVjYWMwNTMzNjBlN2MxODBlMWNlMDQ1MzFkMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60","sha":"f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60"}],"sha":"69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/69f577bd9fb9ecac053360e7c180e1ce04531d1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:18:57Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:18:57Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"test: re-derive the sheet change gate on the shared link\n\nA sheet''s tiles download together and now split the rate, which moves\nsheet change from 1309 ms to 1806-1815 ms over five runs, with or\nwithout prefetch. Set at the median plus 25%, the same rule as before.","tree":{"sha":"9254b56e3d1e272097cf9cd15174bb3ef53c87d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/9254b56e3d1e272097cf9cd15174bb3ef53c87d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKGY0OTM0OGI4NTI5Y2RlMTE4MWNlNTM5NDhmZmVmMDYwYmVmNmJiNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5","sha":"3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5"}],"sha":"f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/f49348b8529cde1181ce53948ffef060bef6bb60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:18:50Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T22:18:50Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"fix: share one throttled link across a server''s responses\n\nEach response was paced on its own, so concurrent requests each got the\nfull rate: six 22 KB tiles at once took 0.74 s, the same as one. A\nshared 1.6 Mbit/s link needs about 1.3 s. The error grew with\nparallelism, so it flattered the pages that fetch the most.\n\nEvery chunk now books the next free slot on one link per server, and\nsix tiles at once take 1.32 s against 1.28 s by arithmetic. A single\ndownload is unchanged. Round trips are not booked, since latency delays\na request without using capacity.\n\nThe viewer''s recorded figures predate this and say so.","tree":{"sha":"af0441d4144aaeb3b0f00f896ef8363ca963583c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/af0441d4144aaeb3b0f00f896ef8363ca963583c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/3bd99ab0f849890da14a0c8b59d7dc4b59a68cd5","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDNiZDk5YWIwZjg0OTg5MGRhMTRhMGM4YjU5ZDdkYzRiNTlhNjhjZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/7a4382a1e5dfcc57103486eda68ffa9750dab8bd","sha":"7a4382a1e5dfcc571034