135064/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:48:15Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:48:15Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(viewer): add the tile cache panel behind ?perf=1\n\nThe renderer hands out a getter and the panel pulls on a 250 ms interval,\nso displaying the numbers cannot change them.\n\ndata-scale stays on the per-frame path deliberately: the input-latency\nharness observes that attribute to time a zoom settling, and throttling\nit would have turned two interaction budgets into measurements of the\nthrottle, with both gates still green.","tree":{"sha":"9b02c7fc6ef6c4d458d90a6609967665a5d83aeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/9b02c7fc6ef6c4d458d90a6609967665a5d83aeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/01106b2f246abcc5b2091a0a30cf960043135064","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/01106b2f246abcc5b2091a0a30cf960043135064","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDAxMTA2YjJmMjQ2YWJjYzViMjA5MWEwYTMwY2Y5NjAwNDMxMzUwNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b","sha":"7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b"}],"sha":"01106b2f246abcc5b2091a0a30cf960043135064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/01106b2f246abcc5b2091a0a30cf960043135064"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:47:59Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:47:59Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"refactor(viewer): count tile hits per need, not per lookup\n\nTileCache.get() is reached once per animation frame per visible tile, so\nincrementing hits and misses there measured frame rate: one tile absent\nfor 500 ms of network recorded about thirty misses, and a tile on screen\naccrued hits at the refresh rate. The ratio described how long something\nwas looked at rather than how often it was there.\n\nAccounting moves to TileLoader, the only place that can tell a tile newly\nentering the needed set from the same tile being redrawn.","tree":{"sha":"0843a117ad87eca7a266b2423443360e878b5a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/0843a117ad87eca7a266b2423443360e878b5a56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/7298a8c4185728ddc273da8fe53ccfc3d8a73c1b","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDcyOThhOGM0MTg1NzI4ZGRjMjczZGE4ZmU1M2NjZmMzZDhhNzNjMWI","parents":[{"html_u