: measure input latency and frame pacing under gesture\n\nSynthetic pointer events are untrusted and the Event Timing API drops\nthem, so the pinch is dispatched over CDP instead. Long tasks are\nfiltered by page clock, because counting a sheet load against a\ngesture would describe the load.","tree":{"sha":"e49be52c4cb7e5e09c2069916c6b9623154df511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/e49be52c4cb7e5e09c2069916c6b9623154df511"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/4d3e2c9b65e28434230f2d70a1b68ec338c154fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/4d3e2c9b65e28434230f2d70a1b68ec338c154fd","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDRkM2UyYzliNjVlMjg0MzQyMzBmMmQ3MGExYjY4ZWMzMzhjMTU0ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea","sha":"1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea"}],"sha":"4d3e2c9b65e28434230f2d70a1b68ec338c154fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/4d3e2c9b65e28434230f2d70a1b68ec338c154fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:46:12Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:46:12Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"docs: record the ui sharing and chrome ownership rules\n\nTwo rules that were decided before the primitives were written and are\neasy to get wrong later.\n\nOnly modules holding state in module scope are federation singletons.\nThe bus is shared because two copies are two unconnected mailboxes;\nprimitives hold no state, so each app bundles its own and sharing them\nwould make every primitive a version agreement four apps land together.\n\nChrome ownership follows the deploy-cadence test rather than visual\nposition. A control drawn over the viewer''s canvas can still belong to\nthe shell, and a screen mockup composes all four apps at once, so it\nhas to be split by owner before anyone builds from it.\n\nAlso corrects the platform description, which still said no primitives\nand no React, and the test claim, which named two packages when four\nnow run tests.","tree":{"sha":"e17dc8fdd4a5c744af7490cc81f11d2114d0f5bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/e17dc8fdd4a5c744af7490cc81f11d2114d0f5bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDFhZDU2ZmRmYjlkOTE5MzgzMjNlYzBhZWUzNmIxNTJhOTgyYjkyZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d","sha":"b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d"}],"sha":"1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/1ad56fdfb9d91938323ec0aee36b152a982b92ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:46:04Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:46:04Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(viewer): render the sheet toolbar and properties panel\n\nThe canvas overlay toolbar and the right-hand panel, both owned by the\nviewer. Adding a tool here must never force the shell to ship, which is\nthe test that puts them in this app rather than in the chrome.\n\nThe toolbar''s zoom controls go through the same view commands a pinch\ndoes, so a button press and a gesture cannot drift apart.\n\nMarkup, measure, area and note render disabled. The tool group is one\ncontrol in the design, and a toolbar that grows a button later moves\nevery button beside it; a disabled control with a tooltip says what is\ntrue. The panel carries only values this app actually holds, which is\nwhy it has no markups or revisions section yet.\n\nThe primitives'' stylesheet is imported inside the exposed module. The\nshell loads SheetSurface over federation and never touches this app''s\nentry point, so a stylesheet imported there would be missing exactly\nwhen the viewer runs where it matters.","tree":{"sha":"4470f850f5749845312b44ab6ed10cadb3422a7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/4470f850f5749845312b44ab6ed10cadb3422a7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKGIyZmYxNWQwMTkxZWQwNTJhNDZmOTZiODNjYTY5ZmRiOWM4YWEwNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab","sha":"0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab"}],"sha":"b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/b2ff15d0191ed052a46f96b83ca69fdb9c8aa05d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:45:53Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:45:53Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(viewer): add a hand-rolled gesture layer over pointer events\n\nPinch, two-finger pan, momentum and wheel zoom, split into pure maths, a\nframework-agnostic controller, and a thin React binding. Both renderers\nuse it: if the two handled input differently, the measured difference\nbetween them would include the difference between two input\nimplementations, and the claim is about rendering.\n\nMomentum is integrated rather than multiplied per frame. Decaying\nvelocity by a constant each frame makes the distance a flick travels\ndepend on the frame rate, so the same gesture goes further on a fast\ndisplay and a number taken under throttling becomes a property of the\nthrottle.\n\nsetPointerCapture is attempted after the pointer is recorded, not\nbefore, and is allowed to fail. It throws when the pointer is no longer\nactive, and capturing first meant that throw aborted the handler before\nany state was set — the gesture never started and the sheet ignored the\nfinger. Capture improves a gesture rather than being a precondition\nfor one.\n\nZoom translates by the achieved ratio rather than the requested factor.\nAt a limit the requested factor no longer describes what happened, so\nholding a pinch at full zoom slid the drawing.","tree":{"sha":"f4acb0f2b00e7e8fb7877797fbdff66fea5570db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/f4acb0f2b00e7e8fb7877797fbdff66fea5570db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDA3NDRkODJiYWVjNjg4ZTYwNmMzYTM2ZGFlYWI5OTZkMjJhMGIxYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f","sha":"54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f"}],"sha":"0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/0744d82baec688e606c3a36daeab996d22a0b1ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:45:37Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T04:45:37Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(platform): add the ui primitives the viewer calls\n\nTen components, taken from the design system''s own component sources\nrather than read off the mockups. Two departures from that reference\nimplementation, both deliberate.\n\nInteraction state is CSS rather than React state. The reference keeps\nhover and press in useState, which re-renders React every time a pointer\ncrosses a toolbar — on the same main thread the frame budget is measured\non.\n\nIcons are inline SVG rather than a CDN mask-image. The reference points\nat unpkg.com, an origin this project does not control, and a set that\ngets read on a tablet in a basement cannot have its controls go blank\nwhen the network does.\n\nScoped to what the viewer uses; the navigator''s search and select come\nwith the navigator. This is the package''s first React dependency, and\nthe version comes from the catalog like every other copy.","tree":{"sha":"554209608c1c2d8fca255860fe4e62a48499e9f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/554209608c1c2d8fca255860fe4e62a48499e9f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDU0YTgxNWU0OTM1MjcwMzJjNTk3YzU3YzU4N2FkZTQwOGMzOThhM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132","sha":"9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132"}],"sha":"54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/54a815e493527032c597c57c587ade408c398a3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:03:29Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:03:29Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"docs: surface the measured rendering results in the readme\n\nThe measured numbers lived only in docs/perf/phase1.md, so a reader\narriving at the repo found the federation and setgen proofs but nothing\nabout rendering, beside a status section still saying it was next.\n\nThe perf doc also called the tiled renderer unbuilt while reporting its\nmeasurements, and two paragraphs were written for a future where its\ncolumn was still empty.","tree":{"sha":"f9403d6257e11fddde2f41f5b3d6d54666e7e969","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/f9403d6257e11fddde2f41f5b3d6d54666e7e969"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDk0NTkwMTRlZDRkYzAxMWI0MjU3OTY4NzVjMWVkYjhiZWM2YzAxMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32","sha":"aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32"}],"sha":"9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/9459014ed4dc011b425796875c1edb8bec6c0132"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:43Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:43Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"docs: record the tiled renderer against the baseline\n\nFirst sheet 225 s to 8.45 s, main-thread block 1120 ms to 133 ms, peak memory over fifty sheets 2230 MB to 210 MB. Sheet change goes the other way, 210 ms to 1321 ms, because the naive renderer already paid for every sheet up front — past roughly 170 sheets in one sitting it would spend less time waiting. Returning to a visited sheet costs 47 ms. The memory plateau is argued rather than shown: the curve is still rising at sheet 50 and eviction does not start until about sheet 64.","tree":{"sha":"6d9c46ed12e1d0f92fb0b134fd3ce24907a6118e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/6d9c46ed12e1d0f92fb0b134fd3ce24907a6118e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKGFlZTlmY2MzNGZhZmM5OWI4ZWZhYjFmNzhlODJjM2U5ZTI5NDBiMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059","sha":"2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059"}],"sha":"aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/aee9fcc34fafc99b8efab1f78e82c3e9e2940b32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:35Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:35Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"test: measure either renderer, and measure revisits\n\nPERF_RENDERER selects which one runs, so both are measured by the identical script against the identical document. The session now returns to sheets it has already visited, because a real session is not a one-way walk and what a return costs is the whole argument for caching. An assertion on sheetRaster failed the tiled renderer for having no PDF to rasterize; it now asserts a measure both emit.","tree":{"sha":"f4de87cb130a521c7fe3719845d75c5e8227e99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/f4de87cb130a521c7fe3719845d75c5e8227e99c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDI4NjBiZDA1YjIxNzY5Y2MxNjI4ODdkYmIyMWQxNGM1ZGM1NDEwNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7","sha":"bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7"}],"sha":"2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/2860bd05b21769cc162887dbb21d14c5dc541059"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:28Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:28Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(viewer): add deep zoom scaffolding, currently inactive\n\nPast the deepest pre-rendered level a tile can only be stretched, so the region is rendered on demand from the sheet''s own 28 KB PDF in a worker. It does not run: a worker script must be same-origin with the document, and this remote is served from its own origin while running in the shell''s page, so construction is refused and no CORS header helps. The blob-bootstrap workaround is here, but the bundler only emits a worker chunk when it can see the literal new Worker(new URL(...)), so the chunk is never built. Needs the worker as its own build entry. Degrades to stretched tiles, which is what the naive renderer does past its own resolution.","tree":{"sha":"11dc4b5a9a2a798a3d93f4affb0ca4d3e7b23355","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/11dc4b5a9a2a798a3d93f4affb0ca4d3e7b23355"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKGJkZTA4ODUyM2E2YzFlZGM2ZGQ0YzFlOTkzMjY5ZjJlM2I1ZTEyYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee","sha":"15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee"}],"sha":"bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/bde088523a6c1edc6dd4c1e993269f2e3b5e12a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:01Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:12:01Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"test(viewer): cover tile selection and cache eviction\n\nThree of the renderer''s bugs were in pure functions and were found by screenshot rather than by test. Covers level selection staying monotonic and bounded by the screen, visible tiles staying inside the grid, adjacent tile rects leaving no seam, and the cache honouring its budget, evicting least-recently-used, releasing bitmaps, and never evicting the pinned coarse levels.","tree":{"sha":"95faf1e084564af27ba2784ed75a9d017c3d87bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/95faf1e084564af27ba2784ed75a9d017c3d87bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDE1MTczYTVhZjc5ZWUyMWJmMTgwMGU2NTMzOTNjYjg1MjI3ZTMyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74","sha":"6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74"}],"sha":"15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/15173a5af79ee21bf1800e653393cb85227e32ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:53Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:53Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(viewer): render sheets from a tile pyramid\n\nFetches the level closest to the current zoom, decodes off the main thread, and holds decoded tiles in a cache with a byte budget. Tiles are not cheaper by themselves — one is 27 KB on the wire and 1 MB decoded — so the saving comes from decoding only what is on screen and evicting the rest, with the coarse levels pinned. Drawing runs coarse to sharp so the canvas is never blank: waiting for the exact level before drawing anything was correct and felt like reloading. At most four fetches are outstanding, the rest held in a droppable queue, because a queue handed to the browser cannot be reordered when someone changes sheet.","tree":{"sha":"cac02485431aa071c7220406be74d0a07466d3c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/cac02485431aa071c7220406be74d0a07466d3c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDZkZTljYzFkOWQ3YTBiNTk3YWNhODg0YzMxYzNhOWZhN2RlMzRkNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26","sha":"811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26"}],"sha":"6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/6de9cc1d9d7a0b597aca884c31c3a9fa7de34d74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:38Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:38Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"build: serve set content immutable, deployment data no-store\n\nTwo kinds of file want opposite answers. A tile for a given sheet, level and position never changes, so a CDN serves it immutable; no-store on tiles meant re-downloading every one on every revisit. The entry, manifest and lookups keep no-store, because a cached remoteEntry.js serves the previous deployment and reads exactly like the new one failing to ship.","tree":{"sha":"b43b7c6b53a676758c9ba24484e2e8ec4701ebb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/b43b7c6b53a676758c9ba24484e2e8ec4701ebb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26","node_id":"C_kwDOUvi7UtoAKDgxMWIwY2QyYjAwYjUyYTRiMTY2MTY0M2Y2MTc4NDgzOGNiYzRmMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde/gridline/commit/3f9a20ea91d55e53598f09258d3f472caf61e8c5","sha":"3f9a20ea91d55e53598f09258d3f472caf61e8c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/3f9a20ea91d55e53598f09258d3f472caf61e8c5"}],"sha":"811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/811b0cd2b00b52a4b1661643f61784838cbc4f26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anujgawde","id":87605577,"login":"anujgawde","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NjA1NTc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/3f9a20ea91d55e53598f09258d3f472caf61e8c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:10Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T22:11:10Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(tiler): build a tile pyramid from the drawing set\n\nFour levels to 4096px, cut into 512px WebP tiles: 97,500 tiles, 1.26 GB, 4m38s across six worker processes. Quality 80 chosen by pixel comparison against 90 rather than by default — text tiles are identical at every setting, hatched tiles are not. pdf.js silently drops all text unless standardFontDataUrl is given a filesystem path. Per-sheet indexes rather than one manifest, because a manifest for 1,500 sheets is 1.1 MB that would have to arrive before the first tile.","tree":{"sha":"81b6624a495388bb7257eaebeb08444af1982c49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/81b6624a495388bb7257eaebeb08444af1982c49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/3f9a20ea91d55e53598f09258d3f472caf61e8c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_u