ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/commits/d425c92daf80d83ccf47ad481d305710e57bf470/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:00:48Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:00:48Z","email":"gawdeanuj@gmail.com","name":"anujgawde"},"message":"feat(setgen): emit the set as one combined document\n\nA drawing set is issued as a single PDF — jurisdictions cap submittals at 500 MB and only permit splitting by discipline above 100 MB. Handing the naive renderer 1,500 pre-split sheets would give it a decomposition it did not earn, so the comparison against tiles would measure a head start rather than a technique. The individual sheets stay on disk as the tiler''s input.","tree":{"sha":"d5631d9f9b246c1951843bc83cd067b8089c7976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/trees/d5631d9f9b246c1951843bc83cd067b8089c7976"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anujgawde/gridline/git/commits/d425c92daf80d83ccf47ad481d305710e57bf470","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87605577?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anujgawde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm