wn\nfeature and the Vue app has a vercel.json; the limitations that no longer hold\nare gone and the remaining ones are stated. Tests, coverage, bundle and spec\ncounts are re-measured (303 tests, 99.3% of line coverage, 279.1 kB and 82.6 kB\ninitial JS, 41 React specs and 15 Vue specs); the Lighthouse scores are marked\nas measured the day before the last inbox changes. ADR-0016 records how the\nactionable flag was resolved, the demo script and workflow doc describe the\nwaiting state, and CLAUDE.md gains notes on the flag, pinned columns and the\nheader-row locator trap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"29f4ead4f907e8489a7aa028754e59763975796c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/29f4ead4f907e8489a7aa028754e59763975796c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/ae1ffa89bb37c8e0b8887d0fb0e562460b2e133b","verification":{"payload":"tree 29f4ead4f907e8489a7aa028754e59763975796c\nparent 6e38f824e28fe5e3acd3c588bd51c1d9be21e55e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790841094 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790841094 +0000\n\ndocs: record the known-gap fixes and re-measured numbers\n\nREADME, CLAUDE.md and the plan now say the approvals inbox marks a queued step\nas waiting, the Actions column is pinned, the approval hooks have their own\nfeature and the Vue app has a vercel.json; the limitations that no longer hold\nare gone and the remaining ones are stated. Tests, coverage, bundle and spec\ncounts are re-measured (303 tests, 99.3% of line coverage, 279.1 kB and 82.6 kB\ninitial JS, 41 React specs and 15 Vue specs); the Lighthouse scores are marked\nas measured the day before the last inbox changes. ADR-0016 records how the\nactionable flag was resolved, the demo script and workflow doc describe the\nwaiting state, and CLAUDE.md gains notes on the flag, pinned columns and the\nheader-row locator trap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOLEq3gJ\nrTyNDDwbIOFIK/hpUrGcmN8wC/dTkOEwWIT37ITKEm2j7BCZRJ2HzMCf7yc4YVd7azNfs1mn2mS3\negw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T07:51:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/ae1ffa89bb37c8e0b8887d0fb0e562460b2e133b","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGFlMWZmYTg5YmIzN2M4ZTBiODg4N2QwZmIwZTU2MjQ2MGIyZTEzM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/6e38f824e28fe5e3acd3c588bd51c1d9be21e55e","sha":"6e38f824e28fe5e3acd3c588bd51c1d9be21e55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/6e38f824e28fe5e3acd3c588bd51c1d9be21e55e"}],"sha":"ae1ffa89bb37c8e0b8887d0fb0e562460b2e133b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mek