committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:49:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(erp-vue): keep the inbox readable beside the detail panel\n\nWith the detail panel open the list has about two thirds of the width, and\nthe subject column was squeezed to a sliver (a supplier name wrapped over\nseven lines) while the action buttons ran off the edge. The subject now has a\nminimum width, the table scrolls sideways inside its region, and the Actions\ncolumn is pinned to the right edge so a decision is always in reach.\n\nThe panel spec asserts both and was confirmed to fail on the previous build\n(subject 109px wide).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"61abe4ebc44e9e8a211c14888d3621b6c79f3056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/61abe4ebc44e9e8a211c14888d3621b6c79f3056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/d2f467357be7187cdabba5fdc0b5e6238daea221","verification":{"payload":"tree 61abe4ebc44e9e8a211c14888d3621b6c79f3056\nparent 8812da791e1d1fb9811b5af22423339290873cb5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790786993 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790786993 +0000\n\nfix(erp-vue): keep the inbox readable beside the detail panel\n\nWith the detail panel open the list has about two thirds of the width, and\nthe subject column was squeezed to a sliver (a supplier name wrapped over\nseven lines) while the action buttons ran off the edge. The subject now has a\nminimum width, the table scrolls sideways inside its region, and the Actions\ncolumn is pinned to the right edge so a decision is always in reach.\n\nThe panel spec asserts both and was confirmed to fail on the previous build\n(subject 109px wide).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signat