ic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:10:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: run the Vue inbox''s end-to-end suite and check its bundle budget\n\nThe main job also checks the Vue app''s initial-load budget, and a separate job\nbuilds it and runs its Playwright suite, with the axe scans, against the\nproduction build under the real CSP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"62db2f791204b274bdff461f844518ec523f5114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/62db2f791204b274bdff461f844518ec523f5114"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/aa5129aeeea626f84266fa75995a582b023943e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 62db2f791204b274bdff461f844518ec523f5114\nparent a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784619 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784619 +0000\n\nci: run the Vue inbox''s end-to-end suite and check its bundle budget\n\nThe main job also checks the Vue app''s initial-load budget, and a separate job\nbuilds it and runs its Playwright suite, with the axe scans, against the\nproduction build under the real CSP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAh82q0z\nYIbxmXY9A1Fvkz15I7ly79vzKl9FL4YmLu4QMvAsI89R5++xu+FSvsYXKFZzsauUENdCxeEm+oXo\nMAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","follow