/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:10:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:10:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(adr): record the Vue inbox and how it relates to the React app\n\nADR-0016 says what is shared between the two apps (the contract, the design\ntokens, the CSP) and what is not (components, i18n, formatting), why it is a\nstandalone app on its own origin and not a composed micro frontend, why it\nseeds a light dataset, how it is tested without a component library, and what\nbuilding it showed: two clients found what one hid, an aborted request is a\nconsole error, and the inbox lists steps that are not yet up, which needs an\nAPI change to fix and is proposed rather than made.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"bbff019c3c3070f10fe0a4f1847fd91206efba59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/bbff019c3c3070f10fe0a4f1847fd91206efba59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248","verification":{"payload":"tree bbff019c3c3070f10fe0a4f1847fd91206efba59\nparent e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784618 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784618 +0000\n\ndocs(adr): record the Vue inbox and how it relates to the React app\n\nADR-0016 says what is shared between the two apps (the contract, the design\ntokens, the CSP) and what is not (components, i18n, formatting), why it is a\nstandalone app on its own origin and not a composed micro frontend, why it\nseeds a light dataset, how it is tested without a component library, and what\nbuilding it showed: two clients found what one hid, an aborted request is a\nconsole error, and the inbox lists steps that are not yet up, which needs an\nAPI change to fix and is proposed rather than made.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEdocqrf\nYNIGSneAH2QYhk+eRip6LUXm5OvEXu9jhyedU1Ks7SR/JxdvyiFzwsd7MFiv58h5jxJfWjNJYicd\nSA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGE0ZjE4OTY4Y2RmMzdjNGJhZDA4YmY2YTE2Njk0MThhYTQ0ZmMyNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910","sha":"e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910"}],"sha":"a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a4f18968cdf37c4bad08bf6a1669418aa44fc248"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:10:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:10:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp-vue): add a Vue approvals inbox on the shared contract\n\nA second client for the same API: a Vue 3 app for the approvals inbox, on\nVue Router and TanStack Vue Query, using the contract''s schemas, typed client,\nmock handlers, permission model and approval-engine helpers, and the shared\ndesign tokens. It has its own origin, service worker and IndexedDB, and seeds\nthe light profile, so a fresh profile reaches the login screen in about half a\nsecond with 82.5 kB gzip of initial JavaScript.\n\nApprovers sign in and see the steps waiting on their role, purchase orders and\nleave requests together. Status, type, search, sort, page and the open document\nall live in the URL. A row opens a panel with the document and its approval\nhistory, rounds kept together. Decisions are made per row or in a batch that\nreports how many went through; changing or rejecting needs a comment, asked for\nin a native dialog; a refused self-decision is explained. Vietnamese by default,\nEnglish on a switch, from a small typed dictionary rather than a library.\n\nLogic that matters lives in plain modules, since no component-testing library\nwas approved: 47 unit tests for the URL state, who may decide what, message\ninterpolation and plurals, language parity, and history ordering. Ten Playwright\nflow specs and five axe scans run against the production build under the real\nCSP, and were repeated 14 times in a row without a failure.\n\nAdds eslint-plugin-vue, vue-eslint-parser and a shared Vue ESLint config\n(Prettier last, so layout is Prettier''s alone), and vue-tsc for the .vue files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"104c727268dea13cdd0e2bac2eb28e9bdb0914e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/104c727268dea13cdd0e2bac2eb28e9bdb0914e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910","verification":{"payload":"tree 104c727268dea13cdd0e2bac2eb28e9bdb0914e8\nparent a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784614 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790784614 +0000\n\nfeat(erp-vue): add a Vue approvals inbox on the shared contract\n\nA second client for the same API: a Vue 3 app for the approvals inbox, on\nVue Router and TanStack Vue Query, using the contract''s schemas, typed client,\nmock handlers, permission model and approval-engine helpers, and the shared\ndesign tokens. It has its own origin, service worker and IndexedDB, and seeds\nthe light profile, so a fresh profile reaches the login screen in about half a\nsecond with 82.5 kB gzip of initial JavaScript.\n\nApprovers sign in and see the steps waiting on their role, purchase orders and\nleave requests together. Status, type, search, sort, page and the open document\nall live in the URL. A row opens a panel with the document and its approval\nhistory, rounds kept together. Decisions are made per row or in a batch that\nreports how many went through; changing or rejecting needs a comment, asked for\nin a native dialog; a refused self-decision is explained. Vietnamese by default,\nEnglish on a switch, from a small typed dictionary rather than a library.\n\nLogic that matters lives in plain modules, since no component-testing library\nwas approved: 47 unit tests for the URL state, who may decide what, message\ninterpolation and plurals, language parity, and history ordering. Ten Playwright\nflow specs and five axe scans run against the production build under the real\nCSP, and were repeated 14 times in a row without a failure.\n\nAdds eslint-plugin-vue, vue-eslint-parser and a shared Vue ESLint config\n(Prettier last, so layout is Prettier''s alone), and vue-tsc for the .vue files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCCHy6mF\nfvFnWkpCm+hL+X8Fn2HCtNB9ScFsbQlnp3ZyCoBx6pXJDp5t02AEljJiTWT4PlagPzvsG9TyVWCU\nyA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGU0MGExNmNiMmY3M2M4MTAxM2IzNTJjYmJiZjJiYzA1MGMyM2Y5MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e","sha":"a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e"}],"sha":"e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e40a16cb2f73c81013b352cbbbf2bc050c23f910"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:29:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor(contract): share the approval history ordering between clients\n\nOrdering a document''s approval steps by submission and then by chain position, and\nnumbering the rounds, is not React-specific and a second client is about to need\nit. approvalHistory does it in the contract and the timeline helper in apps/erp\nnow uses it, so every client shows a resubmitted document the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"ac8983aa32f248f0cd2411919acd0f202d58606e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/ac8983aa32f248f0cd2411919acd0f202d58606e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e","verification":{"payload":"tree ac8983aa32f248f0cd2411919acd0f202d58606e\nparent 70f53ce3e320b48be11483f47650b5ca9b0ead59\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790782193 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790782193 +0000\n\nrefactor(contract): share the approval history ordering between clients\n\nOrdering a document''s approval steps by submission and then by chain position, and\nnumbering the rounds, is not React-specific and a second client is about to need\nit. approvalHistory does it in the contract and the timeline helper in apps/erp\nnow uses it, so every client shows a resubmitted document the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJE++dqp\nSM5VcedPS3hmZSA2uf9rHhx9kIR1Z+A3+W29hyf0PtxrgkgRbzKjkldt9JCUjIS1FXTIVcYaiw1h\nYwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/a4ba0b3633775c6878c2704c599062367568511e","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGE0YmEwYjM2MzM3NzVjNjg3OGMyNzA0YzU5OTA2MjM2NzU2ODUxMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/70f53c