rs call ensureSeeded bare before every\nread and must keep seeding the profile the app started with, and resetSeed\nfollows it. The default is unchanged, so the React app is not affected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"98644daa6348590caa0de0c4e1948044e341b82d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/98644daa6348590caa0de0c4e1948044e341b82d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/70f53ce3e320b48be11483f47650b5ca9b0ead59","verification":{"payload":"tree 98644daa6348590caa0de0c4e1948044e341b82d\nparent a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790782191 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790782191 +0000\n\nfeat(contract): add a light seed profile\n\nensureSeeded takes an optional profile. \"light\" seeds what an approvals inbox\nreads (200 products, 30 suppliers, 240 purchase orders, the 40 employees and\n225 leave requests, and the steps and audit entries between them: about two\nthousand records) instead of the full 110,000-record demo dataset. The choice is\nremembered, because the request handlers call ensureSeeded bare before every\nread and must keep seeding the profile the app started with, and resetSeed\nfollows it. The default is unchanged, so the React app is not affected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNlccbkq\ntTdfWFF0VVawnYipUSdBVwjI8OT4rO5+2/DSt4Y6vKSl8HJnyQA1wCD6Io7bR5GuZfeo6Zk8+w1/\nZAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser