vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:25:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:25:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(erp): show which module tab is current\n\nThe tab bars of Inventory, Purchasing, Sales, Accounting and HR gave the current\ntab both a transparent and an accent bottom border, and the transparent one won,\nso no tab looked selected in any module. Only the inactive tabs are transparent\nnow. A layout spec compares the computed underline of a current and a\nnon-current tab, and the wide-grid check covers the leave list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"a890be560095a6f12056987ba6b1c61bc842d61a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/a890be560095a6f12056987ba6b1c61bc842d61a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280","verification":{"payload":"tree a890be560095a6f12056987ba6b1c61bc842d61a\nparent 1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790781935 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790781935 +0000\n\nfix(erp): show which module tab is current\n\nThe tab bars of Inventory, Purchasing, Sales, Accounting and HR gave the current\ntab both a transparent and an accent bottom border, and the transparent one won,\nso no tab looked selected in any module. Only the inactive tabs are transparent\nnow. A layout spec compares the computed underline of a current and a\nnon-current tab, and the wide-grid check covers the leave list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK5rIvv4\n8zjmjXUUukX0q7IM+2i/tF6R00BWRiMmjufZJToIU3PCoZkx0zFCl1C/b0ORXCN1zvKN70uoJCVK\nEQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:25:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGExMDgzY2FhMTgwNmExYTQzMDFkY2QzNjkyYzUxY2I2YjVlZTYyODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850","sha":"1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850"}],"sha":"a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a1083caa1806a1a4301dcd3692c51cb6b5ee6280"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:23:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:23:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(hrm): add the leave screens\n\nAn HR module for the leave requests that already run on the approval engine.\nThe list shows the signed-in employee''s balance (allowance, taken, awaiting\napproval, remaining) above their requests, with a switch to everyone''s for\napprovers; status, type, search and paging live in the URL. The request form\npreviews working days and what the balance will be before anything is sent,\nwords its own validation in the current language, and maps the server''s\nrefusals (overlap, not enough leave) to sentences. A request''s page shows its\ndetails and approval history, and offers cancelling, editing and resubmitting a\nrequest that was sent back, or a shortcut to the inbox for an approver who is\nnot the requester.\n\nDates written yyyy-mm-dd are formatted without a time zone: new Date of such a\nstring is midnight UTC and reads as the day before for a viewer in the\nAmericas. Realtime decisions on leave refresh the requests and balances, the\naudit log filter lists every entity type it records, and the reason box in the\ninbox dialog now has an accessible name.\n\nTests: a locale parity check (every key in both languages), formatting of\ndate-only strings under three time zones, a browser spec for the full request,\napproval, balance, cancel, send-back and resubmit flows and for the rules the\nform enforces, and axe scans of the list, the form with its preview, the\napprover''s view and a request''s page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"c8841d6a43ca412fc735eb2bc7634dee297ea0cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/c8841d6a43ca412fc735eb2bc7634dee297ea0cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850","verification":{"payload":"tree c8841d6a43ca412fc735eb2bc7634dee297ea0cf\nparent d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790781808 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790781808 +0000\n\nfeat(hrm): add the leave screens\n\nAn HR module for the leave requests that already run on the approval engine.\nThe list shows the signed-in employee''s balance (allowance, taken, awaiting\napproval, remaining) above their requests, with a switch to everyone''s for\napprovers; status, type, search and paging live in the URL. The request form\npreviews working days and what the balance will be before anything is sent,\nwords its own validation in the current language, and maps the server''s\nrefusals (overlap, not enough leave) to sentences. A request''s page shows its\ndetails and approval history, and offers cancelling, editing and resubmitting a\nrequest that was sent back, or a shortcut to the inbox for an approver who is\nnot the requester.\n\nDates written yyyy-mm-dd are formatted without a time zone: new Date of such a\nstring is midnight UTC and reads as the day before for a viewer in the\nAmericas. Realtime decisions on leave refresh the requests and balances, the\naudit log filter lists every entity type it records, and the reason box in the\ninbox dialog now has an accessible name.\n\nTests: a locale parity check (every key in both languages), formatting of\ndate-only strings under three time zones, a browser spec for the full request,\napproval, balance, cancel, send-back and resubmit flows and for the rules the\nform enforces, and axe scans of the list, the form with its preview, the\napprover''s view and a request''s page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDH+K0Fp\nn8gMjk/FWGImdsfp1IAKfOlJHnfSVI78lpQEOBPRVtO9miNgPYnLFLohpKWXBM0GNpiCKwxmlpp5\n9gA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:25:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDE2NjlkNzQ5NjdmZDYzNTY1NTcxOWRhY2MyYTcxMzA3NmYyODk4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d","sha":"d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d"}],"sha":"1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/1669d74967fd635655719dacc2a713076f289850"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:07:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:07:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(erp): list an order''s approval history one round at a time\n\nThe purchase order page sorted every approval step by its place in the chain,\nso once an order had been sent back and resubmitted the two rounds interleaved\n(manager, manager, finance, finance) and the steps showed raw role ids. A shared\nhelper now orders steps by submission and then by chain position, names the\nrole, and labels each entry with its round once there is more than one. The\nresubmission e2e spec checks both rounds on the page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"f1349f2f5c2694939d687d436dd00a62fc70b40c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/f1349f2f5c2694939d687d436dd00a62fc70b40c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d","verification":{"payload":"tree f1349f2f5c2694939d687d436dd00a62fc70b40c\nparent 9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790780826 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790780826 +0000\n\nfix(erp): list an order''s approval history one round at a time\n\nThe purchase order page sorted every approval step by its place in the chain,\nso once an order had been sent back and resubmitted the two rounds interleaved\n(manager, manager, finance, finance) and the steps showed raw role ids. A shared\nhelper now orders steps by submission and then by chain position, names the\nrole, and labels each entry with its round once there is more than one. The\nresubmission e2e spec checks both rounds on the page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLkKeXfa\nn1/6CbSowN8ysC3zJ1HOGitq8swLJDUh2b59qGnbsFAexLRkHs/6QFLSm7isDgddVpDAJNeyVoED\nkAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:25:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGQ5OTg5ZmMyMzlhYmZkOTgzMDc4YzM1MzE3MjI4NGVkZmU3MjQxMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb","sha":"9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb"}],"sha":"d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/d9989fc239abfd983078c353172284edfe72412d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:04:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:04:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(hrm): run leave requests on the approval engine\n\nLeave is the second document to use the approval engine from ADR-0004, which\nonly ever approved purchase orders. Rules keep their shape: a rule''s amount\nrange now bounds working days for leave (1-2 days go to the manager, 3 or more\nto the manager and then the director).\n\nContract: pure leave logic (working days minus fixed public holidays, balances\ncomputed from requests, overlap detection), Zod entities and a typed client\nfor employees and leave requests, and ApprovalView reshaped to a subject, an\namount and a unit so one inbox lists both document types.\n\nMock backend: a generic approvals handler shared by both documents, leave\nhandlers that enforce the rules on the server side (field errors, overlap,\nbalance, missing approval rule), and a rule that nobody decides their own\nrequest. Revising a request that was sent back keeps its number and gets a new\nchain.\n\nData: 40 employees (the eight demo logins plus 32) and 225 leave requests with\napproval steps and audit entries, generated by the same functions the handlers\nuse. The IndexedDB version goes from 3 to 4, and a browser holding the older\ndatabase gets the HR data through a targeted upgrade instead of a reseed.\n\nInbox: shows the kind of document under its number, the amount in the right\nunit, a type filter, and the translated reason when a decision is refused. The\nadmin login sees every step, so a request nobody else may decide can still be\ndecided.\n\nTests: 51 new unit tests (leave logic, seed invariants, permissions) and two\ne2e specs, one for the leave API flow and one for the inbox, both dated\nrelative to the day they run. ADR-0015 records the decisions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"c7c4968cca73a46ee5a8dbbfb56534dc374d6b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/c7c4968cca73a46ee5a8dbbfb56534dc374d6b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb","verification":{"payload":"tree c7c4968cca73a46ee5a8dbbfb56534dc374d6b63\nparent 7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790780676 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790780676 +0000\n\nfeat(hrm): run leave requests on the approval engine\n\nLeave is the second document to use the approval engine from ADR-0004, which\nonly ever approved purchase orders. Rules keep their shape: a rule''s amount\nrange now bounds working days for leave (1-2 days go to the manager, 3 or more\nto the manager and then the director).\n\nContract: pure leave logic (working days minus fixed public holidays, balances\ncomputed from requests, overlap detection), Zod entities and a typed client\nfor employees and leave requests, and ApprovalView reshaped to a subject, an\namount and a unit so one inbox lists both document types.\n\nMock backend: a generic approvals handler shared by both documents, leave\nhandlers that enforce the rules on the server side (field errors, overlap,\nbalance, missing approval rule), and a rule that nobody decides their own\nrequest. Revising a request that was sent back keeps its number and gets a new\nchain.\n\nData: 40 employees (the eight demo logins plus 32) and 225 leave requests with\napproval steps and audit entries, generated by the same functions the handlers\nuse. The IndexedDB version goes from 3 to 4, and a browser holding the older\ndatabase gets the HR data through a targeted upgrade instead of a reseed.\n\nInbox: shows the kind of document under its number, the amount in the right\nunit, a type filter, and the translated reason when a decision is refused. The\nadmin login sees every step, so a request nobody else may decide can still be\ndecided.\n\nTests: 51 new unit tests (leave logic, seed invariants, permissions) and two\ne2e specs, one for the leave API flow and one for the inbox, both dated\nrelative to the day they run. ADR-0015 records the decisions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGxuGPgx\ns7lxnDa3QuCrboPeGIV3VWoJOW/GwlFfGRLTjsw8ji7ELCw5DQkUNoX57IN5sG7NTt7/ObbUsRNN\niQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:05:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDljYTgwZDc2M2FiMGJjMmU0YmMzYzU5ZTFiYjRkOWFlZGEyZmQzYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770","sha":"7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770"}],"sha":"9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9ca80d763ab0bc2e4bc3c59e1bb4d9aeda2fd3bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:33:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:33:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(contract): decide a resubmitted document on its newest approval chain\n\nA purchase order sent back for changes and then resubmitted gets a fresh\napproval chain, but the old steps stay in the store as history and the decide\nhandler passed all of them to decideApproval. The old \"changes requested\" step\nstill counted when the outcome was worked out, so a manager approving the new\nchain sent the order straight back to changes requested. Reproduced on the\nproduction build before the fix: after the approval, both the outcome and the\nPO status came back as changes_requested.\n\nlatestChain picks the steps of the newest submission (they share one\ntimestamp) and the handler decides against those only. Covered by three unit\ntests, and by an e2e spec that fails on the old build with an outcome of\nchanges_requested where approved is expected, and passes now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"e83319cfe0625e0ed969b1dde934e3eed99cbac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/e83319cfe0625e0ed969b1dde934e3eed99cbac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/7cf9594f37e00e454d24719263abb8b2f57b3770","verification":{"payload":"tree e83319cfe0625e0ed969b1dde934e3eed99cbac0\nparent c3bcf14eefcd4180c450bcfaabde3370805856ad\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790778791 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790778791 +0000\n\nfix(contract): decide a resubmitted document on its newest approval chain\n\nA purchase order sent back for changes and then resubmitted gets a fresh\napproval chain, but the old steps stay in the store as history and the decide\nhandler passed all of them to decideApproval. The old \"changes requested\" step\nstill counted when the outcome was worked out, so a manager approving the new\nchain sent the order straight back to changes requested. Reproduced on the\nproduction build before the fix: after the approval, both the outcome and the\nPO status came back as changes_requested.\n\nlatestChain picks the steps of the newest submission (they share one\ntimestamp) and the handler decides against those only. Covered by three unit\ntests, and by an e2e spec that fails on the old build with an outcome of\nchanges_requested where approved is expected, and passes now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEEYRIxe\n690x5kYI/35+Lnqx5LN5JEkwGCJku8owqS8TNhH1P9mWDOpty/wa9LjcfbFeRbht4jNrczQuKV8k\naw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T15:05:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gr