rl":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/c3bcf14eefcd4180c450bcfaabde3370805856ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(adr): record the XLSX export and Storybook decisions\n\nADR-0013 explains why Excel export is written in-house on fflate: write-excel-file\nhung on 5,000 rows under the app''s CSP (measured), because it compresses in a\nblob: worker that worker-src blocks without any rejection. ADR-0014 covers\nStorybook, the shared tokens and the per-story render/axe check, with the two\nfalse alarms found while building it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"7a273722b82ebf889213b0a0a84cfe72f70fd99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/7a273722b82ebf889213b0a0a84cfe72f70fd99e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/c3bcf14eefcd4180c450bcfaabde3370805856ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a273722b82ebf889213b0a0a84cfe72f70fd99e\nparent 60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766428 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766428 +0000\n\ndocs(adr): record the XLSX export and Storybook decisions\n\nADR-0013 explains why Excel export is written in-house on fflate: write-excel-file\nhung on 5,000 rows under the app''s CSP (measured), because it compresses in a\nblob: worker that worker-src blocks without any rejection. ADR-0014 covers\nStorybook, the shared tokens and the per-story render/axe check, with the two\nfalse alarms found while building it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/se