1847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: build Storybook and check every story on each push\n\nA storybook job builds the static site, opens all 52 stories in light and dark,\nand fails on console errors or axe violations. The build is uploaded as an\nartifact; publishing it needs a hosting account and is left to the owner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"1bb3f7a30bc0dac4d393133b34deeb5212ea2ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/1bb3f7a30bc0dac4d393133b34deeb5212ea2ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bb3f7a30bc0dac4d393133b34deeb5212ea2ac6\nparent 47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766426 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766426 +0000\n\nci: build Storybook and check every story on each push\n\nA storybook job builds the static site, opens all 52 stories in light and dark,\nand fails on console errors or axe violations. The build is uploaded as an\nartifact; publishing it needs a hosting account and is left to the owner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPMtb4Qs\n0jLL8/wmhLuu+UnGxPuZpgo/L3lWmDZAHb/gbpq0xJ8QeM2Jlfh0tuuiPBDuVSsPEVNMiI1ZX70z\nLgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:07:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDYwYjVkZTc3Zjg1ZmUwYTAxNTY4NmNiMjFiN2RmNWFkMDhhOWVhYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be","sha":"47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be"}],"sha":"60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/60b5de77f85fe0a015686cb21b7df5ad08a9eab9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:07:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): add Storybook with 52 stories on shared design tokens\n\nStorybook 10 (react-vite, a11y and docs addons) documents the design system:\nbuttons, status badges, KPI tiles, timeline, dialog, toast, command list and\ndropdown, the form controls, FormKit validation, the wizard, the line-items\ntable, and the DataGrid in server mode, loading, empty, error, with bulk actions\nand exports, and as a 10,000-row virtualized grid, plus the filter bar. A toolbar\nswitches light and dark the way the apps do. Telemetry is off.\n\nThe palette and Tailwind theme moved out of apps/erp/src/index.css into\npackages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css (exported as @mekong-erp/ui/tokens.css), so the\napp, Storybook and the coming Vue inbox share one file. The app''s compiled CSS is\nbyte-identical before and after; stories are excluded from its Tailwind scan so\ntheir layout classes don''t reach the production stylesheet.\n\nA Playwright spec opens every story in both themes and fails on a console error,\npage error or axe violation (WCAG A/AA). Building it turned up two false alarms\nworth knowing about: Storybook''s own addon runs axe in the same frame (\"Axe is\nalready running\"), and 150ms colour transitions after the theme class lands read\nas 1.39:1 contrast. A deliberately low-contrast story confirmed the check fails.\n\n@types/node, already used by apps/erp, is now a dev dependency here too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"1cba59588749f3c32991c54e8380e3dc70093b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/1cba59588749f3c32991c54e8380e3dc70093b59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/47c559480f25a8e0228e6b41919fc98ce0a235be","verification":{"payload":"tree 1cba59588749f3c32991c54e8380e3dc70093b59\nparent d45b1ab6e7ebc42a6dbd42ef7bf3e3c0c2844f4b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766423 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790766423 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): add Storybook with 52 stories on shared design tokens\n\nStorybook 10 (react-vite, a11y and docs addons) documents the design system:\nbuttons, status badges, KPI tiles, timeline, dialog, toast, command list and\ndropdown, the form controls, FormKit validation, the wizard, the line-items\ntable, and the DataGrid in server mode, loading, empty, error, with bulk actions\nand exports, and as a 10,000-row virtualized grid, plus the filter bar. A toolbar\nswitches light and dark the way the apps do. Telemetry is off.\n\nThe palette and Tailwind theme moved out of apps/erp/src/index.css into\npackages/ui/src/styles/tokens.css (exported as @mekong-erp/ui/tokens.css), so the\napp, Storybook and the coming Vue inbox share one file. The app''s compiled CSS is\nbyte-identical before and after; stories are excluded from its Tailwind scan so\ntheir layout classes don''t reach the production stylesheet.\n\nA Playwright spec opens every story in both themes and fails on a console error,\npage error or axe violation (WCAG A/AA). Building it turned up two false alarms\nworth knowing about: Storybook''s own addon runs axe in the same frame (\"Axe is\nalready running\"), and 150ms colour transitions after the theme class lands read\nas 1.39:1 contrast. A deliberately low-contrast story confirmed the check fails.\n\n@types/node, already used by apps/erp, is now a dev dependency here too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDXaG0Y8\neI6iYs70s/S+o70ICcdDoLL3dmbJkxa5SJCmzeG9kBTe7kyHyCwY5vKCdOAkreQdqTWZ6B+uf7jB\nFQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:07:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/