github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/f124e9fd0c7e6e44659195b956ac4aff67998d9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:50:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:50:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: record the unnamed-dialog finding and update the spec count\n\nThe suite now has 27 specs and its axe scope includes the command palette and\nthe searchable pickers. Adds the finding to the Phase 5 plan entry, ADR-0011,\nthe site''s case study and a CLAUDE.md tooling note, since Radix Dialog no longer\nwarns about a missing DialogTitle and only axe (or a by-name lookup) notices.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"339e4bda22469c17c61cf95dcc6f4134898197f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/339e4bda22469c17c61cf95dcc6f4134898197f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/f124e9fd0c7e6e44659195b956ac4aff67998d9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 339e4bda22469c17c61cf95dcc6f4134898197f6\nparent d7c812987a8cc52dfe4e746b59b750da86664313\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790761834 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790761834 +0000\n\ndocs: record the unnamed-dialog finding and update the spec count\n\nThe suite now has 27 specs and its axe scope includes the command palette and\nthe searchable pickers. Adds the finding to the Phase 5 plan entry, ADR-0011,\nthe site''s case study and a CLAUDE.md tooling note, since Radix Dialog no longer\nwarns about a missing DialogTitle and only axe (or a by-name lookup) notices.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz