:"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/d7c812987a8cc52dfe4e746b59b750da86664313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:50:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:50:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(a11y): name the command palette and record picker dialogs\n\nBoth dialogs rendered a Radix DialogContent with no DialogTitle, so they had\nrole=dialog and no accessible name (axe: aria-dialog-name). The installed\nRadix Dialog no longer warns about a missing title, and the page-level axe\nscans never opened these dialogs, so lint, types, the console and the existing\nspecs all stayed green.\n\nEach now has a screen-reader-only title: the palette also gets a description,\nand the pickers reuse their search prompt so no call site changes.\n\nTwo specs open the dialogs, look them up by name and scan them with axe. Both\nfailed on the previous production build (the dialogs appear in the accessibility\ntree without a name) and pass now, as do the full P2P and O2C flow specs that\ndrive the pickers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"56b2b2e1d74eb697e38755b4e01ad93a5de26eec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/56b2b2e1d74eb697e38755b4e01ad93a5de26eec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/d7c812987a8cc52dfe4e746b59b750da86664313","verification":{"payload":"tree 56b2b2e1d74eb697e38755b4e01ad93a5de26eec\nparent ec5a3c09cf52d7215885305047f53b4d879311e7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790761825 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790761825 +0000\n\nfix(a11y): name the command palette and record picker dialogs\n\nBoth dialogs rendered a Radix DialogContent with no DialogTitle, so they had\nrole=dialog and no accessible name (axe: aria-dialog-name). The installed\nRadix Dialog no longer warns about a missing title, and the page-level axe\nscans never opened these dialogs, so lint, types, the console and the existing\nspecs all stayed green.\n\nEach now has a screen-reader-only title: the palette also gets a description,\nand the pickers reuse their search prompt so no call site changes.\n\nTwo specs open the dialogs, look them up by name and scan them with axe. Both\nfailed on the previous production build (the dialogs appear in the accessibility\ntree without a name) and pass now, as do the full P2P and O2C flow specs that\ndrive the pickers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFoMoEdu\nIx4nsWC8a9D5dHNiot2oMZap6BpakVJOx5Uh6wEsM7ablQwuBrKz4/VdYMjqtzWwpLH5KEFBPpqX\nNAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:50:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github