on so charts are fully drawn.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"b24ce4ae8bf5e473ccd0c3f9d0bdf3395dd2a2db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/b24ce4ae8bf5e473ccd0c3f9d0bdf3395dd2a2db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/a6534dd4cb356cee6ed684e52e37410587d9281b","verification":{"payload":"tree b24ce4ae8bf5e473ccd0c3f9d0bdf3395dd2a2db\nparent 98a19757cb348b01268393db4c69e7e0d8bca0fd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760783 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760783 +0000\n\nchore(erp): add robots.txt and the screenshot capture script\n\nWithout a robots.txt the host''s SPA fallback serves index.html for it, which\nLighthouse''s SEO audit flags as an invalid robots file. The capture script\nreuses the e2e seeded state to produce the documentation screenshots from the\nreal production build, parking the pointer and waiting out Recharts'' entrance\nanimation so charts are fully drawn.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC5ERqXn\nv0pXzpEQJiVtLllO8HycNiIA12fJ/GxnXl1YBSzsy8C/Gd4insza70f0kCAK/Slht3sFI/j8Rfrg\nzA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:33:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h