/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/ef517b2afa910e3fa4373d9b9aae2637d90d529d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:32:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:32:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: add README, ADRs 0011-0012 and the Phase 5 plan entry\n\nREADME: what the project is, screenshots, a two-command quick start, an\narchitecture diagram, a requirement-to-feature table that marks every row Done,\nPartial or Not built, a quality table with measured numbers (150 unit tests,\n99% line coverage of the pure domain modules, 25 Playwright specs, 273 kB gzip\ninitial JS, Lighthouse results and their caveats), deploy steps that say what\nwas and was not verified, and a known-limitations list.\n\nADR-0011 records the end-to-end strategy (production build, pre-seeded storage\nstate, fail on any console/page/CSP error); ADR-0012 the single-source security\nheaders and the Zod JIT/CSP finding. PLAN.md gets the Phase 5 progress-log entry,\na corrected status line and next-step section (nothing is deployed; that needs\nthe owner''s Vercel account). CLAUDE.md gets the new commands, the \"import z from\nthe contract\" convention, status and known gaps, and the reusable lessons:\nuseWatch vs useMemo, flex min-w-0, e2e assertion traps, Lighthouse in this\nsandbox. SECURITY.md notes the eval-free Zod setup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"15913869cd137387c40c6c547eaf4c77404c7321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/15913869cd137387c40c6c547eaf4c77404c7321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/ef517b2afa910e3fa4373d9b9aae2637d90d529d","verification":{"payload":"tree 15913869cd137387c40c6c547eaf4c77404c7321\nparent 27e7fffd1eac70ea739a8ef974a7ba6cdcb6f1bb\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760777 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760777 +0000\n\ndocs: add README, ADRs 0011-0012 and the Phase 5 plan entry\n\nREADME: what the project is, screenshots, a two-command quick start, an\narchitecture diagram, a requirement-to-feature table that marks every row Done,\nPartial or Not built, a quality table with measured numbers (150 unit tests,\n99% line coverage of the pure domain modules, 25 Playwright specs, 273 kB gzip\ninitial JS, Lighthouse results and their caveats), deploy steps that say what\nwas and was not verified, and a known-limitations list.\n\nADR-0011 records the end-to-end strategy (production build, pre-seeded storage\nstate, fail on any console/page/CSP error); ADR-0012 the single-source security\nheaders and the Zod JIT/CSP finding. PLAN.md gets the Phase 5 progress-log entry,\na corrected status line and next-step section (nothing is deployed; that needs\nthe owner''s Vercel account). CLAUDE.md gets the new commands, the \"import z from\nthe contract\" convention, status and known gaps, and the reusable lessons:\nuseWatch vs useMemo, flex min-w-0, e2e assertion traps, Lighthouse in this\nsandbox. SECURITY.md notes the eval-free Zod setup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN S