re than obscurity for a\nportfolio. Maps are not loaded unless DevTools is open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"babe63f2d73da7ee4e7c306b010484e6eb7e20da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/babe63f2d73da7ee4e7c306b010484e6eb7e20da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/7f60c6859299cef393080e085dbc3ee1030eeef8","verification":{"payload":"tree babe63f2d73da7ee4e7c306b010484e6eb7e20da\nparent aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760203 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760203 +0000\n\nbuild(erp): emit source maps\n\nThe repository is public and Lighthouse flags large first-party bundles that\nship without maps; readable stack traces are worth more than obscurity for a\nportfolio. Maps are not loaded unless DevTools is open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBGn2fKj\nAIuI1xTACM3ltKlM0hwCJvqywFDDM0OUdzs7Z/2ovradMGXexWDk7uiwPC7MrKoaXu9/5aFQma2U\nNwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:23:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/7f60c6859299cef393080e085dbc3ee1030eeef8","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDdmNjBjNjg1OTI5OWNlZjM5MzA4MGUwODVkYmMzZWUxMDMwZWVlZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d","sha":"aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d"}],"sha":"7f60c6859299cef393080e085dbc3ee1030eeef8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7f60c6859299cef393080e085dbc3ee1030eeef8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(a11y): heading order, language button name and form field names\n\nLighthouse accessibility/best-practices findings on the dashboard:\n\n- heading-order: KPI labels and card titles were <h3> directly under the page\n  <h1>. Card titles are now <h2>; a KPI label is a caption, not a heading (six\n  of them would only add noise to heading navigation).\n- label-content-name-mismatch (WCAG 2.5.3): the language button showed \"EN\" but\n  was named only \"Switch language\". Its accessible name now starts with the\n  visible text.\n- Chrome''s \"form field has neither an id nor a name\" notices: every DataGrid\n  control (search box, filters, page-size select, selection checkboxes) now has\n  a name. A fresh browser logs zero DevTools issues across the main pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"85ccbb7d8e41ae461474f4b12460a69778394416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/85ccbb7d8e41ae461474f4b12460a69778394416"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 85ccbb7d8e41ae461474f4b12460a69778394416\nparent 2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760200 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760200 +0000\n\nfix(a11y): heading order, language button name and form field names\n\nLighthouse accessibility/best-practices findings on the dashboard:\n\n- heading-order: KPI labels and card titles were <h3> directly under the page\n  <h1>. Card titles are now <h2>; a KPI label is a caption, not a heading (six\n  of them would only add noise to heading navigation).\n- label-content-name-mismatch (WCAG 2.5.3): the language button showed \"EN\" but\n  was named only \"Switch language\". Its accessible name now starts with the\n  visible text.\n- Chrome''s \"form field has neither an id nor a name\" notices: every DataGrid\n  control (search box, filters, page-size select, selection checkboxes) now has\n  a name. A fresh browser logs zero DevTools issues across the main pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKaguoGa\nMDtF1nYHDECT2NrYhkq1pG5A6S3vu7peXJV4iTt4gOikRHozEcNOiQ8zr7QmHDdogMQSZP2cJcI7\nowU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:23:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGFlYTY5ZTI4NzIxYjFjNThlNzRlNTg1M2JjNjBhMDYwY2JmZmJkM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3","sha":"2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3"}],"sha":"aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/aea69e28721b1c58e74e5853bc60a060cbffbd3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:23:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(security): stop Zod''s eval probe violating the app''s CSP\n\nLighthouse''s \"issues logged in DevTools\" audit surfaced a script-src eval\nviolation on every page load. Zod 4 probes `new Function('''')` when each schema\nis constructed to decide whether it may JIT-compile parsers; under a CSP without\n''unsafe-eval'' the probe is blocked and reported even though the throw is\ncaught. Nothing broke, so neither the console-error check nor any test noticed.\n\nz.config({ jitless: true }) skips the probe, but Zod reads it at construction\ntime and a side-effect-only config module was evaluated by the bundler after\nthe chunk that had already built the schemas (verified in the built output).\nSo every schema module now imports `z` from one wrapper\n(packages/contract/src/zod.ts) that sets the option and re-exports it, making\nthe order a data dependency; the contract barrel re-exports `z` for the app,\nand an ESLint no-restricted-imports rule forbids importing zod directly.\n\nThe e2e fixture now fails any spec on a `securitypolicyviolation` event on any\npage. Confirmed to fail without the fix (\"script-src blocked eval\") and pass\nwith it; a fresh browser then logs zero CSP issues across several pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"5f8b2a4870d96e2a6edca4f2bc642830c6cf76de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/5f8b2a4870d96e2a6edca4f2bc642830c6cf76de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f8b2a4870d96e2a6edca4f2bc642830c6cf76de\nparent 671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760188 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790760188 +0000\n\nfix(security): stop Zod''s eval probe violating the app''s CSP\n\nLighthouse''s \"issues logged in DevTools\" audit surfaced a script-src eval\nviolation on every page load. Zod 4 probes `new Function('''')` when each schema\nis constructed to decide whether it may JIT-compile parsers; under a CSP without\n''unsafe-eval'' the probe is blocked and reported even though the throw is\ncaught. Nothing broke, so neither the console-error check nor any test noticed.\n\nz.config({ jitless: true }) skips the probe, but Zod reads it at construction\ntime and a side-effect-only config module was evaluated by the bundler after\nthe chunk that had already built the schemas (verified in the built output).\nSo every schema module now imports `z` from one wrapper\n(packages/contract/src/zod.ts) that sets the option and re-exports it, making\nthe order a data dependency; the contract barrel re-exports `z` for the app,\nand an ESLint no-restricted-imports rule forbids importing zod directly.\n\nThe e2e fixture now fails any spec on a `securitypolicyviolation` event on any\npage. Confirmed to fail without the fix (\"script-src blocked eval\") and pass\nwith it; a fresh browser then logs zero CSP issues across several pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHUdx1aR\nenQJvpUqSp08rrV6Nl/ViDdCeERrz5ccjALWaDuQdKXQk52oEyV40kcsEUOd+QS01uJ0p4hS0vTJ\n1gc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:23:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDJkZjgzYmMyMjI3NGM1OTQ4NGNlYzU4YTFkNDQ4ZWNlZDNlNTRlZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79","sha":"671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79"}],"sha":"2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/2df83bc22274c59484cec58a1d448eced3e54ee3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:08:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:08:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(erp): let wide grids scroll instead of stretching the whole page\n\nThe shell''s content column was a flex item without min-w-0. A flex item never\nshrinks below its content, so a wide grid (Products needs ~1460px, Approvals\nsimilar) stretched the entire page: at a 1360px viewport the document was 100px\ntoo wide and the top bar''s theme toggle and user menu, the only way to switch\npersona or log out, sat off-screen. Adding min-w-0 lets the grid''s own\noverflow container scroll.\n\nNoticed in a documentation screenshot, not by any test: Playwright treats an\noff-screen element as visible. Adds an e2e spec that asserts no page-level\nhorizontal overflow and an in-viewport user menu on every grid screen; it\nfails (60px over on Products) with the fix removed and passes with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"8993d7ed04a0fbfe83830394d8995fa017613e12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/8993d7ed04a0fbfe83830394d8995fa017613e12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79","verification":{"payload":"tree 8993d7ed04a0fbfe83830394d8995fa017613e12\nparent d8b4c4de255ea3b868ad603a97dfa8535de9f36a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790759330 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790759330 +0000\n\nfix(erp): let wide grids scroll instead of stretching the whole page\n\nThe shell''s content column was a flex item without min-w-0. A flex item never\nshrinks below its content, so a wide grid (Products needs ~1460px, Approvals\nsimilar) stretched the entire page: at a 1360px viewport the document was 100px\ntoo wide and the top bar''s theme toggle and user menu, the only way to switch\npersona or log out, sat off-screen. Adding min-w-0 lets the grid''s own\noverflow container scroll.\n\nNoticed in a documentation screenshot, not by any test: Playwright treats an\noff-screen element as visible. Adds an e2e spec that asserts no page-level\nhorizontal overflow and an in-viewport user menu on every grid screen; it\nfails (60px over on Products) with the fix removed and passes with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIbpZVOL\nEWQavH/g5cCdbNPSOUzLmrmJdJbNka4o9HgR3jtz6gxNF2j4EeBv3qGr6yYZWEXDGRkjleIVg8KM\nrgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:23:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/671839edd7d10904c959ae72d35bb386c522be79","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDY3MTgzOWVkZDdkMTA5MDRjOTU5YWU3MmQzNWJiMzg2YzUyMmJlNzk","parents":[{