 Playwright end-to-end and axe accessibility suites\n\n24 specs run against the production build (`vite preview`, served with the real\nsecurity headers), and every spec fails on any unexpected console or page\nerror:\n\n- auth/RBAC: Vietnamese by default on a fresh profile, a warehouse user cannot\n  reach Accounting or the approvals inbox, sessions survive reload, 404 page\n- procure-to-pay: PO wizard -> submit -> manager approves in the inbox ->\n  partial receipts x2 -> vendor bill -> three-way match -> payment -> closed,\n  asserting the wizard''s 220,000 VND review total\n- order-to-cash: quotation -> send -> accept -> convert -> partial deliveries\n  x2 -> invoice -> e-invoice preview -> payment -> closed, then a balanced\n  trial balance\n- dashboard KPIs and charts, realtime approval toast, inventory grid (URL\n  state survives reload, empty state, bulk selection, CSV export, virtualized\n  100k-row movements), demo tools (injected 503s surface the error state and\n  recover; reset requires a second confirmation)\n- axe-core (WCAG 2.0/2.1 A + AA) on login, dashboard, products, purchase\n  orders, approvals, trial balance, and the dark dashboard\n\nSeeding 110k records takes ~1 min, so a global setup seeds once and saves the\nstorage state (IndexedDB included) that each test starts from; E2E_REUSE_SEED=1\nskips the reseed for local iteration. PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH lets\na sandbox use a preinstalled Chromium. `pnpm test:e2e` builds and runs them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"49ce2c215e29093761469d2e037ebb54f4dd4005","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/49ce2c215e29093761469d2e037ebb54f4dd4005"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/33944e1ec072b98c76be31d5b132f850e25287e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 49ce2c215e29093761469d2e037ebb54f4dd4005\nparent 55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758089 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758089 +0000\n\ntest(erp): add Playwright end-to-end and axe accessibility suites\n\n24 specs run against the production build (`vite preview`, served with the real\nsecurity headers), and every spec fails on any unexpected console or page\nerror:\n\n- auth/RBAC: Vietnamese by default on a fresh profile, a warehouse user cannot\n  reach Accounting or the approvals inbox, sessions survive reload, 404 page\n- procure-to-pay: PO wizard -> submit -> manager approves in the inbox ->\n  partial receipts x2 -> vendor bill -> three-way match -> payment -> closed,\n  asserting the wizard''s 220,000 VND review total\n- order-to-cash: quotation -> send -> accept -> convert -> partial deliveries\n  x2 -> invoice -> e-invoice preview -> payment -> closed, then a balanced\n  trial balance\n- dashboard KPIs and charts, realtime approval toast, inventory grid (URL\n  state survives reload, empty state, bulk selection, CSV export, virtualized\n  100k-row movements), demo tools (injected 503s surface the error state and\n  recover; reset requires a second confirmation)\n- axe-core (WCAG 2.0/2.1 A + AA) on login, dashboard, products, purchase\n  orders, approvals, trial balance, and the dark dashboard\n\nSeeding 110k records takes ~1 min, so a global setup seeds once and saves the\nstorage state (IndexedDB included) that each test starts from; E2E_REUSE_SEED=1\nskips the reseed for local iteration. PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH lets\na sandbox use a preinstalled Chromium. `pnpm test:e2e` builds and runs them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHQLTqIp\n9Mxyu+Q2L3ABYEk7WfkXh2fAs4q1GxvhCLWkGzLo2eBga4f7dasrCebBAzWwWfNJnBN0jqb6W1DK\nSAA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:48:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/33944e1ec072b98c76be31d5b132f850e25287e5","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDMzOTQ0ZTFlYzA3MmI5OGM3NmJlMzFkNWIxMzJmODUwZTI1Mjg3ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34","sha":"55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34"}],"sha":"33944e1ec072b98c76be31d5b132f850e25287e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/33944e1ec072b98c76be31d5b132f850e25287e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:45:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:45:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(a11y): meet WCAG AA contrast and name every grid header control\n\nFirst axe-core run against the built app found real defects:\n\n- Light-mode accent, success and warning colours failed AA. Measured ratios:\n  accent text 4.26:1 on white and white-on-accent buttons 4.26:1, warning text\n  4.00:1, success/warning/accent badges 4.01/3.55/3.75:1 against their own\n  10% tint. Darkened the light-mode tokens (accent 0.48/0.08, success\n  0.47/0.146, warning 0.49/0.1, destructive 0.50/0.20 in OKLCH) so every text\n  and badge combination is >= 5:1, with chroma kept inside sRGB so browsers do\n  not gamut-map them to something lower-contrast. Dark mode already passed.\n- DataGrid rendered a <button> for every header, including columns that cannot\n  sort; the approvals actions column has an empty header, giving an unnamed\n  (critical, button-name) control. Non-sortable headers are now plain text, and\n  the actions column gets a screen-reader-only label in both languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"ba7da5485be96385cd3ce03d6bc8d76f72211139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/ba7da5485be96385cd3ce03d6bc8d76f72211139"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34","verification":{"payload":"tree ba7da5485be96385cd3ce03d6bc8d76f72211139\nparent 7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790757916 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790757916 +0000\n\nfix(a11y): meet WCAG AA contrast and name every grid header control\n\nFirst axe-core run against the built app found real defects:\n\n- Light-mode accent, success and warning colours failed AA. Measured ratios:\n  accent text 4.26:1 on white and white-on-accent buttons 4.26:1, warning text\n  4.00:1, success/warning/accent badges 4.01/3.55/3.75:1 against their own\n  10% tint. Darkened the light-mode tokens (accent 0.48/0.08, success\n  0.47/0.146, warning 0.49/0.1, destructive 0.50/0.20 in OKLCH) so every text\n  and badge combination is >= 5:1, with chroma kept inside sRGB so browsers do\n  not gamut-map them to something lower-contrast. Dark mode already passed.\n- DataGrid rendered a <button> for every header, including columns that cannot\n  sort; the approvals actions column has an empty header, giving an unnamed\n  (critical, button-name) control. Non-sortable headers are now plain text, and\n  the actions column gets a screen-reader-only label in both languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJVuKceg\nPVSziXzkM0j81hgx8sWTSiAOZE3z0DVHzCekKUrvVrwProU38jgbvgpXrr5pQlLozqaswh9fiXsW\nZA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:48:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDU1Y2U4ZTdhNTQ5MzVmNjJiYjJhZWY1NTIwYzdjODI4ZDRjZGNkMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23","sha":"7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23"}],"sha":"55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/55ce8e7a54935f62bb2aef5520c7c828d4cdcd34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:36:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:36:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(erp): recompute wizard and quotation totals when line fields change\n\nThe PO wizard''s Review step (and the quotation form''s totals panel) derived\nline totals through a useMemo keyed on watch(''lines''). React Hook Form returns\nits own array there and mutates it in place as fields change, so the memo only\nrecomputed when the array was replaced. Edited quickly, the Review step showed\na blank line and a 0 VND grand total even though the form state, and therefore\nthe submitted document, was correct. useWatch returns a fresh value on every\nchange and fixes both.\n\nFound by the new end-to-end procure-to-pay spec, which asserts the 220,000 VND\ngrand total on the Review step; confirmed in the browser after the fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"725edf14d304eea46e518d3a727c1c2ae8b3b64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/725edf14d304eea46e518d3a727c1c2ae8b3b64c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23","verification":{"payload":"tree 725edf14d304eea46e518d3a727c1c2ae8b3b64c\nparent 8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790757399 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790757399 +0000\n\nfix(erp): recompute wizard and quotation totals when line fields change\n\nThe PO wizard''s Review step (and the quotation form''s totals panel) derived\nline totals through a useMemo keyed on watch(''lines''). React Hook Form returns\nits own array there and mutates it in place as fields change, so the memo only\nrecomputed when the array was replaced. Edited quickly, the Review step showed\na blank line and a 0 VND grand total even though the form state, and therefore\nthe submitted document, was correct. useWatch returns a fresh value on every\nchange and fixes both.\n\nFound by the new end-to-end procure-to-pay spec, which asserts the 220,000 VND\ngrand total on the Review step; confirmed in the browser after the fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNhwR5MS\nX7j0yVZWZ+s0tDaM/lfxbolZ80P4EbZe2TT4oYXCMjokLFVXc/BGSsjI0ro2mVGMtwspMavC2ZmC\nTgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:48:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDdhMGIwYzhiOTlkZGM0MDhmNmQwMzAyY2ExMWJjZTRmMTRmNDJhMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33","sha":"8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33"}],"sha":"7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/7a0b0c8b99ddc408f6d0302ca11bce4f14f42a23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: add security policy, contributing guide, workflows and demo script\n\nSECURITY.md states plainly that client-side RBAC is UX rather than\nauthorization and lists what the front end does and does not do (CSP, no raw\nHTML, CSV formula sanitization, Zod at every boundary) along with known\nlimitations. docs/workflows holds user stories and Mermaid state diagrams for\nP2P, O2C and approvals, checked against the actual status enums, posting\nrules and approval thresholds in the code. DEMO_SCRIPT.md is a guided\nwalk-through for a reviewer. Adds an MIT LICENSE (the plan''s stated default).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"ed86608aff8b15cf3b58d739500deef2ec5894f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/ed86608aff8b15cf3b58d739500deef2ec5894f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33","verification":{"payload":"tree ed86608aff8b15cf3b58d739500deef2ec5894f0\nparent 5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756894 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756894 +0000\n\ndocs: add security policy, contributing guide, workflows and demo script\n\nSECURITY.md states plainly that client-side RBAC is UX rather than\nauthorization and lists what the front end does and does not do (CSP, no raw\nHTML, CSV formula sanitization, Zod at every boundary) along with known\nlimitations. docs/workflows holds user stories and Mermaid state diagrams for\nP2P, O2C and approvals, checked against the actual status enums, posting\nrules and approval thresholds in the code. DEMO_SCRIPT.md is a guided\nwalk-through for a reviewer. Adds an MIT LICENSE (the plan''s stated default).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKNXgsh3\np6TxiXyWeHa2dw1l076vXq+Ed31zLrNe7xk4DYr+hAYEEJQmUNXJuyD0NKgbACw3gFq1TRYSBoJ/\nOgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDhjZmFjODYyZmM3YzM0OWM4OGI2NzcyNDJiNzFiZjNlYTBlYzhiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6","sha":"5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6"}],"sha":"8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/8cfac862fc7c349c88b677242b71bf3ea0ec8b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(site): add landing page, case study, architecture page and SEO metadata\n\nReplaces the Phase 0 placeholder with real static content: a feature overview,\na case study (problem, constraints, key decisions linked to the ADRs, defects\nonly a real browser found, next steps) and an architecture page with an\naccessible inline SVG diagram. Adds per-page metadata and canonical URLs, a\nsitemap, robots.txt, an Open Graph image, a skip link, and light/dark styling\nwith visible focus rings.\n\nDeployment URLs come from NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL / NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_URL at build\ntime rather than being guessed; with no demo URL set the \"Live demo\" links are\nhidden. vercel.json carries the headers (script-src needs ''unsafe-inline'' for\nNext''s hydration data, since nonces are impossible in a static export).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"88f5e6d8065012313317cbeab774ebd9eea5b1bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/88f5e6d8065012313317cbeab774ebd9eea5b1bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6","verification":{"payload":"tree 88f5e6d8065012313317cbeab774ebd9eea5b1bf\nparent 5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756891 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756891 +0000\n\nfeat(site): add landing page, case study, architecture page and SEO metadata\n\nReplaces the Phase 0 placeholder with real static content: a feature overview,\na case study (problem, constraints, key decisions linked to the ADRs, defects\nonly a real browser found, next steps) and an architecture page with an\naccessible inline SVG diagram. Adds per-page metadata and canonical URLs, a\nsitemap, robots.txt, an Open Graph image, a skip link, and light/dark styling\nwith visible focus rings.\n\nDeployment URLs come from NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL / NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_URL at build\ntime rather than being guessed; with no demo URL set the \"Live demo\" links are\nhidden. vercel.json carries the headers (script-src needs ''unsafe-inline'' for\nNext''s hydration data, since nonces are impossible in a static export).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPR5IC/+\nOKMrERj7CrqrcCbfKM/cpxgoilDOYrZ9/paCDxpubILMEAGyNNYywxQvOJDn03bmpIMKYAHOuE1B\nPw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDVjMjg0YjQyZWUyZTViMjVjMTc1NTBmNDhjYTk3MTU1MDY0MGFhZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d","sha":"5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d"}],"sha":"5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5c284b42ee2e5b25c17550f48ca971550640aae6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:28:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: enforce coverage thresholds and an initial-bundle budget, and build the image\n\nRuns the domain-logic coverage thresholds and a gzip budget on the initial-load\nJS/CSS (300 kB / 20 kB; currently 272 kB / 6 kB) after the normal checks, so\nregressions in either fail the build. Adds a job that builds the Docker image\nand smoke-tests the container''s security headers and SPA fallback. That job is\nunverified locally because the authoring environment has no Docker daemon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"fa9b55cd066bf9cef092c94fd00c8b7be24ffc27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/fa9b55cd066bf9cef092c94fd00c8b7be24ffc27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d","verification":{"payload":"tree fa9b55cd066bf9cef092c94fd00c8b7be24ffc27\nparent 97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756881 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756881 +0000\n\nci: enforce coverage thresholds and an initial-bundle budget, and build the image\n\nRuns the domain-logic coverage thresholds and a gzip budget on the initial-load\nJS/CSS (300 kB / 20 kB; currently 272 kB / 6 kB) after the normal checks, so\nregressions in either fail the build. Adds a job that builds the Docker image\nand smoke-tests the container''s security headers and SPA fallback. That job is\nunverified locally because the authoring environment has no Docker daemon.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBZKASdN\np2g+FNGwLD6Hr/AC5sfHJAz+vDoi47nMn+a01+8PH1vgGvSztIBu49Z4VUT+sHshA39scbMaNIED\nSgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDVkYzlhMzhiYjY5MTdmNzZmOGVkNzkxODMzNmViYWRkZDhlNDFkMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2","sha":"97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2"}],"sha":"5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/5dc9a38bb6917f76f8ed7918336ebaddd8e41d0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp): serve the SPA with a strict CSP and add Vercel, nginx and Docker config\n\nOne module (security-headers.ts) is the source of truth for the response\nheaders: script-src ''self'' (no inline scripts, no eval), object-src none,\nframe-ancestors none, nosniff, referrer/permissions policies and HSTS.\n`vite preview` serves the production build with exactly these, so browser\ntests run under the real CSP; vercel.json and nginx.conf repeat them and a\nunit test fails if any of the three drift.\n\nAdds a multi-stage Dockerfile (pinned Node, cached pnpm store, unprivileged\nnginx runtime) and a compose file for a local preview. The image could not be\nbuilt in the authoring environment (no Docker daemon), so it is unverified\nhere; CI builds and smoke-tests it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"bb3cf232b300486a7ba4c0e008e5ffab318a2f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/bb3cf232b300486a7ba4c0e008e5ffab318a2f0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2","verification":{"payload":"tree bb3cf232b300486a7ba4c0e008e5ffab318a2f0e\nparent e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756856 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756856 +0000\n\nfeat(erp): serve the SPA with a strict CSP and add Vercel, nginx and Docker config\n\nOne module (security-headers.ts) is the source of truth for the response\nheaders: script-src ''self'' (no inline scripts, no eval), object-src none,\nframe-ancestors none, nosniff, referrer/permissions policies and HSTS.\n`vite preview` serves the production build with exactly these, so browser\ntests run under the real CSP; vercel.json and nginx.conf repeat them and a\nunit test fails if any of the three drift.\n\nAdds a multi-stage Dockerfile (pinned Node, cached pnpm store, unprivileged\nnginx runtime) and a compose file for a local preview. The image could not be\nbuilt in the authoring environment (no Docker daemon), so it is unverified\nhere; CI builds and smoke-tests it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAUx0YxL\np8t2a7rRFeOMZxIVaTQH8Bffcvn9jpBdur7Cp5ucCActr1BmIs3BvCgpEAYAAPBIyF4Mv6vaHGSt\niwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDk3ZTY5YTU0ZDRiYTE4ZTVjMmUzMTNiYzA3MDViNDY3NWY1YmUyYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce","sha":"e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce"}],"sha":"97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/97e69a54d4ba18e5c2e313bc0705b4675f5be2a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp): add demo tools dialog, favicon and html lang sync\n\nThe plan''s success criteria call for a visible \"reset demo data\" action and\nPLAN.md section 7 for a dev panel; neither existed. User menu -> Demo tools\nnow resets the seeded dataset (behind an explicit second confirmation) and\ntunes the simulated latency and random-failure rate, with English and\nVietnamese copy.\n\nAlso fixes two small defects found by the first browser test run: every page\nload 404''d on /favicon.ico (there was no icon), and <html lang> stayed \"en\"\nwhile the UI defaulted to Vietnamese (WCAG 3.1.1). Adds a favicon, page\ndescription and theme colour, and keeps lang in step with the i18n language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"800fca80e67a1f9a7878ce799db44146dfd1c27b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/800fca80e67a1f9a7878ce799db44146dfd1c27b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce","verification":{"payload":"tree 800fca80e67a1f9a7878ce799db44146dfd1c27b\nparent 9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756845 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756845 +0000\n\nfeat(erp): add demo tools dialog, favicon and html lang sync\n\nThe plan''s success criteria call for a visible \"reset demo data\" action and\nPLAN.md section 7 for a dev panel; neither existed. User menu -> Demo tools\nnow resets the seeded dataset (behind an explicit second confirmation) and\ntunes the simulated latency and random-failure rate, with English and\nVietnamese copy.\n\nAlso fixes two small defects found by the first browser test run: every page\nload 404''d on /favicon.ico (there was no icon), and <html lang> stayed \"en\"\nwhile the UI defaulted to Vietnamese (WCAG 3.1.1). Adds a favicon, page\ndescription and theme colour, and keeps lang in step with the i18n language.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH404dqT\nH4/wu45lM8P5CxEv2EbdEIy0H2wPg0Co89BSjbH1oVQqNsUDuc/En/StOIdO1zDg8tVxvAI8duGk\nXws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGU2ZWRhMzMzN2NlMjlhOTIyOWU0Y2FjYWExM2RjOWY3OWQzYzcyY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61","sha":"9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61"}],"sha":"e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/e6eda3337ce29a9229e4cacaa13dc9f79d3c72ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(contract): simulate network latency/failures and lazy-load seed generators\n\nPLAN.md section 7 calls for configurable mock latency (150-600 ms) and a\nrandom-failure toggle so loading and error states are real. A catch-all MSW\nhandler now sits in front of the real ones (falling through by returning\nnothing), driven by a small localStorage-backed config; /api/session is exempt\nso a failure toggle can never lock the demo user out.\n\nAlso moves faker and every seed generator behind a dynamic import. A returning\nvisitor''s IndexedDB already holds the data, so they no longer download the\n~435 kB generator chunk: initial JS drops from ~437 kB to ~273 kB gzipped. The\nproduct category/unit vocabulary moved to a faker-free module so the app can\nstill import it for filter options. Verified by seeding a fresh browser\nprofile through the new dynamic import.\n\nAdds tests for dev-config, list-query param parsing and document numbering.\nDomain-logic coverage is now 99% of lines (see vitest.config.ts for scope).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"456ea1735ad8d3a05ecd9f87393214b819b1b988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/456ea1735ad8d3a05ecd9f87393214b819b1b988"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61","verification":{"payload":"tree 456ea1735ad8d3a05ecd9f87393214b819b1b988\nparent cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756837 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756837 +0000\n\nfeat(contract): simulate network latency/failures and lazy-load seed generators\n\nPLAN.md section 7 calls for configurable mock latency (150-600 ms) and a\nrandom-failure toggle so loading and error states are real. A catch-all MSW\nhandler now sits in front of the real ones (falling through by returning\nnothing), driven by a small localStorage-backed config; /api/session is exempt\nso a failure toggle can never lock the demo user out.\n\nAlso moves faker and every seed generator behind a dynamic import. A returning\nvisitor''s IndexedDB already holds the data, so they no longer download the\n~435 kB generator chunk: initial JS drops from ~437 kB to ~273 kB gzipped. The\nproduct category/unit vocabulary moved to a faker-free module so the app can\nstill import it for filter options. Verified by seeding a fresh browser\nprofile through the new dynamic import.\n\nAdds tests for dev-config, list-query param parsing and document numbering.\nDomain-logic coverage is now 99% of lines (see vitest.config.ts for scope).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCTw5KUl\nmrly/H4Zwnm3YYX4mQJD3JLKvRmyKC1+i/STeI7c+1Pz+ZZJBwlFxPg7nKWN5WQ+zQDmHIj93wRX\nRQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDkzMTNhZmJlZTQzNWY2ZDM3YjA0NzVmZDQyMjVkZjMyNzM3YWNmNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef","sha":"cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef"}],"sha":"9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/9313afbee435f6d37b0475fd4225df32737acf61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore: add Playwright, axe-core and Vitest coverage tooling\n\nPhase 5 needs a browser test runner, an accessibility engine and a coverage\nprovider. Coverage in packages/contract is scoped to the pure domain-logic\nmodules (approval engine, three-way match, ledger, money, list-query, ...)\nwith thresholds, since a bug there silently corrupts money or the ledger;\nhandlers and seed data are exercised end to end instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"50f4cc27cb601f9001e6aab6a7710edea7b04db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/50f4cc27cb601f9001e6aab6a7710edea7b04db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 50f4cc27cb601f9001e6aab6a7710edea7b04db2\nparent 2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756827 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756827 +0000\n\nchore: add Playwright, axe-core and Vitest coverage tooling\n\nPhase 5 needs a browser test runner, an accessibility engine and a coverage\nprovider. Coverage in packages/contract is scoped to the pure domain-logic\nmodules (approval engine, three-way match, ledger, money, list-query, ...)\nwith thresholds, since a bug there silently corrupts money or the ledger;\nhandlers and seed data are exercised end to end instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHMCHRfS\nB4U+VuDAEOTKRTq6sGReniHK1PzoRvSb8nrSYJjbOJuvhUYiFYyZXb4a5anuL4+k/duAoDpwD5H9\n4gk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T08:28:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/cd18660f09a13163f0d7490922c4d58e74a8e2ef","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGNkMTg2NjBmMDlhMTMxNjNmMGQ3NDkwOTIyYzRkNThlNzRhOGUyZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e","sha":"2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/2b