 app''s Vietnamese-default\nUI silently times out instead of failing fast) as known tooling notes,\nsince Phase 5''s e2e suite will hit both again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"2306b8950a756230476f9d98df13c12df72587e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/2306b8950a756230476f9d98df13c12df72587e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2306b8950a756230476f9d98df13c12df72587e4\nparent a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790740591 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790740591 +0000\n\ndocs: mark phase 4 complete in the project plan\n\nAdd ADR-0010 (GL/trial-balance/aging computed on-demand from journal\nentries), update PLAN.md''s status line, ADR backlog, immediate-next-step,\nand progress log, and refresh CLAUDE.md''s current-status/status-of-this-\nplan/known-gaps sections for Phase 4 (O2C, Accounting, Dashboard,\nRealtime).\n\nAlso records two Playwright gotchas hit while browser-verifying this phase\n(RegExp arguments don''t survive the page.waitForFunction serialization\nboundary; asserting English strings against this app''s Vietnamese-default\nUI silently times out instead of failing fast) as known tooling notes,\nsince Phase 5''s e2e suite will hit both again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC6/kDrW\nwUgGwACC/RhOEJoVTOIE+Ey/kBO/qSl2MHgjFvKVEktdCsSDWaVmlw1akcO+si/YaRcSPwEKQZaW\npQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T03:56:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDJiY2I4ODViMWUyYzcyOGE4ZTJlOTY1MzNiYjUwYzc4OGY2NmE0M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949","sha":"a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949"}],"sha":"2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/2bcb885b1e2c728a8e2e96533bb50c788f66a43e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:45:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T03:45:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp): add Order-to-Cash, Accounting, Dashboard, and realtime routes\n\nSales: Customers list, Quotations (list/create-form/detail with send/\naccept/reject/convert-to-SO), Sales Orders (list/detail with confirm/\ncancel/deliver/create-invoice), a partial-delivery route, and Customer\nInvoices (list/detail/record-payment) plus a print-ready e-invoice preview\n(.module.scss — the project''s one deliberate SCSS usage per PLAN.md''s\nJD-mapping table — with a Vietnamese amount-in-words line and a mock XML\ndownload). One PO create -> submit -> approve -> receive -> bill -> match\n-> pay path already existed from Phase 3; this adds the matching\nQuotation -> SO -> deliver -> invoice -> pay path end to end.\n\nAccounting: a tab layout replacing the Phase-1 placeholder with Chart of\nAccounts, General Ledger (account picker + running balance), Trial\nBalance (with a balanced/out-of-balance badge), and AR/AP Aging (bucket\nsummary tiles + a shared AgingReport table).\n\nDashboard: replaces the Phase-1 placeholder with KPI tiles (revenue,\ngross margin, cash position, AR/AP outstanding, pending approvals) and\nRecharts line/bar charts (revenue vs. COGS trend, AR/AP aging by bucket)\nfed by the new GraphQL client.\n\nRealtime: a WS connection mounted once in the app shell invalidates the\nrelevant TanStack Query caches and toasts on approval.requested/decided;\nthe Stock Levels grid flashes a row and shows a \"Live\" indicator on\nstock.changed.\n\nAdds recharts (already named in PLAN.md §3) and sass (approved separately\nfor the e-invoice print stylesheet) to apps/erp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"79b8b84a8d5bcd8478971bcded6530ee6acdc2db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/79b8b84a8d5bcd8478971bcded6530ee6acdc2db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/a7605e58b4b3055b2b52a237a00f98252aae8949","verification":{"payload":"tree 79b8b84a8d5bcd8478971bcded6530ee6acdc2db\nparent 237ec20d66ae5692472e4916d622f9d1a00de669\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790739910 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790739910 +0000\n\nfeat(erp): add Order-to-Cash, Accounting, Dashboard, and realtime routes\n\nSales: Customers list, Quotations (list/create-form/detail with send/\naccept/reject/convert-to-SO), Sales Orders (list/detail with confirm/\ncancel/deliver/create-invoice), a partial-delivery route, and Customer\nInvoices (list/detail/record-payment) plus a print-ready e-invoice preview\n(.module.scss — the project''s one deliberate SCSS usage per PLAN.md''s\nJD-mapping table — with a Vietnamese amount-in-words line and a mock XML\ndownload). One PO create -> submit -> approve -> receive -> bill -> match\n-> pay path already existed from Phase 3; this adds the matching\nQuotation -> SO -> deliver -> invoice -> pay path end to end.\n\nAccounting: a tab layout replacing the Phase-1 placeholder with Chart of\nAccounts, General Ledger (account picker + running balance), Trial\nBalance (with a balanced/out-of-balance badge), and AR/AP Aging (bucket\nsummary tiles + a shared AgingReport table).\n\nDashboard: replaces the Phase-1 placeholder with KPI tiles (revenue,\ngross margin, cash position, AR/AP outstanding, pending approvals) and\nRecharts line/bar charts (revenue vs. COGS trend, AR/AP aging by bucket)\nfed by the new GraphQL client.\n\nRealtime: a WS connection mounted once in the app shell invalidates the\nrelevant TanStack Query caches and toasts on approval.requested/decided;\nthe Stock Levels grid flashes a row and shows a \"Live\" indicator on\nstock.changed.\n\nAdds recharts (already named in PLAN.md §3) and sass (approved separately\nfor the e-invoice print stylesheet) to apps/erp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKba7KgX\ndT1x6P5VBPE7XnU+JMEh0b5lYWLL6d0gGT4Mau0C+BTHaZmcEspr1/6izGA4B9ctjaeN6nhQbfTO\n8gQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T03:53:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.c