/CardFooter and a KpiTile stat-tile\nbuilt on it, for the new dashboard. DataGrid gains an optional\nrowClassName prop so a feature can flash a row on a realtime update\nwithout baking WebSocket concerns into the shared grid component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"ce9e0d188c99a0e3000dd7a45e68d81d9482278d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/ce9e0d188c99a0e3000dd7a45e68d81d9482278d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/237ec20d66ae5692472e4916d622f9d1a00de669","verification":{"payload":"tree ce9e0d188c99a0e3000dd7a45e68d81d9482278d\nparent d2b7e75c1db37a8a8584357a694ba880126ccfbe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790739888 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790739888 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): add Card, KpiTile, and DataGrid row-flash support\n\nCard/CardHeader/CardTitle/CardContent/CardFooter and a KpiTile stat-tile\nbuilt on it, for the new dashboard. DataGrid gains an optional\nrowClassName prop so a feature can flash a row on a realtime update\nwithout baking WebSocket concerns into the shared grid component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDr5RM7b\nQnBj4fr5nRsSYxB8SMGac+blV9eDBhQZDOTGBlI72N1NlF2Kj1wxvld6XKGlZK1tE9ftXM2u+tqy\n+wI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T03:53:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claud