pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/154a357012b2d792595c700b11cc156d9564f9b7","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDE1NGEzNTcwMTJiMmQ3OTI1OTVjNzAwYjExY2MxNTZkOTU2NGY5Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/c45d3c6b961d7db52ff3fa0beee75f65aaf92696","sha":"c45d3c6b961d7db52ff3fa0beee75f65aaf92696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/c45d3c6b961d7db52ff3fa0beee75f65aaf92696"}],"sha":"154a357012b2d792595c700b11cc156d9564f9b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/154a357012b2d792595c700b11cc156d9564f9b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/c45d3c6b961d7db52ff3fa0beee75f65aaf92696/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:04:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:04:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp): add purchasing feature routes for the P2P flow\n\nSuppliers list; Purchase Orders list; a 4-step PO creation wizard\n(Supplier -> Lines -> Delivery & terms -> Review) with autosaved drafts\nand both \"save as draft\" and \"create & submit\" actions; PO detail with\nstatus-conditional actions, linked GRNs/bills, and an approval-chain\ntimeline; a Goods Receipt route for partial receipt against an approved\nPO; Vendor Bill create/detail with a live three-way-match table and\nconfirm/override actions; an Approvals inbox with per-row decisions\n(reject/changes-requested prompt for a reason), bulk approve, and status\nfilters; an Audit Log viewer replacing the Admin section''s placeholder.\nA ComboboxField (built on the existing Command/Dialog primitives) backs\nthe supplier/product/PO pickers. Startup now awaits the mocked backend''s\nseed step explicitly, showing a one-time \"Preparing demo data...\" splash\ninstead of leaving it as a silent side effect of whichever query fires\nfirst. sort-params.ts moved from the inventory feature to shared/lib\nsince purchasing''s list routes need it too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"c292ba59c7fc2514d13958688f9c1ef983c2a799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/c292ba59c7fc2514d13958688f9c1ef983c2a799"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/c45d3c6b961d7db52ff3fa0beee75f65aaf92696","verification":{"payload":"tree c292ba59c7fc2514d13958688f9c1ef983c2a799\nparent 29f275f9acc462a6cf932dc2bde253f5deec8ae1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697850 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697850 +0000\n\nfeat(erp): add purchasing feature routes for the P2P flow\n\nSuppliers list; Purchase Orders list; a 4-step PO creation wizard\n(Supplier -> Lines -> Delivery & terms -> Review) with autosaved drafts\nand both \"save as draft\" and \"create & submit\" actions; PO detail with\nstatus-conditional actions, linked GRNs/bills, and an approval-chain\ntimeline; a Goods Receipt route for partial receipt against an approved\nPO; Vendor Bill create/detail with a live three-way-match table and\nconfirm/override actions; an Approvals inbox with per-row decisions\n(reject/changes-requested prompt for a reason), bulk approve, and status\nfilters; an Audit Log viewer replacing the Admin section''s placeholder.\nA ComboboxField (built on the existing Command/Dialog primitives) backs\nthe supplier/product/PO pickers. Startup now awaits the mocked backend''s\nseed step explicitly, showing a one-time \"Preparing demo data...\" splash\ninstead of leaving it as a silent side effect of whichever query fires\nfirst. sort-params.ts moved from the inventory feature to shared/lib\nsince purchasing''s list routes need it too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHz5RR9F\nStx04stwFgiz6kgtnCPTYQmOGC+ldv3efwEPLoMbc+ZH5f0ot25kyMOGlWRdeBReIXC6D6TlploO\nmwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T16:05:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"