P/commits/29f275f9acc462a6cf932dc2bde253f5deec8ae1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:03:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:03:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): add Toast, StatusBadge, Timeline, and FormKit primitives\n\nToast (Radix, zustand-backed queue so any mutation callback can fire one\nwithout prop drilling); a 5-tone StatusBadge and a Timeline for document\nactivity; FormKit — Form/FormField/FormItem/FormLabel/FormControl/\nFormMessage (shadcn''s canonical RHF-Controller pattern), Input/Textarea/\nSelect/Checkbox, a Wizard/WizardFooter/WizardDraftBanner shell with a\nuseWizardDraft autosave hook, and a LineItemsTable shell decoupled from\nuseFieldArray''s generics so callers keep their own concrete typing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"3f0c262ab71871b5211e4c546b89082500793444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/3f0c262ab71871b5211e4c546b89082500793444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/29f275f9acc462a6cf932dc2bde253f5deec8ae1","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f0c262ab71871b5211e4c546b89082500793444\nparent 753b867807ca8053b448127a2292cc710718ac59\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697828 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697828 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): add Toast, StatusBadge, Timeline, and FormKit primitives\n\nToast (Radix, zustand-backed queue so any mutation callback can fire one\nwithout prop drilling); a 5-tone StatusBadge and a Timeline for document\nactivity; FormKit — Form/FormField/FormItem/FormLabel/FormControl/\nFormMessage (shadcn''s canonical RHF-Controller pattern), Input/Textarea/\nSelect/Checkbox, a Wizard/WizardFooter/WizardDraftBanner shell with a\nuseWizardDraft autosave hook, and a LineItemsTable shell decoupled