ative-tier rule resolution, up-front\nchain materialization, halt-on-reject/changes-requested per ADR-0004); a\npure three-way-match module (cumulative-received-qty comparison, priority-\nordered status, configurable tolerance per ADR-0005); shared money\narithmetic per ADR-0003; a new approver_finance role so the brief''s 3-tier\napproval example is three different people; seed generators for 150\nsuppliers and 1,500 POs spread across every lifecycle status with matching\nGRNs/bills/approvals/journal entries; MSW handlers for the full\nsuppliers/purchase-orders/goods-receipts/vendor-bills/approvals/audit-log\nsurface and every status-transition action; IndexedDB extended to 12\nstores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"effd61811b0fa8022c8d5b271942a876a26f2094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/effd61811b0fa8022c8d5b271942a876a26f2094"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/2ad2528b32bd04b69bf1e24ef3ad7967bbe24bd6","verification":{"payload":"tree effd61811b0fa8022c8d5b271942a876a26f2094\nparent 91951ab93c63a9a659a11ccad43e02bf67de2546\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697801 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790697801 +0000\n\nfeat(contract): add procure-to-pay entities, approval engine, three-way match, and seed data\n\nSupplier/PurchaseOrder/GoodsReceipt/VendorBill/Approval/AuditLog/Journal\nentities; a pure approval engine (cumulative-tier rule resolution, up-front\nchain materialization, halt-on-reject/changes-requested per ADR-0004); a\npure three-way-match module (cumulative-received-qty comparison, priority-\nordered status, configurable tolerance per ADR-0005); shared money\narithmetic per ADR-0003; a new approver_finance role so the brief''s 3-tier\napproval example is three different people; seed generators for 150\nsuppliers and 1,500 POs spread across every li