cover them the hard way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"cbd4f5e24d6371861e3465a79fba395ba05cc8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/cbd4f5e24d6371861e3465a79fba395ba05cc8c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/0e29b217feac819b3bf01adf368717850971f9b0","verification":{"payload":"tree cbd4f5e24d6371861e3465a79fba395ba05cc8c0\nparent 657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790590012 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790590012 +0000\n\ndocs: mark phase 1 complete in the project plan\n\nUpdate PLAN.md''s progress log and CLAUDE.md''s status/commands/known-\ntooling-notes sections to reflect the landed shell, and record the\nTailwind @source, language-detector, and Intl-whitespace gotchas so a\nfuture session doesn''t have to rediscover them the hard way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG1heW2j\n9aDf1UgLjKYRf5g5c0qQj3gAvDnAJdMjU8d7ML9qkBY62fHK2vvTMhObG3a2c9svyWwK8oA0UfWD\nLwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:07:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/0e29b217feac819b3bf01adf368717850971f9b0","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDBlMjliMjE3ZmVhYzgxOWIzYmYwMWFkZjM2ODcxNzg1MDk3MWY5YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8","sha":"657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8"}],"sha":"0e29b217feac819b3bf01adf368717850971f9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/0e29b217feac819b3bf01adf368717850971f9b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:05:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:05:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test: wire up Vitest and cover this phase''s domain logic\n\nCLAUDE.md''s definition of done says tests land with the phase that\nintroduces the logic, not a later \"testing phase\" — hasPermission()\n(the wildcard/exact-match RBAC check) and the VND/number/date\nIntl formatters both qualify and had no coverage yet.\n\nCaught a real bug while writing the VND formatter test: Intl inserts\na no-break space (U+00A0) before the currency symbol, which is\nbyte-for-byte different from a regular space despite being visually\nidentical in source and terminal output — an Object.is string\ncomparison against a plain-space literal fails silently until you\nlook at code points. Normalized it explicitly in the test rather than\nassume the literal was right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"14a816990a51b57eb2484d6c54277ce1fa4b2664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/14a816990a51b57eb2484d6c54277ce1fa4b2664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 14a816990a51b57eb2484d6c54277ce1fa4b2664\nparent 8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589925 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589925 +0000\n\ntest: wire up Vitest and cover this phase''s domain logic\n\nCLAUDE.md''s definition of done says tests land with the phase that\nintroduces the logic, not a later \"testing phase\" — hasPermission()\n(the wildcard/exact-match RBAC check) and the VND/number/date\nIntl formatters both qualify and had no coverage yet.\n\nCaught a real bug while writing the VND formatter test: Intl inserts\na no-break space (U+00A0) before the currency symbol, which is\nbyte-for-byte different from a regular space despite being visually\nidentical in source and terminal output — an Object.is string\ncomparison against a plain-space literal fails silently until you\nlook at code points. Normalized it explicitly in the test rather than\nassume the literal was right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDnmn52W\n+GbJAHmyKuqhyUqM7ls1MZ2cieF1rGAyn+4iunLtYjPQohiOQYl81A/EaDk/KYbA+IK79ZSfSLdP\nGQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:07:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKDY1N2Q0NzViYTk1NjE1MWM5OGNhMjBmNTRjNGRlNmRhYWFlNWM3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c","sha":"8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c"}],"sha":"657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/657d475ba956151c98ca20f54c4de6daaae5c7f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:00:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:00:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(erp): wire MSW, TanStack Query, RBAC, and the app shell\n\nPhase 1 foundation end to end:\n\n- MSW worker boots before React renders (main.tsx); every network\n  request in the demo goes through it, per ADR-0002.\n- TanStack Query + a session query/mutations feature (features/auth)\n  consuming the new contract client.\n- RBAC primitives: useCan()/<Can> (shared/permissions) backed by the\n  session query, and requireSession/requirePermission route guards\n  that redirect to /login or /403 in a route''s beforeLoad.\n- Routing restructured into _auth (login, redirects away once a\n  session exists) and _app (session-gated shell) layouts, replacing\n  the Phase 0 placeholder route. One module route per sidebar item,\n  each gated on its own permission; purchasing/index also demonstrate\n  component-level gating via <Can>.\n- App shell: sidebar (permission-filtered nav), topbar (command\n  palette trigger, language switch, theme toggle, user menu doubling\n  as the role switcher), and a cmdk-based command palette (Ctrl/Cmd+K).\n- i18n: i18next + react-i18next, vi default per the plan (browser-\n  locale detection deliberately excluded — verified via a real\n  Playwright run that browser-locale detection was silently forcing\n  English on first load, which contradicted the \"vi default\"\n  requirement), en available, persisted only on an explicit in-app\n  switch. Intl-based VND/number/date formatters (shared/lib/format).\n- Light/dark theme tokens (index.css) with a zustand-backed toggle;\n  zustand also owns sidebar-collapsed and command-palette-open state\n  (ADR-0008). Root route gets a 404 notFoundComponent and a generic\n  errorComponent.\n- Tailwind''s content scanner doesn''t reach packages/ui from this app\n  by default; added an explicit @source so components that live there\n  (Dialog''s positioning, in particular) actually get their utility\n  classes generated. Caught by an actual Playwright run against the\n  dev server, not by lint/typecheck/build, which all stayed green\n  throughout — the command palette rendered unstyled and inline at\n  the bottom of the page until this was in place.\n\nVerified end-to-end with Playwright against the dev server: login as\neach permission tier, RBAC-filtered nav, direct-URL 403 and unknown-\nroute 404, role switch, theme + language toggles, and a full reload\nwith session/theme/language all persisting — zero console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"b75bcdc9d9720879c5edac8e0a06fee205e16f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/b75bcdc9d9720879c5edac8e0a06fee205e16f5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/8d3a3036648adfe4b4762f5bc1a3893f227c887c","verification":{"payload":"tree b75bcdc9d9720879c5edac8e0a06fee205e16f5f\nparent f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589611 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589611 +0000\n\nfeat(erp): wire MSW, TanStack Query, RBAC, and the app shell\n\nPhase 1 foundation end to end:\n\n- MSW worker boots before React renders (main.tsx); every network\n  request in the demo goes through it, per ADR-0002.\n- TanStack Query + a session query/mutations feature (features/auth)\n  consuming the new contract client.\n- RBAC primitives: useCan()/<Can> (shared/permissions) backed by the\n  session query, and requireSession/requirePermission route guards\n  that redirect to /login or /403 in a route''s beforeLoad.\n- Routing restructured into _auth (login, redirects away once a\n  session exists) and _app (session-gated shell) layouts, replacing\n  the Phase 0 placeholder route. One module route per sidebar item,\n  each gated on its own permission; purchasing/index also demonstrate\n  component-level gating via <Can>.\n- App shell: sidebar (permission-filtered nav), topbar (command\n  palette trigger, language switch, theme toggle, user menu doubling\n  as the role switcher), and a cmdk-based command palette (Ctrl/Cmd+K).\n- i18n: i18next + react-i18next, vi default per the plan (browser-\n  locale detection deliberately excluded — verified via a real\n  Playwright run that browser-locale detection was silently forcing\n  English on first load, which contradicted the \"vi default\"\n  requirement), en available, persisted only on an explicit in-app\n  switch. Intl-based VND/number/date formatters (shared/lib/format).\n- Light/dark theme tokens (index.css) with a zustand-backed toggle;\n  zustand also owns sidebar-collapsed and command-palette-open state\n  (ADR-0008). Root route gets a 404 notFoundComponent and a generic\n  errorComponent.\n- Tailwind''s content scanner doesn''t reach packages/ui from this app\n  by default; added an explicit @source so components that live there\n  (Dialog''s positioning, in particular) actually get their utility\n  classes generated. Caught by an actual Playwright run against the\n  dev server, not by lint/typecheck/build, which all stayed green\n  throughout — the command palette rendered unstyled and inline at\n  the bottom of the page until this was in place.\n\nVerified end-to-end with Playwright against the dev server: login as\neach permission tier, RBAC-filtered nav, direct-URL 403 and unknown-\nroute 404, role switch, theme + language toggles, and a full reload\nwith session/theme/language all persisting — zero console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHOeRLFw\nD+24UOIYMc/+KqUPOBL2rM5s+KkNhEdaFgSt//2uphU4CReE0JN5bR4Sn0JV7Nkh9hZW3olWdbb7\nZwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:07:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/fol