","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:59:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:59:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(ui): add shadcn-style primitives (button, dialog, dropdown-menu, command)\n\nHand-authored following shadcn/ui''s own conventions (Radix primitives\n+ CVA + tailwind-merge) rather than fighting its CLI in a sandboxed\nenvironment — same output shape, same ownership model. Button gains\nasChild (via @radix-ui/react-slot) so it can wrap a router Link\nwithout nesting a <button> inside an <a>.\n\nThese are the first real components in the shared design system\npackage; apps/erp''s app shell (next commit) is the first consumer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"d3b70a55982e52655eccb4bc18ae6fe715b8c696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/d3b70a55982e52655eccb4bc18ae6fe715b8c696"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5","verification":{"payload":"tree d3b70a55982e52655eccb4bc18ae6fe715b8c696\nparent 30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589580 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589580 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): add shadcn-style primitives (button, dialog, dropdown-menu, command)\n\nHand-authored following shadcn/ui''s own conventions (Radix primitives\n+ CVA + tailwind-merge) rather than fighting its CLI in a sandboxed\nenvironment — same output shape, same ownership model. Button gains\nasChild (via @radix-ui/react-slot) so it can wrap a router Link\nwithout nesting a <button> inside an <a>.\n\nThese are the first real components in the shared design system\npackage; apps/erp''s app shell (next commit) is the first consumer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOiEm1+Q\n3a6lhZFH0ekNnZ5a9LC46X2QaFXW+iazMl81n5bv1Ahm03hw0srDdYnAn1CHGaIZtIr30TR4an6h\nlgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T10:07:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5","node_id":"C_kwDOUvrg5doAKGY4ZmFhMmM0YzkwZDRkMmFmMzY5ZTE2MGU1NTY4YjRkNTQ2OGIxYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commit/30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae","sha":"30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae"}],"sha":"f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/f8faa2c4c90d4d2af369e160e5568b4d5468b1c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/commits/30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:59:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:59:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(contract): add session schemas, demo users, and MSW handlers\n\nZod schemas for User/Session/Role and a normalized API error shape;\nsix fixed demo personas (admin, purchasing, warehouse, accountant,\napprover_manager, approver_director) each with a permission set; a\ntyped fetch client (fetchSession/loginAs/logout) that parses every\nresponse with Zod at the boundary; and the first real MSW handlers\n(GET/POST/DELETE /api/session) backed by localStorage, including a\n422 path with Zod-derived fieldErrors to prove out the documented\nerror convention.\n\nThis is the \"packages/contract + MSW + seed + persistence proven\nend-to-end with one trivial handler\" piece of the Phase 1 exit\ncriteria (docs/PLAN.md §8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"b47ac91ff44481407c2b7dda0ec37bd3f32925ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/b47ac91ff44481407c2b7dda0ec37bd3f32925ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/30c6074d8803756af351007d8f37741141160aae","verification":{"payload":"tree b47ac91ff44481407c2b7dda0ec37bd3f32925ef\nparent 860a4c7989575090c804dbd3fd97a7ddcfdf059d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589564 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790589564 +0000\n\nfeat(contract): add session schemas, demo users, and MSW handlers\n\nZod schemas for User/Session/Role and a normalized API error shape;\nsix fixed demo personas (admin, purchasing, warehouse, accountant,\napprover_manager, approver_director) each with a permission set; a\ntyped fetch client (fetchSession/loginAs/logout) that parses every\nresponse with Zod at the boundary; and the first real MSW handlers\n(GET/POST/DELETE /api/session) backed by localStorage, including a\n422 path with Zod-derived fieldErrors to prove out the documented\nerror convention.\n\nThis is the \"packages/contract + MSW + seed + persistence proven\nend-to-end with one trivial handler\" piece of the Phase 1 exit\ncriteria (docs/PLAN.md §8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQItKzGwW\nPSdQKUuXHoIwE14HA9GjXndHWQAuw/3NpCeomJiQy7