e":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:56:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: scaffold apps/erp and apps/site\n\napps/erp: Vite + React 19 + TanStack Router (file-based routing,\nrouteTree.gen.ts committed rather than gitignored so a bare `tsc`\ntypecheck works without running vite first) + Tailwind v4. The\nplaceholder route imports CONTRACT_VERSION from @mekong-erp/contract\nto prove workspace package resolution end to end.\n\napps/site: Next.js 16 App Router with output: ''export'' (ADR-0006),\nminimal placeholder page.\n\npackages/contract and packages/ui are intentionally near-empty for\nnow (real content starts Phase 1) but wired up as source-consumed\nworkspace packages so the monorepo''s cross-package resolution is\nproven before real feature work begins.\n\napps/site/AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are Next.js''s own generated\nagent-guidance files (same mechanism as the root AGENTS.md), kept\ncommitted per their own instructions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKSC1QY5zQAERZT3wGFAv1","tree":{"sha":"023ffa2520702df0da60a3299809371f2a3532c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/trees/023ffa2520702df0da60a3299809371f2a3532c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/Mekong-ERP/git/commits/ab162054a3ddc05c92b519206225bc48a7a8d262","verification":{"payload":"tree 023ffa2520702df0da60a3299809371f2a3532c6\nparent 88fb6501e247a0a8c11f60543ff88ca1b2d3ae5b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790585770 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790585770 +0000\n\nfeat: scaffold apps/erp and apps/site\n\napps/erp: Vite + React 19 + TanStack Router (file-based routing,\nrouteTree.gen.ts committed rather than gitignored so a bare `tsc`\ntypecheck works without running vite first) + Tailwind v4. The\nplaceholder route imports CONTRACT_VERSION from @mekong-erp/contract\nto prove workspace package resolution