ero), image scan (open), ...\n- Limitations: free-edition product limits + Windows findings\n- Recommendation: Conditional Go, 7 conditions (Docker licence or JAR route, image scan,\n  10 green runs on the real agent with pwsh, ownership/versioning, error examples and a\n  test-data plan, licence-expiry plan, messaging/auth/RBAC via integration tests) and\n  No-Go triggers\n- Rerun-from-scratch: contracts v1.2, prerequisites incl. Node and shell, one-command path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc9f5d26c1bdc8a5f27bcad59140450e9195f370","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/trees/bc9f5d26c1bdc8a5f27bcad59140450e9195f370"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/commits/9cb731d542285f427100f8de3f5bb7c0ec54f5a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202779810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823","id":202779810,"login":"Raghul5823","node_id":"U_kgDODBYsog","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/commit/9cb731d542285f427100f8