every case of\n  Phases 3-7 from a clean start (env, contracts, case1-3, MFE, pipeline gates), continues\n  after failures, always cleans up; exit 0 only if every expected result happened\n- One self-contained HTML report (inline CSS/JS, data embedded): verdict, tiles, a section\n  per case (what it proves, pairs, tests, API coverage, details), break-demo matrix,\n  coverage table, raw links, previous runs; history kept (last 10), evidence/sample/ committed\n- Break demos (27, Phases 3-7) run live in a throwaway copy under %TEMP%; both repos\n  verified unchanged (file list + content fingerprint); node_modules junction removed safely\n- Output redirect PROTO_RESULTS_DIR so results/ is never touched; parsers for JUnit, TRX and\n  Specmatic''s coverage table; no new packages\n- Runs: 1 PASS (13.2 min), 2 FAIL 26/27 (PowerShell 5.1 strips inner quotes of a JSON arg:\n  case3-drift now posts from a file), 3 PASS 27/27 (25.4 min)\n- Fixes found on the way: consumer break demos filtered per interaction, 4 TRX files were\n  invalid XML, sample azure-pipelines.yml was invalid YAML; samples use bash: everywhere\n- Shell pinning guidance (real-project guide 3.8/3.9, limitations table)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d96fa9d01b30738e95f48d875202e5671e179d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/trees/0d96fa9d01b30738e95f48d875202e5671e179d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/commits/f23824ba8a76b6fbec9b02dbb5854aadc5911b5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202779810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g