lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/commits/1480c69479be00f25e5596f1628b3036fec8f97a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:51:07Z","email":"raghulsri66@gmail.com","name":"Raghul Sridhar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T06:51:07Z","email":"raghulsri66@gmail.com","name":"Raghul Sridhar"},"message":"Phase 7: real-project guide (system patterns + best practices)\n\n- docs/real-project-guide.md: prototype system design, a table of 25 system patterns\n  (where each is in the prototype and why it matters), and recommendations for a real\n  project: ownership (QA owns standards), pinned tags + drift run against main,\n  test data (in-memory ContractTest mode vs Testcontainers; seeding always needed),\n  auth (test auth handler in ContractTest mode; real tokens, s2s and RBAC via\n  integration/API tests), monorepo frontends (client library per API, build targets,\n  affected-only runs), stage mapping, exit criterion (N green runs on the real agent),\n  what contract tests don''t cover (real-time, messaging)\n- README and application guide link to it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58f347f9b8d30ddf7211888a3968771f3646803a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/trees/58f347f9b8d30ddf7211888a3968771f3646803a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/commits/1480c69479be00f25e5596f1628b3036fec8f97a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202779810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/events{/p