ble change exit 0, breaking change exit 1,\n  also against tags v1 / v1.1 (T1 closed: real gate in the free edition)\n- Drift both ways: provider drift only caught by the provider test (consumer green,\n  real call 502); contract drift rejected against the consumer''s examples\n- Stub logs saved as .log.txt so the evidence can be committed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87e49d11febd8007812e674a2a68a8c69b3d9ce4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/trees/87e49d11febd8007812e674a2a68a8c69b3d9ce4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/commits/5f369a3ddbcb0847bdab23df7c213408a17ce190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202779810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823","id":202779810,"login":"Raghul5823","node_id":"U_kgDODBYsog","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/commit/5f369a3ddbcb0847bdab23df7c213408a17ce190","node_id":"C_kwDOUvy0NdoAKDVmMzY5YTNkZGJjYjA4NDdiZGFiMjNkZjdjMjEzNDA4YTE3Y2UxOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"