equest (5)\n- Recording handler proves the exact bearer token (T5); stub only checks the format\n- Provider tests: well-registry 15/15 (100%), approval 6/6 (43%)\n- 6 break experiments on both sides, all caught, revert verified by checksums\n- README: Phase 4 log, Case 2 table, Pact comparison; docs/APPLICATION-GUIDE.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93788ef1fc794c23fe935e01715bcbea836ccf38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/trees/93788ef1fc794c23fe935e01715bcbea836ccf38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/git/commits/88f472030370cc7c0d9693058aa6d9d6ab2dd6b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202779810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823","id":202779810,"login":"Raghul5823","node_id":"U_kgDODBYsog","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Raghul5823","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Raghul5823/specmatic-prototype/commit/88f472030370cc7c0d9693058aa6d9d6ab2dd6b6","node_id":"C_kwDOUvy0NdoAKDg4ZjQ3MjAzMDM3MGNjN2MwZDk2OTMwNThhYTZkOWQ2YWIyZGQ2YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/R