//api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/commits/274a2a0399fc7106143355b74cc182256dcadd9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:39:06Z","email":"gastonleovillalba@gmail.com","name":"Gastón"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:39:06Z","email":"gastonleovillalba@gmail.com","name":"Gastón"},"message":"feat(windows): thread windows to their opener and switch with Alt+arrows\n\nA window opened from another one (Ctrl+click or gf) is placed to its\nright and remembers it in openedFrom. A thread leaves the opener through\na connector on its right edge and enters the opened window through a\nconnector on its left edge. The active window''s threads are drawn above\nevery window; clicking a connector shows or hides that window''s threads.\n\nAlt+Left and Alt+Right cycle through windows, Alt+Up and Alt+Down follow\nthe thread, and the keyboard focus moves into the target editor.\n\nAlso fix minimized windows coming back at minimum size: the resize\nobserver stored the 0x0 size of the detached element.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ecf6766ed2fbb4abbb7053bcb15d616273b305c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/trees/ecf6766ed2fbb4abbb7053bcb15d616273b305c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/commits/274a2a0399fc7106143355b74cc182256dcadd9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231492281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo","id":231492281,"login":"gasleo","node_id":"U_kgDODcxKuQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo/corcho-code/commit/274a2a0399fc7106143355b74cc182256dcadd9e","node_id":"C_kwDOUwVB49oAKDI3NGEyYTAzOTlmYzcxMDYxNDMzNTViNzRjYzE4MjI1NmRjYWRkOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo/corcho-code/commit/eb8ef5f4ee30ba6b838d15182963ae879bb5a5db","sha":"eb8ef5f4ee30ba6b838d15182963ae879bb5a5db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/commits/eb8ef5f4ee30ba6b838d15182963ae879bb5a5db"}],"sha":"274a2a0399fc7106143355b74cc182256dcadd9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/commits/274a2a0399fc7106143355b74cc182256dcadd9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231492281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo","id":231492281,"login":"gasleo","node_id":"U_kgDODcxKuQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/commits/eb8ef5f4ee30ba6b838d15182963ae879bb5a5db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:34:14Z","email":"gastonleovillalba@gmail.com","name":"Gastón"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:34:14Z","email":"gastonleovillalba@gmail.com","name":"Gastón"},"message":"feat(vim): add text objects, find motions, dot repeat and more\n\n- Text objects iw/aw/iW/aW, quotes and brackets, usable with any\n  operator and in visual mode.\n- f/F/t/T with ; and ,, W/B/E, { } paragraphs and % bracket matching.\n- . repeats the last change, including inserted text.\n- > and < indent operators, ~, X, Y, S, counted r, Ctrl+A/Ctrl+X,\n  ? search and * / #, visual o and p.\n- Undo takes back a whole insert at once; new lines keep indentation;\n  cw no longer eats the trailing space.\n- gt/gT and :bn/:bp ask the app for the next or previous window.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"004bbd48c3a675cff6ed59469ae8fffee329571d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/trees/004bbd48c3a675cff6ed59469ae8fffee329571d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/commits/eb8ef5f4ee30ba6b838d15182963ae879bb5a5db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231492281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo","id":231492281,"login":"gasleo","node_id":"U_kgDODcxKuQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com