,"email":"gastonleovillalba@gmail.com","name":"Gastón"},"message":"feat(preview): provide the project''s Redux store automatically\n\nWhen the project depends on react-redux, find the store it exports\n(configureStore/createStore) and any custom context passed to\n<Provider context={...}>, and wrap the previewed component with them,\nlike the automatic MemoryRouter. Skipped when a corcho.preview.tsx\ndecorator provides its own providers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0cb0c533bf4a7ffb024ec2dc42af09b32f24933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/trees/d0cb0c533bf4a7ffb024ec2dc42af09b32f24933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gasleo/corcho-code/git/commits/9d398d541cea536a44c510ea1f90e41d616e7196","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231492281?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo","id":231492281,"login":"gasleo","node_id":"U_kgDODcxKuQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gasleo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gasleo/corcho-code/commit/9d398d541cea536a44c510ea1f90e41d616e7196","node_id":"C_kwDOUwVB49oAKDlkMzk4ZDU0MWNlYTUzNmE0NGM1MTBlYTFmOTBlNDFkNjE2ZTcxOTY","parents":[{"html_url