ithub.com/users/peterlonnquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/peterlonnquist","id":653820,"login":"peterlonnquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzgyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/commits/411db3f16062bd25497ee67adeaf16d4a0f7c1ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:22:22Z","email":"peterlonnquist@gmail.com","name":"Peter Lönnqvist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T06:22:22Z","email":"peterlonnquist@gmail.com","name":"Peter Lönnqvist"},"message":"Proxy /gateway/<service> to local backend microservices in dev\n\nServices call the same relative URL as in test (/gateway/profile/api/v1/...),\nwhere the gateway shares the page''s origin. Locally the dev proxy strips\n/gateway and forwards to localhost:<port>, with the dev user headers, so no\nper-environment base URL is needed.\n\nThe proxy and dev-users.json move to tools/dev-proxy and every app''s dev\nserver uses them, so /gateway also works when a remote runs standalone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed50bae62c957960dc777c270eec408d822d573f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/git/trees/ed50bae62c957960dc777c270eec408d822d573f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/git/commits/411db3f16062bd25497ee67adeaf16d4a0f7c1ad","verifica