om/users/peterlonnquist/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/peterlonnquist","id":653820,"login":"peterlonnquist","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzgyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/commits/baa127d9218425c4188ae11f5a84d676a1115791/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:20:25Z","email":"peterlonnquist@gmail.com","name":"Peter Lönnqvist"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:20:25Z","email":"peterlonnquist@gmail.com","name":"Peter Lönnqvist"},"message":"Lint layout-api again: rename inferred eslint target to \"lint\"\n\nAdding @nx/node registered the @nx/eslint plugin with targetName\n\"eslint:lint\", so `nx run-many -t lint` (npm run lint, CI) silently\nskipped layout-api and every other project got a duplicate target.\nInferring it as \"lint\" merges with the explicit targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1011c513918bf3ad9d651350bb36440df3180e9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/git/trees/1011c513918bf3ad9d651350bb36440df3180e9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/peterlonnquist/nx-ng-microfrontend/git/commits/baa127d9218425c4188ae11f5a84d676a1115791","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/653820?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterlonnquist/event