ise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/b451cfe3212cc9dc8f683fb24349424d6d7eebdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:52:42Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:52:42Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(deploy): add the image, the NGINX config, the compose and the smoke checks\n\ndeploy/Dockerfile builds the shell with Node 22 (npm ci) and serves it\nwith nginx:1.27-alpine; the Vite variables are build arguments and\nVITE_DEV_LOGIN defaults to false so an image built without arguments\nnever carries the development sign-in (norm 5.5.2). deploy/nginx.conf\nserves the SPA with index.html fallback, never caches index.html,\nremoteEntry.js or the mock worker, caches /assets for a year, answers\n/health and sets the basic security headers. deploy/compose.yml is what\nqone-infra includes: build with the environment variables, platform\nnetwork, FRONT_PORT published for develop, healthcheck.\ndeploy/smoke.sh checks health, SPA fallback, the cache rules and the\nabsence of the development sign-in; ci.yml gains an image job that\nbuilds, runs and smoke-checks the container. README documents it.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#35, code-corhuila/qone-docs#36","tree":{"sha":"5f34242b71b2fa47430d9a33f9fd61d8e17ecbd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/trees/5f34242b71b2fa47430d9a33f9fd61d8e17ecbd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/commits/b451cfe3212cc9dc8f683fb24349424d6d7eebdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/qone-front/commit/b451cfe3212cc9dc8f683fb24349424d6d7eebdd","node_id":"C_kwDOUwiGj9oAKGI0NTFjZmUzMjEyY2M5ZGM4ZjY4M2ZiMjQzNDk0MjRkNmQ3ZWViZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/qone-front/commit/404ef47e5bec9efc04f76f667203a3941a78ecf0","sha":"404ef47e5bec9efc04f76f667203a3941a78ecf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/404ef47e5bec9efc04f76f667203a3941a78ecf0"}],"sha":"b451cfe3212cc9dc8f683fb24349424d6d7eebdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/b451cfe3212cc9dc8f683fb24349424d6d7eebdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi