/api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/404ef47e5bec9efc04f76f667203a3941a78ecf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:46:32Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:46:32Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(shell): add the layout, the remotes registry, RemoteBoundary and the 404\n\nShell renders the brand, the main navigation with one link per portal\nthe role may open (from remotes/registry.ts), the person and the\nsign-out, and the page in the main landmark. PortalPage loads a portal\nwhen its route opens: registers the remote from VITE_REMOTE_<NAME>_URL,\nimports <portal>/App and renders it in Suspense inside RemoteBoundary,\nwhose notice and retry replace only that area when the remote is\nmissing, fails to load or throws (Annex H). NotFound answers unknown\nroutes. The identity fixtures become the nine people of the prototype\nseed with digit-only student codes. Thirteen tests written first.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#38","tree":{"sha":"e1efd7a8dc02fea78a1d1c5c282d60bb40e15147","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/trees/e1efd7a8dc02fea78a1d1c5c282d60bb40e15147"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/commits/404ef47e5bec9efc04f76f667203a3941a78ecf0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522