zations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/c8cdb5d083498bf893fb7bb74b1d001df58ed9fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:51:16Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:51:16Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(core): add the shared HTTP client of the container\n\napiClient sends relative paths to the gateway with JSON, the bearer\ntoken when a session exists, a fresh X-Correlation-Id per request and\nthe Idempotency-Key a creation gives; enforces the 10 s per-request\nbudget (TIMEOUT, status 0) and reports network failures (NETWORK);\nturns the common envelope into ApiError with code, traceId and the\nmessage decided in errors.ts; ends the session on any 401; returns\nundefined for 204; refuses absolute URLs so a portal can only know\nrelative paths (norm 5.4.1, Annex H). Eight tests written first run in\nthe Node environment against MSW.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#37, code-corhuila/qone-docs#38","tree":{"sha":"6ec21c95f4432f5b16d4c4b741cf9269bc163668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/trees/6ec21c95f4432f5b16d4c4b741cf9269bc163668"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/commits/c8cdb5d083498bf893fb7bb74b1d001df58ed9fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"