_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/commits/dbcd90716eba13c6378f948b9256829297bf309b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:51:13Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:51:13Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(core): add the error envelope, the session store and the identity mocks\n\nerrors.ts holds the common envelope of the norm as ApiError and the\none place that decides the message a person reads per status and code\n(Annex H). session.ts is the only holder of the token: reads the RS256\nclaims for display and expiry (sub and exp required, as every service\nvalidates), persists in localStorage, restores at boot discarding an\nexpired token, and notifies subscribers of every change. config.ts\nreads the three variables of the container.\n\nMSW is set up for tests (Node server) with the identity handlers\n(login, users/me, health) and fixtures that are the seed of\nqone-identity-db per ADR-009. Tests were written first: 15 for the\nerrors, 9 for the session.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#37","tree":{"sha":"676b630834c4143dbd4cbbdceb269a28f10a3474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/trees/676b630834c4143dbd4cbbdceb269a28