","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:39:49Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(shell): scaffold the container with strict TypeScript, Vitest and CI\n\nVite 7 + React 19 + TypeScript strict, the Module Federation plugin\nconfigured as the shell (loaded-first, no exposes yet), Vitest with\nTesting Library and jsdom, the first test written before the component\n(the shell renders its heading inside a main landmark), .env.example\nwith the three variables the container reads, .gitignore for secrets\nand build output, ci.yml (typecheck, tests, build, and the check that a\nbuild for main carries no development sign-in), the pull request\ntemplate of Annex I and a README with purpose, how to run and\ndependencies (norm 5.1).\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#38, code-corhuila/qone-docs#36","tree":{"sha":"24f9ef0cbbbecadda941e247d35b9bcac23a8f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/trees/24f9ef0cbbbecadda941e247d35b9bcac23a8f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-front/git/commits/527a1f966f358eebccaafecad33f4dd221d7107c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dark