9-28T15:57:30Z","email":"rajsingh704596@gmail.com","name":"Raj"},"message":"feat: set up React microfrontend architecture\n\n- Added Host application as the main shell application on port 3000\n- Added Products as a remote microfrontend on port 3001\n- Added Cart as a remote microfrontend on port 3002\n- Added Shared module for common dependencies (reusable code)\n- Configured Vite for each application\n- Configured Module Federation for remote applications to load Products and Cart from Host\n- Configured fixed ports and strict port handling for Host, Products, and Cart\n- Added shared React and React DOM dependencies as singleton shared dependencies\n- Added initial project structure and dependencies, TypeScript configuration for each application","tree":{"sha":"64be26a0ce950cb4e4667d299913d55848ebf8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajsingh704596/react-microfrontend-frontend-system-design/git/trees/64be26a0ce950cb4e4667d299913d55848ebf8ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajsingh704596/react-microfrontend-frontend-system-design/git/commits/fd1018e7ab91c67912039e364cf0f06778a9b753","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75978442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajsingh704596","id":75978442,"login":"Rajsingh704596","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTc4NDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajsingh704596/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https