github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commits/59505a4a9268b923781aed5691e43f49b539fbe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:22:36Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:22:36Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(catalog): add the admin form that creates a subject with prerequisites\n\nNewSubjectPage, behind RequireRole(ADMIN), creates a subject with code,\nname, credits, semester and prerequisites chosen from the existing\nsubjects (HU-CAT-001). Annex H form rules: a label per field, client\nvalidation with the error beside the field (aria-describedby,\naria-invalid), server VALIDATION_ERROR details mapped to their fields,\nbusiness rules (INV-SUB-001, INV-SUB-002) shown as the form error with\nthe traceId, the button disabled while pending, and one Idempotency-Key\nper intention reused on retry and renewed after success\n(useIdempotencyKey). RequireRole reads the role from shell/session.\nThe MSW handler of CA-03 validates fields, uniqueness and prerequisites\nand records the new subject. Eleven tests written first.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#39","tree":{"sha":"b4a757622e036b734fc84ed02937c8296da3d476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/trees/b4a757622e036b734fc84ed02937c8296da3d476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/commits/59505a4a9268b923781aed5691e43f49b539fbe2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gist