 Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:11:30Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(catalog): add the subjects list and the subject detail with its sections\n\nSubjectsPage lists the pensum paginated with the contract page and\nlimit, filters by semester and renders the four states of Annex H\n(loading, error with the traceId and a retry, empty, data); a page or\nfilter change replaces the previous request. SubjectPage shows one\nsubject with its prerequisites linked and the sections of the current\nterm with professor, schedule and the seats chip (full, few,\navailable); the two requests keep their own state. The exposed App\nroutes its index to the list and :code to the detail. Ten component\ntests written first.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#41","tree":{"sha":"bf5d7a195a0a7e78dd54306e7819d12855ac7674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/trees/bf5d7a195a0a7e78dd54306e7819d12855ac7674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/commits/9119a57044f3309ca7086234eb9c74f1e2b1c6a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commit/9119a57044f3309ca7086234eb9c74f1e2b1c6a8","node_id":"C_kwDOUwih0toAKDkxMTlhNTcwNDRmMzMwOWNhNzA4NjIzNGViOWM3NGYxZTJiMWM2YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commit/801dd7deb0dd47a1c875581deb416a7717b84c17","sha":"801dd7deb0dd47a1c875581deb416a7717b84c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commits/801dd7deb0dd47a1c875581deb416a7717b84c17"}],"sha":"9119a57044f3309ca7086234eb9c74f1e2b1c6a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commits/9119a57044f3309ca7086234eb9c74f1e2b1c6a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DarksChoise","id":86198522,"login":"DarksChoise","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTk4NTIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commits/801dd7deb0dd47a1c875581deb416a7717b84c17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:11:27Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:11:27Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(catalog): add the data layer - contract types, typed api, request hook, synthetic data\n\nmodel/catalog.ts copies the types of qone-catalog-api.yaml (Subject,\nSection, Slot, Page<T> with data and meta) plus the seats level and\nslot formatting helpers; api/catalogApi.ts makes the typed calls over\nshell/apiClient with relative paths and an Idempotency-Key per creation\n(CA-02..CA-09); hooks/useRequest.ts is the one request state every\nview renders (loading, error with retry, data) where a newer request\nreplaces the older through AbortSignal. MSW handlers and fixtures are\nthe fourteen subjects and eleven sections of the prototype seed.\n\nContracts are synced copies from qone-docs (scripts/sync-contracts.sh,\nSOURCE records ref and commit) because the documentation repository is\nprivate; the contract test validates every fixture and page against\nthem with Ajv. Tests written first: 6 api, 4 hook, 4 contract.\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#41","tree":{"sha":"74603f836b1ec2a5f91a4f5aee1f94c66ad26f8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/trees/74603f836b1ec2a5f91a4f5aee1f94c66ad26f8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/commits/801dd7deb0dd47a1c875581deb416a7717b84c17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86198522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/D