arksChoise/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarksChoise","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/commits/59680df3df993b1cddb66023239be32051b35dd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:01:49Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:02:16Z","email":"86198522+DarksChoise@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juan Diego Andrade Cardozo"},"message":"feat(portal): scaffold the catalog remote with strict TypeScript, Vitest and CI\n\nVite 7 + React 19 + TypeScript strict; the Module Federation plugin\nconfigured as the remote \"catalog\" that exposes ./App and consumes the\nshell at VITE_SHELL_URL (the only URL the portal knows, norm 5.4.1);\nshell/apiClient and shell/session typed by hand in shell.d.ts and\nresolved to test stubs in test mode so the portal is tested in\nisolation against MSW. First test written before App.tsx. .env.example\nwith the one variable, ci.yml (typecheck, tests, build and the\nisolation check that greps the built chunks for a gateway URL, token\nhandling or raw fetch), the pull request template of Annex I, a README\nwith purpose, how to run and dependencies (norm 5.1).\n\nRefs code-corhuila/qone-docs#41","tree":{"sha":"fdf9daf49367abbcfdf3bd8e138d868f5c43d511","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/trees/fdf9daf49367abbcfdf3bd8e138d868f5c43d511"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/qone-catalog-portal/git/commits/59680df3df993b1cddb66023239be32051b35dd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":n