0-03T12:00:41Z","email":"manos.zalokostas@gmail.com","name":"manos-zalokostas"},"message":"#GEMINI | CONTRIBUTION:: FLOW \"UPDATE\"\n=============================================================\nFEAT(multipart): complete full CRUD lifecycle with multipart PUT update flow\n---------------\nImplements the end-to-end multipart entity update flow, resolving\nthe remaining lifecycle boundary for file-bearing residents (SAM).\n\nKey mechanical additions:\n- back: introduce @Put(PATH.MULTI_ID) in BaseController to handle\n  differential file replacement, unlinking superseded files while\n  protecting default templates.\n- back: integrate Validation.loose to support partial scalar updates\n  without schema violation.\n- front: generalize httpServer.streamProxy to dynamically forward PUT\n  streams via Node fetch half-duplex piping.\n- front: add PUT handler to api/[tool_id]/multipart/[id]/+server.js.\n- front: update R2wxInputFile to maintain read-only download links while\n  exposing the file input during edits, isolating DOM attributes (inputCurr)\n  to prevent InvalidStateError and contextualizing requiredness.\n\nCo-authored-by: Gemini (Google AI) <gemini-assistant@google.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9930e639b8877562a21bc247a1708eea972af13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manos-zalokostas/R2WX/git/trees/e9930e639b8877562a21bc247a1708eea972af13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manos-zalokostas/R2WX/git/commits/7baf7acff6cba0943de6a1c81ae82ba138c108d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7241065?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manos-zalokostas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manos-zalokostas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manos-zalokostas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manos-zalokostas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur