.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commits/de235042cc1f341da4a8286dc4541816cbe5086e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:20:02Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T19:20:02Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(typing): agregar autenticación y completar CI y estilos del frontend\n\nAutenticación (API y hub):\n- Auth:Mode=Auth0 (por defecto) valida los JWT del tenant del proyecto;\n  el jugador es el claim sub. En el hub el token viaja en ?access_token=.\n- Auth:Mode=Development (solo Development y Testing) acepta la identidad\n  de X-Dev-User o ?dev_user= para trabajar con el Shell simulado. Fuera\n  de esos entornos la API no arranca.\n- El hub rechaza actuar en nombre de otro jugador, y solo los jugadores\n  de la partida pueden enviar métricas o terminarla.\n- POST /results exige el permiso games.typing.results.write.\n  games.typing.play es opcional (Auth:RequiredPermission).\n- El microfrontend envía el token si el Shell agrega getAccessToken() al\n  contexto; si no, envía la identidad de desarrollo codificada.\n\nEstilos (ADR-003 §8):\n- Todas las clases llevan el prefijo typing-game- y las variables pasan\n  de :root a .typing-game, para no alterar el layout del Shell.\n- Stylelint pasa de 818 errores a 0, así que npm test ya corre completo.\n- Verificado en el Shell real comparando los estilos calculados antes y\n  después: sin cambios visuales.\n\nCI y configuración:\n- Nuevo job \"Frontend (Aurelia)\": Node 24 desde .nvmrc, npm ci, lint,\n  build y pruebas.\n- La URL de la API se fija al compilar con TYPING_API_URL (por defecto\n  http://localhost:5015).\n\nPruebas: backend con 85 unitarias y 25 de integración (11 nuevas de\nautenticación, incluidos JWT firmados); frontend con 13. Todas en verde.\nLa prueba del hub se adaptó a una conexión por jugador.\n\nDocs: README (autenticación, frontend, integración), docs/api-resultados.md\ny docs/api-typing-hub.md.","tree":{"sha":"404b3c72ca70b418687a849b1dce150b27d74b6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/trees/404b3c72ca70b418687a849b1dce150b27d74b6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/commits/de235042cc1f341da4a8286dc4541816cbe5086e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commit/de235042cc1f341da4a8286dc4541816cbe5086e","node_id":"C_kwDOUxAKPdoAKGRlMjM1MDQyY2MxZjM0MWRhNGE4Mjg2ZGM0NTQxODE2Y2JlNTA4NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commit/705041800c5edd0ec4f3897ba337f2b3303215ae","sha":"705041800c5edd0ec4f3897ba337f2b3303215ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commits/705041800c5edd0ec4f3897ba337f2b3303215ae"}],"sha":"de235042cc1f341da4a8286dc4541816cbe5086e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commits/de235042cc1f341da4a8286dc4541816cbe5086e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/commits/705041800c5edd0ec4f3897ba337f2b3303215ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:36:34Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:36:34Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(typing): integrar con el Shell y Matchmaking y corregir la partida\n\nPartida (hub):\n- Unirse crea el estado de la partida y fija su inicio. Antes nadie la\n  creaba y todo JoinMatch fallaba. No se puede entrar a una partida ya\n  terminada.\n- El servidor calcula el puntaje si el cliente no lo envía\n  (TypingScore: velocidad x precisión x 10).\n- \"already_exists\" se envía solo a quien lo pidió, sin pisar el\n  resultado que ven los demás.\n\nMicrofrontend:\n- El temporizador corre desde start() y se reanuda después de pause().\n- Al acabarse el tiempo envía las métricas finales y llama a EndMatch.\n- Completar el texto congela las métricas y bloquea la escritura.\n- El área de escritura ya no empieza con espacios invisibles.\n- Integración con el Shell según ADR-003: mf-shared.js común, sin alias\n  de desarrollo, uniqueName, Node 24 y @aurelia/ts-jest exacta.\n\nMatchmaking (ADR-004):\n- Aviso de fin de partida POST /api/matches/{matchId}/finish en segundo\n  plano, con token M2M de Auth0 y reintentos ante errores temporales.\n  Inactivo mientras Matchmaking:BaseUrl esté vacío.\n\nConfiguración y documentación:\n- CORS permite el origen del Shell (http://localhost:4000).\n- README y docs/api-typing-hub.md: integración con los otros equipos y\n  variables de Matchmaking.\n\nPruebas: backend con 72 unitarias y 14 de integración, frontend con 10,\ntodas en verde. Probado en local con el Shell real: carga, partida\ncompleta, fin automático, resultado guardado e historial.","tree":{"sha":"8c3c03e72749d1aa2fe21a8a46a1df5c4bdb0173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/trees/8c3c03e72749d1aa2fe21a8a46a1df5c4bdb0173"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/commits/705041800c5edd0ec4f3897ba337f2b3303215ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/