me":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(results): agregar API de resultados, historial y estadísticas con MySQL\n\nImplementa la API REST mínima de 04-persistencia-y-api-juegos.md bajo\n/api/games/typing: POST /results, GET /results/{matchId},\nGET /players/{userId}/history y GET /players/{userId}/stats.\n\n- Persistencia en MySQL con EF Core (ADR-005), proveedor oficial\n  MySql.EntityFrameworkCore 10 y migración inicial.\n- Ids con intercalación utf8mb4_bin (los de Auth0 distinguen mayúsculas).\n- Fechas en UTC con sufijo Z; un resultado por matchId (409 si se repite).\n- IResultsService reutilizable desde el hub /hubs/typing.\n- /health con comprobación de MySQL, CORS configurable y docker-compose\n  con MySQL 8.4 para desarrollo.","tree":{"sha":"1d83c0dbca3c3634740506b415a08e3cd8d903e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/trees/1d83c0dbca3c3634740506b415a08e3cd8d903e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Johanaaguero/battlehub-game-typing/git/commits/1c7bc0c2fd21cbd1675497389dae10bc865e009d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/